	quest.0064985C13F5C416.quest_desc: ["Collect various guns, some fried chicken and EVERY kind of burger!"]
	quest.0064985C13F5C416.title: "/gamemode american"
	quest.0075009DEEA010B7.quest_desc: [
		"Get your war on..."
		"...and invite your friends!"
		""
		"This beast sports room for four, three engines, two weapon slots, and adequate space for your battle supplies or hauling your winner's booty back to base."
		""
		"An upgraded airship, with heaps of storage space."
		""
		"Good for hauling loads of loot and ore back home."
		""
		"It's also perfect for those hankering for the nomadic life-style."
	]
	quest.0075009DEEA010B7.quest_subtitle: "Do I hear, \"Ride of the Valkyries\"?"
	quest.0089B6C20C45DDCA.quest_desc: ["The smeltery applies Fortune IV when smelting ores! "]
	quest.0089B6C20C45DDCA.quest_subtitle: "Fortune IV"
	quest.008D186B4E0ED14F.quest_desc: [
		"The Steam Oven is another machine that uses Steam for something useful."
		""
		"By putting Steam into the Steam Oven it will act as a furnace to any items in it. "
		""
		"Making Ingots from Ores and cooking food items."
		""
		"It's a 2x2x2 machine of Steam Oven blocks."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/rail_oven.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.00A3AD4BD4EE0FC7.quest_desc: [
		"The Guard Tower will employ and house one Guard to protect your colony. Your citizens will appreciate a well guarded colony. A general rule of thumb is two guards for every three citizens."
		""
		"Guards sleep in guard dowers, freeing up the bed they previously occupied in a residence or tavern allowing you to recruit new colonists. "
		""
		"Tip: You can expand your colony border by building and leveling up guard towers."
	]
	quest.00A3AD4BD4EE0FC7.quest_subtitle: "Build a Guard Tower and Hire a Guard"
	quest.020E6AF37A0421C8.quest_desc: [
		"The Water Tank is like having a barrel outside."
		""
		"Just this barrel is much bigger. "
		""
		"It collects water and can hold water for Steam Locomotives."
		""
		"The amount of water is makes is dependent on the biome and visible to the sky."
		""
		"It's made by a 3x3x3 Water Tank blocks with the center being hollow."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/rail_tank.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.02E4DC8A55EA08FD.quest_desc: ["The Netherite Upgrade offers the highest storage capacity available. &664x&r capacity to be exact. It is intended for endgame storage solutions where efficiency and scale matter most."]
	quest.02F2DF9D9DA7833A.quest_desc: [
		"To extract captive &9Corrupt Souls&r, an artisan must first delve into the arts of weapon &5Enchanting&r."
		""
		"You must imbue your blade with the rare &5Soul Looting Enchantment&r, which grants a static chance to manifest a floating soul entity each time a monster is struck down."
		""
		"Once the spirit breaks free into the physical realm, you must quickly strike it down to claim it as a physical item."
		""
		"Execute your strikes with haste, as these fleeting phantoms will rapidly ascend and fly away into the atmosphere."
	]
	quest.02F2DF9D9DA7833A.title: "&5Soul Looting Enchantment"
	quest.030E1901DF02E65F.quest_desc: [
		"Manually hauling and cataloging loose chalk variants, tallow candles, calcified skulls, and attuned crystals for every geometric layout creates severe logistical clutter in your field inventory. To streamline your construction workflows, you must fabricate a specialized Ritual Satchel."
		""
		"By executing a sneak-right-click action while holding the satchel in your hand, you can open its internal storage matrix to load it with all necessary ritual construction supplies."
		""
		"Once your inventory is stored, simply right-click any active holographic preview block generated by your guidebook. The satchel will interface with the projection, initiating a slow, automated assembly process that automatically draws and installs every required rune and decoration directly into the world."
		""
		"To monitor tool integrity without opening the GUI, observe the bag's visual state: if any internal chalk drop below 40% durability, the satchel's active enchantment glint will extinguish. This serves as a vital physical diagnostic signal indicating that your components require immediate repair or replacement."
	]
	quest.030E1901DF02E65F.quest_subtitle: "Advanced material loading and automated rune placement"
	quest.030E1901DF02E65F.title: "Automated Geometry: The Ritual Satchel"
	quest.032B654201E71618.quest_desc: [
		"These &cTrack Kits&r are for using entities with your &7Carts&r (Entities aka Mobs)."
		""
		"The &cEmbarking Kit&r will pick up any Mobs nearby and put them in a &7Cart&r."
		""
		"The &cDisembarking Kit&r unloads Mobs from the &7Carts&r."
		""
		"The &cDumping Kit&r will drop the mobs in the &7Carts&r below the &6tracks&r its on."
	]
	quest.032B654201E71618.title: "Track Kits for Entities"
	quest.03350C8F2F0F382D.quest_desc: ["Diamond Construction Sticks allow you to place 128 blocks at once."]
	quest.035C52EF63AD23A7.quest_desc: [
		"Hence the name of the mod, &lRailCraft&r, and what it revolves around, &1Trains&r, &6Rails&r are pretty important."
		""
		"The &2Vanilla&r ones work for lots of these."
		""
		"Upgraded ones will need some more special items for their recipes! "
		""
		"Craft them!"
	]
	quest.035C52EF63AD23A7.title: "Rails"
	quest.03C54B07106091DD.quest_desc: [
		"The powerful &cSmelter Prism&r stands as easily the most frequently manufactured artifact from your ritual forge."
		""
		"Compiling its fiery core requires four portions of &cBlaze Powder&r, two lumps of standard &8Coal&r, and a solid block of &bArcane Crystal&r, while the central anvil must be anchored with the rare &3Elementarium&r Relic."
		""
		"Naturally, an artisan can fuse the artifact directly into their mining tools to instantly smelt any resources they fracture—turning raw ore into pure ingots, logs into &8Charcoal&r, and sand into glass upon impact."
		""
		"You may also cast the prism directly into a furnace as a fuel source, though its thermal longevity is remarkably poor, standing as a disappointing contradiction to its legendary name."
	]
	quest.03C54B07106091DD.title: "&cSmelter Prism"
	quest.0423D99FBFB5CB32.quest_subtitle: "Best Tool for Acquiring Sacrificial Meat"
	quest.0423D99FBFB5CB32.title: "Tools of the Trade: Butcher's Knife"
	quest.0450060852F290CA.quest_desc: [
		"The &9Deeplands&r is a dark dimension that looks very similar to the Overworld's &3Deep Dark&r biome."
		""
		"The landscape is completely infested with blue &3Sculk&r, noise-detecting &3Sensors&r, and acoustic &3Shriekers&r that will still summon the terrifying &9&lWarden&r if you make too much noise."
		""
		"This deep territory is also home to a wider variety of unique &3Sculk Creatures&r and plants, and it even contains the main focal structure belonging to the &3&lOtherside&r."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/dnd_land.png width:200 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.0450060852F290CA.title: "&9Deeplands"
	quest.04D9F6587EF8D9B7.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting a &9Potion Jar&r is the perfect way to declutter your packs, letting you store up to 100 potions inside a single block."
		""
		"Pulling your brews back out on the trail is incredibly simple: just tap the jar with an empty glass bottle or a handy potion flask to fill it right up."
		""
		"If you decide to automate your base camp, make sure to link these jars up—friendly Wixies will actively use them as supply tanks during automated Potion Autocrafting."
	]
	quest.04D9F6587EF8D9B7.quest_subtitle: "Storing Potions"
	quest.050CD33E92601651.quest_desc: [
		"Should the capabilities of your &c&lTier 1&r foundry prove insufficient for your advanced work, you must prepare the mechanism for a grand refinement."
		""
		"Position a single Edelwood Plank directly within the center slot of the &6&lHephaestus Forge&r, then carefully distribute four shining &bArcane Crystals&r and four shattered pieces of Spawner Scrap across the surrounding peripheral pedestals."
		""
		"Striking the central anvil with your ritual Gavel will instantly transmute your old station into a powerful &3&lTier 2 &6Forge&r."
		""
		"Achieving this rank unlocks a vast assortment of higher-order rituals, heavily expands the maximum capacity of your internal essence reservoirs, and grants you the right to slot a second magical Relic into the interface simultaneously."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/forbidden_tier2.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.050CD33E92601651.title: "&l&3Tier 2 &6Forge"
	quest.0512C386CBBABD65.quest_desc: ["Mid-game upgrade: Mix clay and slime to craft Unfired Polymerization Putty then cure it with a furnace – essential for seamless mosaics."]
	quest.0512C386CBBABD65.title: "Unlock Polymerization Putty"
	quest.05252B9E55232054.quest_desc: [
		"Utilizing the ultimate planar frequencies of &dRonaza's Contact&r, you can subject an existing &bIesnium Sacrificial Bowl&r to extreme extra-dimensional compression, permanently transmuting the block into the Eldritch Chalice."
		""
		"Installing this pinnacle artifact at the absolute geometric center of any pentacle completely shatters the baseline speed limits of occult geometry. The device acts as an immediate sub-spatial gateway, forcing the local fabric of reality to bypass traditional casting intervals and dimensional tearing delays entirely."
		""
		"Once active, every ceremony, summoning matrix, and material infusion initiated within the runic perimeter will complete instantly. Runic calculations, offering consumption, and entity manifestation happen in a single computational tick—allowing your facility to establish maximum-efficiency, hands-free automation loops with zero operational downtime."
	]
	quest.05252B9E55232054.quest_subtitle: "Eliminating dimensional tearing latency through supreme sub-spatial channels."
	quest.05252B9E55232054.title: "Instantaneous Breach: The Eldritch Chalice"
	quest.053491865006B19A.quest_desc: ["The Fluid Drawer is used to store large amounts of fluids in a compact form. It works seamlessly with fluid pipes, machines, and automation systems."]
	quest.05369F8F4DF5A5BA.quest_desc: [
		"Reaching this milestone marks the complete assembly of your extra-dimensional manufacturing toolkit. While your structured progression path through this chapter is finalized, your integration of these arcane sciences is only just beginning."
		""
		"To transition your temporary workshop into a permanent, automated industrial center, consider prioritizing the following facility optimizations:"
		""
		"&l&o&nComprehensive Schematic Audit&r: Consult your &6Dictionary of Spirits&r to review the full, unrestricted catalog of unlisted auxiliary recipes, niche transmutes, and utility constructs to discover new material optimization routes for your factory floor."
		""
		"&l&o&nDedicated Perimeter Zoning&r: If you are still operating out of a temporary layout, finalize your infrastructure by constructing three separate, heavily decorated 19x19 ritual zones. Separating your Summoning, Possession, and Infusion matrices permanently prevents block overlap errors and streamlines your automation pipeline."
		""
		"&l&o&nCross-Mod Logistics Hookups&r: Link your newly manufactured endgame assets—such as the high-output crushing circuits and infinite miners—directly into your centralized storage and automated crafting networks to completely eliminate all remaining resource bottlenecks."
		""
		"The veil has been thoroughly shattered, and the laws of the Otherworld are entirely yours to dictate."
	]
	quest.05369F8F4DF5A5BA.quest_subtitle: "Maximizing the full operational potential of your established occult nextwork."
	quest.05369F8F4DF5A5BA.title: "Absolute Mastery: The Path Forward"
	quest.0594025A747665CF.quest_desc: [
		"Utilizing the ultimate cosmic frequencies of &dRonaza's Contact&r, you can permanently restructure your standard containment equipment, upgrading a base Soul Gem into a pristine Trinity Gem.This elite apparatus represents the absolute zenith of biological capture technology, featuring an overhauled resonance grid that significantly expands your logistical capabilities:"
		""
		"&l&o&nMassive Variable Capture&r: The device easily overpowers and siphons high-density, large-scale entities that completely resist lower-tier containment cells—allowing you to easily transport massive livestock, elite monstrous guards, and high-health sacrificial catalysts across dimensions."
		""
		"&l&o&nPlanar Boundaries&r: Note that while the gem's energetic fields are drastically amplified, they are still bound by universal reality constants. The matrix is incapable of fully compressing supreme world anomalies, meaning it cannot contain or shackle catastrophic regional bosses."
	]
	quest.0594025A747665CF.quest_subtitle: "Expanding biological capture matrices to absorb massive extra-dimensional targets."
	quest.0594025A747665CF.title: "Pinnacle Containment: The Trinity Gem"
	quest.05ED8405B18981E4.quest_desc: [
		"Magicians are widely known as powerful wielders of magic."
		""
		"In truth, however, they rely on summoned spirit slaves, known as demons, who perform magic on their behalf."
		""
		"Occultism is a ritual magic system centered around summonable spirits allows you to automate various tasks, store vast amounts of items, let demons mine in void dimensions, create powerful enchanted tools and jewelry, get support from familiars, and much much more."
	]
	quest.05ED8405B18981E4.title: "Welcome to Occultism"
	quest.05FFFD19E6761FD9.quest_desc: ["No known information was recorded about this eye."]
	quest.05FFFD19E6761FD9.quest_subtitle: "Chance of dropping when enchanting items"
	quest.0625301D09524CAE.quest_desc: ["The Chalk Brush is used to erase ritual symbols drawn with chalk. While chalk markings are powerful, they are not permanent, and mistakes must be corrected with care."]
	quest.0637464C79BD5815.quest_subtitle: "Open 10 containers"
	quest.068294A7C21DE550.quest_desc: [
		"&cTrack Kits&r are used to craft with &6rails&r to make special &6rails&r."
		""
		"These &6rails&r will be helpful for everything &1Train&r wise like: stopping the &1Train&r, moving the &1Train&r, and emitting redstone."
	]
	quest.06E6AD3C4BC3F404.quest_desc: ["Claim Twilight Scepter from Lich drops."]
	quest.06E6AD3C4BC3F404.title: "Twilight Scepter"
	quest.07079E18E59FBE0E.quest_desc: [
		"Backpacks can be upgraded through six tiers: Leather, Copper, Iron, Gold, Diamond, and Netherite. Each tier increases both the number of storage slots and the number of upgrade slots available, allowing players to enhance their backpacks to suit different needs and stages of gameplay."
		""
		"Backpacks can be dyed in countless color combinations. To dye a backpack, place it in a crafting grid along with dyes. The color mixing works similarly to leather armor, but with an added twist - backpacks support two colors: a main color and an accent color."
		""
		""
		"-  Dye on the left = main color."
		"-  Dye on the right = accent color."
		"-  Same column = both colors."
	]
	quest.079B76C1ED617C6C.quest_desc: ["The Armory Cabinet is designed for non-stackable items. By default, it can store up to 4,096 unique items, making it perfect for tools, weapons, armor, and other unstackables. It cannot be accessed directly by players and instead must be connected using external storage systems such as Applied Energistics or Refined Storage."]
	quest.07BA6459A842C2ED.quest_desc: [
		"&6PneumaticCraft&r is all about putting &bPressure&r to good use!"
		""
		"To get started in the mod, we'll need to apply a &osmall amount&r of pressure to some Iron Ingots in the world."
		""
		"And by \"small amount,\" we mean you need to blow them up with &cTNT&r :)"
	]
	quest.07BA6459A842C2ED.title: "Under Pressure"
	quest.07BEE6FEC14765DC.quest_desc: [
		"While assembling this utility from raw materials is a straightforward process requiring clay, iron, and sticky slimeballs, attempting to forge it by hand is highly inefficient."
		""
		"Ancient Lodestones are best plundered directly from the wilderness, as several specialized exploration records integrate them heavily into the treasure chests scattered across the fiery expanse of &c&lThe Nether&r."
		""
		"This process introduces refined Wax, a brand new substance manufactured by blending a sweet Bottle of Honey directly with standard slimeballs. "
		""
		"Applying this sticky sealant to a standard &6Darkstone Pedestal&r transmutes the armature into a specialized &7Magnetized Pedestal&r, which bridges seamlessly with basic hoppers and pipe networks to pull loose items from the air."
		""
		"Furthermore, an armor smith can rub this wax directly onto their heavy boots to expand their personal gravitational pull, dragging loose treasures on the ground much closer to their personal inventory."
	]
	quest.07C26C046CDE2507.quest_desc: ["The Crusher’s Hut is where the Crusher will take items and crush them into other blocks. Most notably cobblestone = gravel, gravel = sand, sand = clay. One important factor to know is that the crusher has a daily limit based on the hut level. Level 1 has a daily max of 16, level 2 has 64. At level 5 it’s daily max is 999. "]
	quest.07C26C046CDE2507.quest_subtitle: "Build a Crusher's Hut"
	quest.08457BEED799E600.quest_desc: ["These new &7Carts&r are mostly for laying down &6Tracks&r.\\n\\nThe &7Track Layer&r places down &6Tracks&r while the &7Track Remover&r removes &6Tracks&r.\\n\\nThe &7Track Relayer&r replaces the &6Tracks&r with different ones and the &7Track UnderCutter&r replaces the blocks beneath the &6Tracks&r."]
	quest.08457BEED799E600.title: "Track Carts"
	quest.0850F88E2205623F.quest_desc: [
		"&3Sculk Tendrils&r look and act just like the &bTwisting Vines&r you find in the Nether, except they are completely covered in sculk."
		""
		"Keep your eyes on the ground while exploring, because they spawn as a rare find hidden deep inside the &9Deeplands&r"
	]
	quest.0850F88E2205623F.title: "&3Sculk Tendrils"
	quest.085F473094778DCD.quest_desc: [
		"The resource scroll is an easy way to tell what one of your Builder needs. Sneak + right-click on a Builder’s Hut to register the resource scroll to the builder."
		""
		"Now when you right-click while holding the resource scroll, you will see all the needed materials for the Builder’s Hut you clicked on."
	]
	quest.085F473094778DCD.quest_subtitle: "Micromanagement at it's finest"
	quest.087B79EA6970843A.quest_desc: ["The Gold Upgrade provides a &616x&r boost to drawer storage capacity. It’s a solid mid-game option for handling growing resource stockpiles."]
	quest.088FCB5267CB7A89.quest_desc: [
		"Equipping this belt gives you a fantastic edge in battle by randomly splashing you with positive potion buffs that last for a short time."
		""
		"The overall strength of these effects changes every single time they trigger, keeping you boosted with a mix of useful powers."
	]
	quest.08E3561D65080B60.quest_desc: ["Outputs stored energy from the Router into adjacent blocks or machines that accept power. Allows the Router to act as a power distributor when supplied with energy."]
	quest.08FCBB3A1B289757.quest_desc: ["It has witnessed destruction. Maybe it also witnessed your stuff disappear."]
	quest.08FCBB3A1B289757.quest_subtitle: "Dropped by the Wither"
	quest.092BB595F75D5536.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to the dark arts of &6&lForbidden \\& Arcanus&r."
		""
		"To initialize your research into these forbidden secrets, you must equip your pickaxe and begin mining deep beneath the earth's surface."
		""
		"Your primary excavation efforts must focus strictly at Y-level 1 and below to discover the rare foundational ores of this mod."
	]
	quest.092BB595F75D5536.title: "&6&lForbidden \\& Arcanus"
	quest.0982858F9E537655.quest_desc: ["The Redstone Upgrade allows drawers to respond to redstone signals. This can be used to control whether items can be inserted or extracted, enabling more advanced automation and logic-based setups."]
	quest.09D544ACB063188C.quest_desc: ["Craft a Netherite Lantern. (Each Type of Lantern Comes in Various Colors)."]
	quest.0A1AA12D7A1A7310.quest_desc: ["Craft the flute—awaken the first melody!"]
	quest.0A1AA12D7A1A7310.title: "Bone Whistle Awakening"
	quest.0A1ABE9CF7740AAA.quest_desc: [
		"The protective Rings of Discount function as an essential accessory, applying a small bonus modifier to your maximum mana ceiling and accelerating your passive mana regeneration rates."
		""
		"Furthermore, keeping this ring equipped tunes your arcane focus to systematically reduce the total energy cost required to execute any custom spell from your book."
	]
	quest.0A43FD0B5C76C1C5.quest_desc: [
		"&l&7RailCraft Reborn&r adds a Blast Furnace multiblock for us to transform Iron into Steel!"
		""
		"To build it you'll need 34 Blast Furnace Bricks. "
		""
		"It'll be 3 blocks wide, 3 blocks long, and 4 blocks tall. "
		""
		"The two blocks in the exact center need to be hollow. "
		""
		"You'll know it's done when it forms all together and allows you to access its GUI."
		""
		"There you can put Iron ,in any form, to get Steel and Granulated Sand."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/rail_furnace.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.0A5AE5ADB477805C.quest_desc: [
		"While your entry-tier &eFoliot Crusher&r served as an adequate baseline for early operations, scaling your automated factory lines demands the absolute maximum optimization of your mineral logistics."
		""
		"Deploying the top-tier &9Marid Crusher&r introduces a massive breakthrough to your processing lines, multiplying every single raw ore fed into its matrix into an unprecedented six refined dusts. This ultimate level of resource generation completely eclipses all standard machinery and lower-tier spirits in the modpack."
		""
		"To shackle an entity of this extreme power and capture its high-output crushing metrics, you must layout and construct the complex geometric multi-block for &9Fatma's Incentivized Attraction&r."
	]
	quest.0A5AE5ADB477805C.quest_subtitle: "Maximizing factory throughput with a sextuple ore-multiplication circuit."
	quest.0A5AE5ADB477805C.title: "Pinnacle Refinement: The &9Marid Crusher&r"
	quest.0ABF35B69C0217C5.quest_desc: [
		"The light blue chalk is made with such icy materials that its glyphs are inert and impart a natural stability to the pentacles."
		""
		"Although it is basically made of ice, the magic present prevents it from melting."
		""
		" Crushing ice without melting it is a job a Foliot can't do, so you'll need a better crusher."
	]
	quest.0ABF35B69C0217C5.quest_subtitle: "The Glacial Chalk"
	quest.0AC8FE3B59D1B09D.quest_desc: [
		"The innovative Quantum Catcher serves as an invaluable apparatus for the humane relocation of living creatures across your estate."
		""
		"To secure a specimen inside its containment field, you must simply execute a direct right-click action upon the target mob, repeating the command later to safely deposit them at their new coordinates."
		""
		"To initialize the capturing matrix, you must harbor a specific pool of &bAureal&r within your personal inventory, a toll that scales dynamically based on the total health capacity of the beast. "
		""
		"Fortunately, breaking the seal to release your captive requires zero energy expenditure."
		""
		"Constructing this tool requires a highly complex &7Quantum Core&r, which you must forge by combining raw &7Runes&r, volatile &cMundabitur Dust&r, and common &8Flint&r alongside rare Spawner Scraps."
		""
		"These metallic scraps are harvested exclusively by fracturing a monster spawner using a standard pickaxe lacking the Silk Touch enchantment."
	]
	quest.0B009391E3F76D6E.quest_desc: [
		"The fisher is an excellent source of early game food for your citizens. Hopefully you have a decent resource for string. With any luck the fisherman will also get some some extra loot. "
		""
		"If your colony lacks a natural water source like an ocean or river, you can make do with a 6x6x1 area of water. "
	]
	quest.0B009391E3F76D6E.quest_subtitle: "Build the Fisher's Hut"
	quest.0B11EAB8D76529E0.quest_desc: [
		"The massive &6Ancient City&r is the most dangerous structure found in &2&lVanilla Minecraft&r, serving as the initial gateway into the &3&lDeeper and Darker&r mod expansion."
		""
		"This deep vault is filled with patches of &3Sculk&r, hidden treasure chests, and the predatory &9&lWarden&r. "
		""
		"Most importantly, the center of the complex houses the monumental portal frame constructed out of solid &8Reinforced Deepslate&r. "
		""
		"Gather all the rare loot you can carry before activating the portal, and walk quietly to avoid drawing the attention of the monster lurking in the shadows."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/all_city.png width:200 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.0B11EAB8D76529E0.title: "Visit an &6Ancient City"
	quest.0B1DF8A040826D87.quest_desc: [
		"Now that you have &cRossinite&r, you can mix it with &aBenitoite&r to create &dInsanite&r ingots."
		""
		"&aBenitoite Ore&r can be found in the Nether."
	]
	quest.0B444AD01903C35C.quest_desc: ["Hunt Drowned in oceans to secure abyssal depths for resource gathering."]
	quest.0B718FC37699B822.quest_desc: [
		"You can gather plenty of &aEcho Logs&r by chopping down the unique &aEcho Trees&r found throughout the &5Echoing Forest&r."
		""
		"These trees are very easy to spot thanks to their bright &5Purple Leaves&r that hide valuable Sculk Gleam inside them."
		""
		"The logs themselves sport a clean &7Light Grey Bark&r on the outside, but peeling it back reveals a very cool &aLight Green Log color&r interior."
		""
		"Any planks, fences, or wood tools you build with this material will match that exact &aLight Green Color&r, giving them a nice minty look."
		""
		"Make sure to try crafting some doors and trapdoors with them, as they turn into awesome fixtures with completely unique visual patterns."
	]
	quest.0B718FC37699B822.title: "&aEcho Trees"
	quest.0B9781072E9E935C.title: "Single File Line, To Hide Their Numbers..."
	quest.0BA912A237B3DE0F.quest_desc: ["Iron Construction Sticks allow you to place 27 blocks at once."]
	quest.0BF041AD22626350.quest_desc: [
		"The automated version automatically pulls in fuel and items to smelt, and pushes finished items back into the backpack."
		""
		"Includes filters for both fuel and smeltable items."
		""
		"Smoking and Blasting upgrades behave similarly but operate at double the base speed and only accept items valid for vanilla smokers or blast furnaces."
	]
	quest.0C0D00B227C3BB5C.quest_desc: ["The Pushing Upgrade does the opposite of pulling—it automatically sends items from storage into a neighboring inventory. Use this to feed machines, furnaces, or processing lines directly from your drawers."]
	quest.0C877B956CD9A6A3.quest_desc: ["Craft Iron Ender Chest by surrounding a vanilla Ender Chest with 8 Iron Blocks for reinforced void storage."]
	quest.0C877B956CD9A6A3.title: "Iron Vault Upgrade"
	quest.0D15A75331737FBB.quest_desc: [
		"Constructing the final geometric perimeter for &9Uphyxes' Inverted Tower&r grants your facility access to the pinnacle tier of &6Infusion Rituals&r. While this highly advanced configuration operates with highly specialized parameters and features a narrow catalog of recipes, its activation is strictly mandatory to unlock late-game logistical progression."
		""
		"The primary function of this heavy atmospheric matrix is the synthesis of Dragonyst Dust. This hyper-dense, extra-dimensional compound acts as your final core alchemical catalyst. Extracting this refined particle from the center of the infusion circle allows you to combine it with your existing chalk inventory to engineer your final sticks of Magenta Chalk modifiers."
	]
	quest.0D15A75331737FBB.quest_subtitle: "Harnessing maximum-tier atmospheric compression for final elemental transmutations."
	quest.0D15A75331737FBB.title: "Zenith Synthesis: &9Uphyes' Inverted Tower&r"
	quest.0D330FAD6C993DBC.quest_desc: [
		"This volume serves as the direct second-tier advancement for your magical armament."
		""
		"Compiling this book expands your maximum internal mana pool and accelerates your passive mana regeneration rates."
		""
		"Furthermore, the upgraded binding unlocks advanced casting permissions, allowing an arcanist to configure and cast powerful Tier 2 Glyphs within their spells."
	]
	quest.0D56E3C121A776DF.quest_desc: ["Undertaker Revived a Dead Citizen"]
	quest.0D6E099A1A242153.quest_desc: [
		"The &bBuild Tool&r is one of the most important tools in the mod. It's how you will place all building from now on. Right+click any solid item to open the build preview GUI. On the right are controls for moving, rotating, raising, and lowering your building. "
		""
		"Place your &bTown Hall&r block and register your colony. However, the first building to be constructed is the builders hut. Your Town Hall cannot be built until you have a completed builders hut."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/hc_build_tool.png width:190 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.0DAF030876200FFE.quest_desc: [
		"The Book of Binding is the vessel used to bind spirits to the material world. Without it, spirits cannot be captured, commanded, or used in rituals beyond the most basic practices."
		""
		"An Empty Book of Binding can be crafted or found, but it holds no power on its own. During a summoning ritual, the empty book is used to bind the summoned spirit, transforming it into a bound Book of Binding. Each book may hold only one spirit, and losing it severs the bond entirely."
		""
		"Books of Binding exist in multiple tiers. Lesser books bind weaker spirits, while higher-tier books are required for more powerful and complex entities. A spirit cannot be bound to a book of a lower tier than itself, making proper preparation essential before attempting advanced rituals."
	]
	quest.0E2AD156E5EF263A.quest_desc: [
		"The fragile Spell Parchment serves as a vital blank slate used to permanently inscribe your chosen spells at the Scribe's Table."
		""
		"By pressing your spellbook against its surface, you infuse the paper with active arcane code, locking the spell into a portable, single-use scroll for rapid deployment in battle."
	]
	quest.0EBB4E5195610A82.quest_desc: ["The Sawmill is where the Carpenter will craft any items made of at least 75% wood. This is the point where the colony really starts to feel like it’s running on its own. Be sure to set up important recipes for items your builder regularly needs. While the sawmill starts with a paltry 10 recipes, the number of recipes you can teach the Sawmill doubles per building level."]
	quest.0EBB4E5195610A82.quest_subtitle: "Build a Sawmill"
	quest.0EC122E853F2083C.quest_desc: [
		"&dAdvanced Pressure Tubes&r can handle up to the danger zone of 20 &bBar&r and 4 times the volume. At 25 &bBar&r they will explode!"
		""
		"Before you can connect these to your machines, make sure they can handle the increased volume and pressure, or you can use a &bRegulator&r instead!"
	]
	quest.0EDE757C21B32067.quest_desc: ["Consuming Deamon's Dream, can give you the &dThird Eye&r, allowing you to see where the Otherworld intersects with our own. While under the effects of the third eye you are able to harvest resources such as Otherstone or otherwordly trees."]
	quest.0EDE757C21B32067.title: "Third Eye"
	quest.0F409DACBEB7BBF8.quest_desc: ["Depending on the pack style you choose, supply ships may need to be placed in water, or in the air. Clear an area large enough to fit your supply ship. This may include digging under water, depending on where you place your ship. The supply ship will not place if there are objects in the way. Right clicking the supply ship on the ground will show a 3D preview of the camp. Using the placement controls arrows, position the ship in your clearing, then click the green checkmark to finalize the placement. If it won’t place, then the terrain is in the way, and you may need to clear the area more. Red lines will appear showing you the areas that need to be cleared."]
	quest.0FD638380EECFFBD.quest_desc: [
		"When you are ready to construct your master foundry, lay out your collected blocks of &9Polished Darkstone&r, bright &6Arcane Polished Darkstone&r, and fancy &6Gilded Chiseled Polished Darkstone&r in the exact pattern shown below."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/forbidden_forge1.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"Next, set a regular Smithing Table down right on the interior ring of &6Gilded Chiseled Polished Darkstone&r and smack the block with a handful of &cMundabitur Dust&r to spark the magic and create your &6&lHephaestus Forge&r!"
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/forbidden_forge2.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"To finish up the build, simply snap your eight &6Darkstone Pedestals&r right onto the outside rim of gilded blocks."
	]
	quest.0FD638380EECFFBD.title: "Building the &6&lForge"
	quest.103F99D9C4385248.quest_desc: [
		"With your Foliot Crusher successfully bound to the material plane, you can now &mexploit&r utilize its brute processing strength to pulverize high-density compounds."
		""
		"Your next logistical milestone requires feeding the spirit raw quantities of &eEnd Stone&r, &9Obsidian&r, and &7Calcite&r. The entity will rapidly grind these dense materials into specialized, hyper-purified dusts—vital alchemical components absolutely required to forge your next tier of ritual chalks."
	]
	quest.103F99D9C4385248.title: "&aRefining the Medium"
	quest.104049993CC62E7F.quest_desc: [
		"The Advanced Item Loader is everything the regular one is but can be used from anywhere near the &6Track&r. "
		""
		"Next to, above, next to on the other side. "
		""
		"Use the &4Crowbar&r to change its direction."
	]
	quest.104EBBC08B4733F5.quest_desc: [
		"The &dSimulation Chamber&r is the main machine within HNN.\\n\\nWhen given power, it will run simulations based on the &bData Model&r that is placed inside. The power required also depends on the Data Model placed inside, and can be seen within the Model's tooltip. \\n\\nThe machine also requires at least one &9Prediction Matrix&r to run a simulation."
		""
		"The result of the simulation will be output onto the Matrix. Simulations will always produce some kind of &eGeneralized Prediction&r, which can be used in various crafting recipes. They also vary depending on the origin of the mob in the Data Model."
		""
		"If the simulation succeeds, you will receive a &dMob Prediction&r based off of the model. The higher the tier of the Data Model used, the higher the success rate is for a simulation."
	]
	quest.104EBBC08B4733F5.title: "&aSimulating Deaths"
	quest.10B6FDA1362E3C52.quest_desc: [
		"This advanced tool serves as the ultimate functional upgrade to the Rainbow Chalk, engineered specifically for facility designers who prefer a pristine, unified laboratory environment over rapid, flashing color loops."
		""
		"The apparatus retains the exact same master-tier utility as its rainbow counterpart, but completely dampens the chaotic visual shifts. When drawn onto the floor, every single runic glyph manifests as a clean, uniform white engraving—allowing you to maintain a highly polished, cohesive aesthetic across your entire ritual floor without sacrificing an ounce of performance."
		""
		"Beyond the cosmetic refinement, this tool introduces a critical structural upgrade. While the previous rainbow model was strictly limited to colored modifiers, this advanced matrix successfully incorporates monochrome compression logic. This means a single tool now seamlessly mimics both color parameters and every tier of Foundation Chalk (from White up to midnight Black Chalk)—effectively consolidating your entire occult scribing inventory into one singular, infinite-durability instrument."
	]
	quest.10B6FDA1362E3C52.quest_subtitle: "Consolidating the full structural spectrum into a clean, unyielding visual layout."
	quest.10B6FDA1362E3C52.title: "Monochromatic Synthesis: Void Chalk"
	quest.10C1982CA60C70BD.quest_desc: ["Shaped recipe (JEI). Hold staff → X key → menu → right-click tamed dragon (follow/stay/fly)."]
	quest.10C1982CA60C70BD.title: "Trainer's Staff Craft"
	quest.10E025288BB00657.quest_desc: [
		"You'll run into bouncy &bSludges&r while exploring the lush &bBlooming Caverns&r, and they act exactly like regular slimes."
		""
		"Their biggest size is a serious threat, packing a health bar of 8 &4Hearts&r and dealing massive hit damage."
		""
		"When you destroy a big one, it splits into two to four medium &bSludges&r."
		""
		"These medium versions are much weaker with only 2 &4Hearts&r of health and lower damage, popping into two to four tiny sludges when killed."
		""
		"The smallest size is completely harmless, sports just a half a &4Heart of Health&r, and can't deal any damage to you at all."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/dnd_sludge.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.10E025288BB00657.title: "&bSludge"
	quest.10E8BC20D406D9FB.quest_subtitle: "Makes Various Nether Materials"
	quest.111649D7E16D869F.quest_desc: [
		"The handy &9Caster's Wand&r is a specialized tool that only holds a single spell at a time, which you have to lock in using your Scribe's Table."
		""
		"Every single spell you put onto this wand automatically forces a Projectile and Accelerate modifier onto the front of it, so you must always use a basic effect that doesn't already have its own shape like touch or self-cast."
		""
		"Carrying this tool is a great trick on the trail because it lets you cast extra magic completely bypassing your standard 10-spell hotbar limit."
		""
		"If you just want a quick way to mine blocks, simply engrave the wand with the Break effect all by itself!"
	]
	quest.1118F97CF7633F3D.quest_desc: [
		"Keeps specified items topped up in the player’s inventory by automatically refilling them from the backpack."
		""
		"The regular upgrade allows up to 6 items to be defined in its filter and refills them anywhere in the player’s inventory."
	]
	quest.120152510AD4B59A.quest_desc: ["While you might think your builder needs glasses sometimes, these goggles won’t help them. The Builders googles are for you. When you put them on your head or in a curio head slot they allow you to preview your buildings at level 5 which is helpful when fitting one building next to another."]
	quest.126C43B40D537FAB.quest_subtitle: "Open 100 containers"
	quest.12708EA86CCFFDD1.quest_desc: [
		"The brown chalk is made with the essence of cruelty, and obtaining it certainly lives up to its name. Do the ends justify the means? Does morality truly exist? What is your morality?"
		""
		"This chalk is known to be part of an \"Alignment Test.\" Anyone who possesses it is automatically classified as \"Evil.\" What kind of spirits will these glyphs attract?"
		""
		"To obtain the cruelty essencebrown chalk you need to summon and kill a Mercy Goat"
	]
	quest.12708EA86CCFFDD1.quest_subtitle: "The Cruelty Chalk"
	quest.130E8FC7479E4271.quest_desc: [
		"The Shepherd’s Hut is where the Shepherd will breed and butcher sheep for food and wool. You will have to capture and bring in two sheep to the Shepherd’s Hut, as the Shepherd will not catch and bring in any sheep."
		""
		"The Shepherd will only keep two sheep alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten sheep in their holding pens."
	]
	quest.130E8FC7479E4271.quest_subtitle: "Build a Sheperd's Hut"
	quest.1328B93679A9206C.quest_desc: ["Craft Diamond Ender Chest by surrounding a vanilla Ender Chest with 8 Diamond Blocks for +2 rows (45 slots total)."]
	quest.13B338F377951032.quest_desc: [
		"The powerful &bSonorous Staff&r allows a warrior to harness the exact long-range acoustic weapon utilized by the terrifying &9&lWarden&r."
		""
		"Operating this artifact requires holding down your right-click command to build up internal energy, then releasing it to project a destructive &bSonic Blast&r at your target."
		""
		"This heavy weapon features a localized cooling delay between uses and utilizes a strict durability gauge, making calculated deployment necessary."
		""
		"Forging the staff requires combining one &9Heart of the Deep&r dropped by the Warden, two &3Soul Crystals&r plundered from the &3&lStalker&r, and two &3Sculk Bones&r stripped from Shattered skeletons."
	]
	quest.13B338F377951032.title: "&bSonorous Staff"
	quest.13FBF99DD6D2C141.quest_desc: ["Shaped recipe (JEI). Hold staff → X key → menu → right-click tamed dragon (follow/stay/fly)."]
	quest.14B3542ECB59869C.quest_desc: [
		"The &5Loot Fabricator&r is the machine that gets you that sweet, sweet loot from Mob Predictions."
		""
		"When given power and a successful Mob Prediction, you will be able to choose which item you'd like to get from that mob's Data Model. The machine will remember your choice, so it can be automated."
		""
		"Examples of Mob Predictions:\\n\\n- &dEnder Dragons&r for &dDragon Eggs\\n - &2Zombies&r for Iron\\n - &0Withers&r for &5Nether Stars"
	]
	quest.14DA3DC7C0009A6A.quest_subtitle: "Reach 50 Citizens"
	quest.14DB8A515CA50932.quest_desc: [
		"The powerful &9Enchanter's Sword&r lets you attach a custom Touch Spell straight to your blade for combat."
		""
		"Any spell you choose to lock onto the sword gets a free bonus, automatically adding one extra Amplify modifier to its very last effect."
		""
		"Applying your custom magic is easy: just head over to your Scribe's Table."
		""
		"When you build the spell for the blade, make sure to just select your effects and leave the delivery form completely blank."
	]
	quest.14E5349DD740D026.quest_desc: [
		"To insert fuel into the reactor, you'll need to pick one of the sides that has a &9Reactor Solid Access Port&r and pump in &eUranium&r from an inventory."
		""
		"The easiest way to do this is to use something like a &aStorage Drawer&r or even just a &aChest&r with an &9Item Pipe&r connected at the top, like the image shown below.\\n"
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/import.png width:150 height:150 align:center}"
	]
	quest.14E5349DD740D026.title: "Passive Reactor Fueling"
	quest.151648179684B088.quest_desc: [
		"Grab some Runic Chalk whenever you want to draw permanent magical trap circles directly on the ground."
		""
		"These floor runes will instantly cast an attached spell onto any creature or enemy that accidentally walks over them."
		""
		"Setting one up is easy: just lock your chosen magic onto a &eSpell Parchment&r using a Scribe's Table, then use it to program the trap."
		""
		"Just make sure you set the rune up near your base jars, because it completely relies on nearby Source power to activate."
	]
	quest.15849165CA8C00F9.quest_desc: [
		"The absolute pinnacle and final evolutionary state of your workshop is the supreme &d&lTier 5 &6Forge&r, demanding the most exorbitant material sacrifice ever conceived."
		""
		"To structure the core catalyst, you must forge two &5Dark Nether Stars&r by encasing a standard Nether Star inside four sheets of dense &5Obsidiansteel&r."
		""
		"You must then balance the peripheral pedestals with two pristine &dDragon Scales&r harvested from the carcass of the slain Ender Dragon, along with four pulsing &3Sculk Catalysts&r extracted directly from the Deep Dark or plundered from the &3Warden&r."
		""
		"Anchor the entire alignment by resting a solid &2Stellarite Block&r—compressed from nine raw pieces—directly upon the central anvil."
		""
		"Awakening this legendary forge breaks all remaining cosmic thresholds, maximizing your internal essence reservoirs to their absolute ceiling caps and unlocking your highest endgame recipes."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/forbidden_tier5.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.15849165CA8C00F9.title: "&l&9Tier 5 &6Forge"
	quest.15B51FB56A64C303.quest_desc: [
		"Many new buildings and upgrades are locked behind university research so it is worth getting a university built as soon as possible. Researcher will research various upgrades to your colony, and each level unlocks an additional researcher for a total of 5 researchers. Each Researcher can start their own research, but more Researchers does not lower the amount of time each individual research takes."
		""
		"Note: Research time is real-world time spent in-game. However, after level 3, Researchers will sometimes use offline time to work on researches."
	]
	quest.15B51FB56A64C303.quest_subtitle: "Build a University"
	quest.15F03A5E7E14C022.quest_desc: ["The stonemason is another key profession in the colony. They craft items commonly required by the builder. The stonemason will craft 3x3 recipes made entirely out of cobblestone, stone, andesite, diorite, granite, quartz, purpur, nether bricks, prismarine, sandstones, blackstone, and basalt. They can also craft end stone from cobblestone and an ender pearl after you complete the research."]
	quest.15F03A5E7E14C022.quest_subtitle: "Build a Stonemason's Hut"
	quest.15F655AA668D6541.quest_desc: [
		"Using the &dPressure Chamber&r, we can craft some more advanced components like the &aFluid Mixer&r."
		""
		"The &aFluid Mixer&r mixes two fluids into either an item or another fluid. One significant use for this is producing &aBiodiesel&r."
		""
		"Since &0Crude Oil&r isn't a renewable resource, making &aBiodiesel&r from plant or vegetable oil is a better way of automating plastic!"
	]
	quest.1641530A820FCA82.quest_desc: ["Combine vanilla Glazed Terracotta with Stained Glass to craft your first patterned window blocks."]
	quest.1641530A820FCA82.title: "Basic Patterned Glass"
	quest.1698565EBB68DC85.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Wye Track&r is the second track made by using a Spike Maul. "
		""
		"It directs two &6Tracks&r into one. "
		""
		"If you have one &6Track&r intersected by another the &6Wye&r will move &7Carts&r on the first &6Track&r into the intersecting one."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/rail_wye.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.1698565EBB68DC85.title: "Wye Tracks"
	quest.16A2CC83C99B1F86.quest_desc: [
		"You'll spot the dangerous &9Angler Fish&r swimming inside the rare &9Water Ponds&r hidden within the lush &bBlooming Caverns&r."
		""
		"They act just like regular fish for the most part, meaning they will suffocate if you drag them out of the &9Water&r."
		""
		"They have a small health bar of 3 &4Hearts&r and will aggressively attack you the second you step into their ponds."
		""
		"Don't bother fishing for them though, because they don't drop any loot at all when you defeat them."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/dnd_fish.png width:100 height:120 align:center}"
	]
	quest.16A2CC83C99B1F86.title: "&9Angler Fish"
	quest.16F37A3E31EBDA50.quest_desc: [
		"Fast one-seater, takes more effort to pilot, but fun as, mate!"
		""
		"Has some stroage space, one weapon slot, four upgrade slots, a banner slot, and can even take rockets for boost!"
	]
	quest.170118E3C3C072E5.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Junction&r is the last &6Track&r made by the Spike Maul."
		""
		"It acts as a normal intersection for &6Tracks. "
		""
		"&7Carts&r keep going the same way as before but now &6Tracks&r can intersect. "
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/rail_junction.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.170118E3C3C072E5.title: "Junction Tracks"
	quest.17014FD0D533A067.quest_desc: ["Loot rare Dragon Egg from chests in structures (dungeons, temples, fortresses, bastions, etc.). Hatch on magma blocks, campfires, lava cauldrons, or lava (10 min; shakes/smokes)."]
	quest.170D37DE8FA11407.quest_desc: ["Lootr makes it possible for everyone to get loot not just the first person. No more rushing out to horde all the loot. Win-Win!"]
	quest.170D37DE8FA11407.quest_subtitle: "Discover Loot"
	quest.172EEA1F5B58FD95.quest_desc: ["Harvest Pearls from ocean Clams (generate naturally; feed sand/bonemeal for faster yield)."]
	quest.173095F549E2D035.quest_desc: [
		"The magical &bArcane Crystals&r generate naturally throughout the deep geological layers, spanning from Y-level 14 down to -40."
		""
		"While these shining clusters are fairly common, you will require massive quantities of them to forge advanced magical gear."
		""
		"Similar to &bDiamonds&r, this resource features a peak efficiency generation depth; you will find them most abundantly concentrated at Y-level -13."
	]
	quest.173095F549E2D035.title: "&bArcane Crystals"
	quest.173815C4E0843F6F.quest_desc: ["Craft Paintbrush (JEI; colors individual skin cubes in Armourer GUI/world)."]
	quest.1743F3159DF15EEE.quest_desc: [
		"The advanced upgrade offers a larger range and 16 filter slots, with support for filtering by item, mod, tag, NBT data, and damage values."
		""
		"Can also collect experience orbs and convert them into experience fluid if a Tank Upgrade is present with available space."
		""
		"Additionally, it can be configured to only teleport items that already exist in the backpack, using its current contents as an additional filter."
	]
	quest.17452A76067CC6C0.quest_desc: ["It is told that it was forged by the first blacksmiths of time"]
	quest.17452A76067CC6C0.quest_subtitle: "Found in Mineshaft chests"
	quest.177B93F194F5B045.quest_desc: ["Moves gases (e.g., from Mekanism) between gas tanks and machines."]
	quest.17A8939CE5BF7ED8.quest_desc: [
		"Manufacturing your final sticks of Magenta Chalk requires you to establish a synchronized cross-tier production chain. While initializing &9Uphyxes' Inverted Tower&r provides the core synthesis path needed to extract Dragonyst Dust, your facility cannot process this raw particle into a usable runic medium using basic machinery."
		""
		"To finalize the compound, you must simultaneously deploy your top-tier &9Marid Crusher&r network. This spirit-crushing circuit is uniquely capable of pulverizing the dense, advanced materials required to bind and stabilize the dust. Routing the output of both maximum-tier operations into a single crafting grid is mandatory to forge your final colored modifiers."
	]
	quest.17A8939CE5BF7ED8.quest_subtitle: "Synchronizing maximum-tier infusion outputs with advanced mineral crushing loops."
	quest.17A8939CE5BF7ED8.title: "Cross-Tier Integration: Magenta Chalk"
	quest.17B51117082AE39D.quest_desc: ["Breaking grass will yield Demon Fruit seeds. If you plant them they will bare a Demon Fruit which when eaten will allow you to see past the veil and glimpse the Otherworld."]
	quest.17C8F08FFE572BC7.quest_desc: ["Craft Dragon Charge (JEI). Explore tweaks: Mix in cauldrons, hang lanterns on walls, carpet stairs/slabs, stack cakes/skulls."]
	quest.17D1CF990CE4BC01.quest_desc: [
		"The advanced upgrade offers 16 filter slots and supports filtering by item, mod, tag, NBT data, and damage values."
		""
		"Additionally, it can be configured to only pull items that already exist in the backpack, using its current contents as an additional filter."
	]
	quest.17D7D34F519F7E5F.quest_desc: [
		"To forge the absolute final tier of your spellbook, you must first hunt down and destroy the legendary &6Wilden Chimera&r."
		""
		"Summoning this apex beast requires you to assemble a sacred &9Ritual Brazier&r and successfully complete its dangerous summoning ritual."
		""
		"Winning this battle proves your mastery, unlocking the ultimate secrets required to bind the highest order of magic into your volume."
	]
	quest.17F7964611D893BE.quest_desc: [
		"The Fluid Loader will be helpful to keeping your &3Steam Locomotives&r up and running. "
		""
		"It has to be placed a few blocks above the &6Tracks&r and it will deploy fluids into either the &5Locomotive&r or &7Carts&r."
	]
	quest.1821005FCBA40102.quest_desc: ["\"Beat the tiny drum—restore full harmony!\""]
	quest.183426F733943FC3.quest_desc: ["Hunt Zombies to gather iron scraps for further upgrades."]
	quest.183F6A790EC006B8.quest_desc: [
		"Don't expect to find normal wood when harvesting &bBlooming Stems&r; they look and grow more like a strange mix between a Chorus Plant and a Bamboo stalk."
		""
		"They spawn deep within the &bBlooming Caverns&r and rely on stacking right on top of other &bBlooming Stems&r to stand tall, which is the only way you'll ever spot them."
		""
		"You can still strip their bark with an axe or chop them down to craft a custom set of wood planks."
		""
		"The finished planks have an awesome, glowing &bLight Blue color&r, meaning any furniture, stairs, or blocks you build with them will match that exact same blue shade."
	]
	quest.183F6A790EC006B8.title: "&bBlooming Wood"
	quest.184F98BE0F6710E2.quest_desc: [
		"These 2 &cTrack Kits&r are for using &7Carts&r and Redstone."
		""
		"The &cActivator Kit&r will activate whatever &7Cart&r goes over it."
		""
		"The &cDetector Kit&r will activate a redstone signal whenever a &7Cart&r passes over it."
		""
		"Both are similar to their &2Vanilla&r counters for regular &6tracks&r."
	]
	quest.184F98BE0F6710E2.title: "Redstone Track Kits"
	quest.185DBBDD252CBA0C.quest_desc: [
		"The monumental &6&lHephaestus Forge&r stands as the ultimate, crowning heart of all research within &6&lForbidden \\& Arcanus&r."
		""
		"Once you have successfully completed its structural multiblock layout, you can freely fracture and relocate the central forge block itself without losing your progress, though its internal magic remains completely inert unless it rests upon the proper foundation."
		""
		"Awakening its smithing power requires you to fill its inner wells with all four primordial essences: radiant &bAureal&r, captive Souls, crimson &4Blood&r, and your own stored &aExperience&r."
		""
		"If a blueprint demands it, you must first slot the necessary catalyst Relics into its core interface."
		""
		"Finally, to stoke the flames of creation, rest the primary item artifact directly inside the center slot of the &6&lForge&r while arranging the secondary ingredients upon the surrounding &6Pedestals&r."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/forbidden_gui.png width:135 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/forbidden_tier1.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.185DBBDD252CBA0C.title: "&l&cTier 1 &6Forge"
	quest.186731580B14F9D2.quest_desc: [
		"To interact with our Turbine, we'll need several &6Ports&r."
		""
		"The &9Fluid Port&r is used to insert vapors like &bSteam&r, or extract exhaust, like &9water&r. "
		""
		"Because of this, you'll need two for your Turbine."
		""
		"The &cPower Tap&r extracts power, and is required to complete the multiblock."
	]
	quest.186731580B14F9D2.title: "Port O' Turbine"
	quest.18A2FBE2D4133FA2.quest_desc: [
		"You'll need to craft a set of Arcane Pedestals if you want to use the Ritual Brazier or start manufacturing advanced magical items with the Enchanting Apparatus."
		""
		"These blocks function as pedestals that hold extra ingredients around your main crafting machines."
		""
		"Go ahead and craft yourself a total of 8 pedestals right away so you have enough to cover every high-level recipe on the trail."
	]
	quest.18A2FBE2D4133FA2.quest_subtitle: "Really Fancy Tables"
	quest.18C8FF073435FB10.quest_desc: [
		"By having access to the &dAmadron Tablet&r, you can buy a &aPCB Blueprint&r and make yourself your first &bUV Light Box&r!"
		""
		"This is needed to expose &bEmpty PCBs&r to &bUV Light&r, which is an important process for assembling PCBs."
		""
		"You can make Empty PCBs in the &dPressure Chamber&r."
	]
	quest.18C8FF073435FB10.title: "PCB TIME!"
	quest.18CD33B0D1C0D3E6.quest_desc: [
		"The &aCrop Support&r will work to increase the growth speed of any trees or crops that are planted on it."
		""
		"These are pretty cheap and require no upkeep to use, making them really useful for farming!"
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/crop_support.png width:200 height:200 align:center}"
		""
		""
		"{image: width:200 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.18CD33B0D1C0D3E6.title: "Farming!"
	quest.18ED8A353CF4EE0E.quest_desc: ["Craft Paint Roller (3x3 color) \\& Skin Cube (build blocks)."]
	quest.19047AF0EDED198B.quest_desc: [
		"No ritual matrix is complete without a proper &cSacrifice&r to appease the entities waiting on the other side."
		""
		"Fortunately, lower-tier spirits generally only demand physical catalysts rather than living blood, meaning your livestock is safe for now. You will utilize &aSacrificial Bowls&r to hold these necessary material offerings. "
		""
		"These pedestals can be placed freely around your ritual area, provided they do not obstruct or sit directly on top of the chalk glyphs forming the outer circles."
		""
		"While your current ceremonies only demand a cluster of four bowls, advanced rituals deeper in the tech tree will require upwards of ten peripheral bowls to feed the matrix."
		""
		"The central anchor of your setup is the &6Golden Ritual Bowl&r. Positioned directly in the geographic center of your pentacle, this block is used to initiate the ritual, and is almost always the vessel where your prepared Book of Binding must be placed to spark the summoning process."
	]
	quest.19047AF0EDED198B.title: "&4Blood&r and &6Offerings"
	quest.196003E1486ABB31.quest_desc: [
		"To upgrade your reinforced &cNetherite&r armor and weaponry into elite &9Warden Gear&r, you must acquire a rare &9Smithing Template&r."
		""
		"These template modules are hidden away exclusively within the ancient treasure chests scattered throughout the ruins of the &6Ancient Cities&r."
		""
		"Once you recover a single template, it can be endlessly duplicated at a crafting bench by combining it with 7 diamonds and a standard &3Sculk Block&r."
	]
	quest.196003E1486ABB31.title: "&9Warden Upgrade Template"
	quest.19628EE7288E8F66.quest_desc: ["\"Craft the flute—awaken the first melody!\""]
	quest.19628EE7288E8F66.title: "Bone Whistle Awakening"
	quest.19689F3D7477D89D.quest_desc: ["The eye of a greedy king faded in solitude; legend says it will bring infinite fortune to its owner."]
	quest.19689F3D7477D89D.quest_subtitle: "Found in Pillager Outpost chests"
	quest.1984ECEC68F48221.quest_desc: [
		"While transmuting resources via &dSpiritfire&r is highly efficient, you can also deploy specialized &9Divination Rods&r to survey and extract raw, hidden deposits directly from the environment."
		""
		"efore scanning, the instrument must be properly calibrated. To attune the rod, simply right-click an overworld block that corresponds to the target material you wish to hunt. For instance, right-clicking standard &aAndesite&r will program the rod's frequencies to detect underground veins of hidden &8Otherstone&r."
		""
		"Once attuned, holding right-click with the rod will project a continuous stream of resonance particles, pointing directly toward the geometric coordinates of the nearest matching node."
		""
		"Note that while the rod handles the physical location tracking, it does not bypass the planar barrier. You must still be under the active status effects of the &3Third Eye&r to pierce the illusion and successfully harvest the revealed blocks."
	]
	quest.1984ECEC68F48221.quest_subtitle: "Hunting for Materials"
	quest.1984ECEC68F48221.title: "Holy Tools"
	quest.198E9E90CC9606C4.quest_desc: [
		"Should your components rest safely upon their perimeters and your fluid reservoirs overflow with &bAureal&r, Souls, &4Blood&r, and &aExperience&r, yet the foundry remains completely motionless, do not despair."
		""
		"To successfully break the stasis and finalize the greater ritual, you must strike the anvil using a forged Gavel tool."
		""
		"This heavy mallet shares the basic structural properties of a mining pickaxe, but it carries a strict, limited number of ritual execution charges."
		""
		"Simply approach the center of your workplace and execute a firm right-click strike directly against the &6&lHephaestus Forge&r block to finalize the transmutation."
	]
	quest.198E9E90CC9606C4.title: "Finishing the Ritual"
	quest.19D02325579F2AA8.quest_desc: [
		"Setting up a Volcanic Sourcelink lets you generate a steady stream of Source power simply by feeding it burnable items and fuel."
		""
		"If you want a massive power boost, toss in a stack of Archwood logs to claim some awesome bonus energy."
		""
		"Keep your boots back while it works: as the link burns through your items, it melts down nearby stone blocks into burning lava pools."
		""
		"This intense volcanic heat also causes unique Lava Lilies to sprout right on top of the newly formed lava!"
	]
	quest.19D03831EB5EED02.quest_desc: ["The Blacksmith is a 3x3 crafter and can make any vanilla tools, armor, swords, and shields (no bows or redstone items). You will need to teach the Blacksmith the recipes of the items you want them to create. "]
	quest.19D03831EB5EED02.quest_subtitle: "Build a Blacksmith Hut"
	quest.1A2EA742FDED54FF.quest_desc: [
		"You'll find &5Echo Soil&r blanketing the forest floor everywhere you look inside the &5Echoing Forests&r."
		""
		"Don't expect this block to behave like the regular &2Grass&r or dirt back home, because it functions very differently."
		""
		"Its most important trait is its strict growth rule: you cannot plant normal trees here, as the soil will only support and grow custom &5Echoing Saplings&r."
	]
	quest.1A2EA742FDED54FF.title: "&5Echo Soil"
	quest.1BB571557F74D3A1.quest_desc: ["As you have explored, you may have encountered abandoned colonies. If you like, you can take over an abandoned colony and repair it. This can be a good way to jumpstart your colony. However, if you want the full colony experience, then it’s recommended that you find a good place to settle your colony and start the old fashioned way. Blood, sweat and tears. "]
	quest.1BB571557F74D3A1.title: "Abandoned Villages"
	quest.1BFE6745F49B4AB0.quest_desc: [
		"You'll find that Sculk Gleam blocks act exactly like the glowing shroomlights you find in the Nether."
		""
		"You can pull them down with your bare hands if you need to, but grabbing a handy Hoe tool will smash through them at lightning speed."
		""
		"Keep your eyes locked on the branches of &5Echoing Trees&r to harvest them easily, or keep a sharp watch while cave-diving since they rarely sprout right out of the underground walls."
	]
	quest.1C16AEE8E29FB5A0.quest_desc: [
		"The rallying banner will summon your Guards to you when used. It’s especially useful in raids, as Guards don’t automatically know where to find the raiders. You must shift + right-click the banner on a Guard tower or Barracks Tower to assigns the Guards in that tower to the rallying banner."
		""
		"Note: Your Guards will not follow you outside the colony border. To bring Guards outside the border, set them to Follow you on the second page of their tower GUI."
	]
	quest.1C45DC9B55C1C92E.quest_desc: ["Obtain a vanilla Ender Chest (8 Obsidian + Eye of Ender). Craft Copper Ender Chest by surrounding it with 8 Copper Blocks for +1 row of storage."]
	quest.1C45DC9B55C1C92E.title: "Copper Vault Start"
	quest.1CF3364C49D91769.quest_desc: [
		"Although a bit expensive, this &dSolar Compressor&r may be an interesting &bAir Compressor&r to have attached to your system as it is a passive source of &bAir Pressure&r!"
		""
		"At &e350°C&r, you'll get the most efficiency out of this device. If it gets too hot, the machine will shut down!"
	]
	quest.1CF3364C49D91769.title: "Solarizing Pressure!"
	quest.1D86B2E553503E53.quest_desc: [
		"The powerful Dominion Wand acts as your primary apparatus for commanding and controlling the various creatures you encounter on your travels."
		""
		"Every entity responds differently to its magical wavelengths, making it vital to study their unique behaviors in the Worn Notebook before initiating contact."
	]
	quest.1DD479334CE2BA84.quest_desc: [
		"The purple chalk is extremely important for those wishing to perform infusions, serving as the main glyph in this type of ritual."
		""
		"Infusions are an extremely different type of ritual, as while summoning and possession bring living creatures into the world, infusion creates objects bound to spirits."
	]
	quest.1DD479334CE2BA84.quest_subtitle: "Chalk of Infusion"
	quest.1E1870FAD295DEDE.quest_desc: [
		"Clear and flatten an area about 20×20 blocks to make space for your camp. The camp cannot be placed if objects block the area. Right-click the supply camp on the ground to see a 3D preview. Use the arrow controls to position the camp within your cleared space, then click the green checkmark to place it. "
		""
		"If placement fails, the terrain is still in the way, remove obstacles until it fits. Red lines will mark spots that need further clearing."
	]
	quest.1E1CDD8683686AF1.quest_desc: [
		"Sends items from the Router to target inventories."
		""
		"Mk1: Sends items to a single face."
		""
		"Mk2: Improved targeting and range."
		""
		"Mk3: Advanced sending with extended range and greater configurability."
	]
	quest.1E39AB995B86D47A.quest_desc: [
		"By applying a &bPolyethylene&r layer to your &aBasic Pressure Tubes&r, you're able to upgrade them to &2Reinforced Pressure Tubes&r, allowing them to handle up to 10 &bBAR&r of pressure!"
		""
		"&cMake sure to balance your pressure system accordingly!&r"
	]
	quest.1E8AEFFA2E43CAFC.quest_desc: [
		"Your structural offerings are not strictly limited to basic stone; you can also manufacture &cCopper Sacrificial Bowls&r and &cSilver Sacrificial Bowls&r to line your pentacle perimeters."
		""
		"While these metallic tiers are entirely cosmetic and introduce zero functional modifications to your ritual speed or material efficiency, they provide a significantly more polished, high-tier architectural aesthetic for an established automation laboratory."
	]
	quest.1E8AEFFA2E43CAFC.title: "Aesthetic Realignment"
	quest.1EDACB5638D90DF7.quest_desc: [
		"Templates add special upgrades to your Construction Sticks. To apply a template, combine the stick, template, and an additional item in a Smithing Table."
		""
		"Battery: Lets the stick use RF instead of durability."
	]
	quest.1F17301583AAC913.quest_desc: [
		"Transfers filtered items from an inventory block in the world (such as chests, barrels, or other modded containers) into the backpack when the block is shift-right-clicked with the backpack in hand."
		""
		"The regular upgrade filters by item and provides 9 filter slots."
	]
	quest.1F2735EA695A462F.quest_desc: ["Obtain every survival obtainable explosive. [may be impossible on servers due to blacklisted items]"]
	quest.1F2735EA695A462F.title: "We do a little trolling"
	quest.1F47F9E78663766C.quest_desc: ["In order to start the quest line, you will first need to acquire a Method to smelt materials!"]
	quest.1F70366D737E9FBC.quest_desc: [
		"You will find a cross-mod bridge from Ars Nouveau resting within this tech branch, made possible by the integration features of Ars Occultas. This bridge allows your summoned entities—such as the &aFoliot Crusher&r—to be securely housed inside these containment jars."
		""
		"Once an entity is sealed inside, you can pipe raw materials directly into the jar's input matrix. The resident spirit will instantly process the items and automatically export the finished products into any directly adjacent inventory."
		""
		"When configuring your logistics lines, note that utilizing the bottom face of the jar provides the most consistent and reliable automation export connection. Be aware that if no valid storage container or pipe interface is detected on an adjacent face, the spirit will simply drop the processed items directly into the world as loose entities."
	]
	quest.1F70366D737E9FBC.quest_subtitle: "Imprisoning lesser entities to server as infinite, power-free factory workers"
	quest.1F70366D737E9FBC.title: "Arcane Isolation: &aContainment Jar"
	quest.2002AB7D061007FA.quest_desc: [
		"The coveted &6Artisan Relic&r is an ancient tool found tucked away inside the specialized chests of select village workshops."
		""
		"When placed within the burning core of the &l&bClibano&r forge, it unlocks the molecular secrets required to forge dark &5Obsidiansteel&r."
		""
		"Alternatively, slotting this relic into your ritual foundry tunes its magical resonance, granting a permanent, significant discount on the amount of &aExperience&rr consumed during your crafting loops."
	]
	quest.2002AB7D061007FA.title: "&6Artisan Relics"
	quest.20090C572AB8333D.quest_desc: [
		"The Configuration Tool is used to lock drawers so they remember the item stored inside them. This is especially useful for automated systems that push items into or pull items out of drawers."
		""
		"When a drawer is locked, it will only accept the locked item and will not be replaced by a different one, ensuring consistent and reliable storage behavior."
	]
	quest.201CB898A399F1D5.quest_desc: [
		"The Swineherd’s Hut is where the Swineherd will breed and butcher pigs for food. You will have to capture and bring in two pigs to the Swineherd’s Hut, as the Swineherd will not catch and bring in any pigs."
		""
		"The Swineherd will only keep two pigs alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten pigs in their holding pens."
	]
	quest.201CB898A399F1D5.quest_subtitle: "Build a Swineherd's Hut"
	quest.201E3E41018F9521.quest_desc: [
		"You'll find &6Gloomy Cacti&r growing all over the burning hot &cOvercast Columns&r, and they act almost exactly like regular &2Cacti&r. "
		""
		"They thrive in the blistering heat, don't need a single drop of &9Water&r to grow tall, and will absolutely hurt you if you touch their sharp edges. "
		""
		"So, is there actually any difference between them? "
		""
		"Yes, there is one awesome shortcut: tossing these volcanic plants into a camp furnace melts them down into a handy stack of &6Orange Dye&r instead of regular &2Green&r dye!"
	]
	quest.201E3E41018F9521.title: "&6Gloomy Cacti"
	quest.202C506FA06B4E39.quest_desc: [
		"Bought from &dMaster-level Cleric Villagers&r for &bEmeralds&r and 1 &bRabbit's Foot&r."
		""
		"A holy talisman said to protect its owner from bad luck."
	]
	quest.206159A3C7A78447.quest_desc: [
		"The Mystical Site is a simple building that increase a colony's overall happiness level. It has no worker and increases colonists' happiness just by existing."
		""
		"The Mystical Site also gives a bonus to the maximum resurrection chance of the Undertaker."
		""
		"Before you get too excited. No, there is no benefit or bonus from building multiple mystical sites. "
	]
	quest.206159A3C7A78447.quest_subtitle: "Build a Mystical Site"
	quest.20FCE8AB21764DE4.quest_desc: ["Modify how many items can fit in a single slot of the backpack’s inventory by 4x"]
	quest.21398F45428CD1D1.quest_desc: [
		"Keep your eyes on the ceiling when exploring to spot &6Bloom Berries&r growing from the long &bGlowing Vines&r inside the &bBlooming Caverns&r."
		""
		"As you travel beneath them, you'll see these bright fruits hanging down, waiting for you to walk up and pluck them right off the &bVine&r using a simple right-click."
		""
		"Make sure to hoard every single berry you can squeeze into your packs; this survival fruit is the absolute only wild food source you will ever find inside the entire &3&lOtherside&r dimension."
	]
	quest.21398F45428CD1D1.title: "&6Bloom Berries"
	quest.214ECB445EE4AA5E.quest_desc: [
		"The advanced upgrade adds options to match or ignore potion duration and amplifier."
		""
		"Also includes logic for multi-effect items: choose whether to trigger when a single effect is missing or only when all effects have worn off."
	]
	quest.21693C4DE6531D73.quest_desc: [
		"The Crusher is just as the name suggests. "
		""
		"It can crush blocks to get the crafting materials, like bricks from a brick staircase, or dusts from ingots."
		""
		"It needs power to work though!"
		""
		"To build one it's 3x2x2 of Crusher blocks."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/rail_crusher.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.217C5C65AFC95842.quest_desc: [
		"Small and good for working off the ground... building, mining a cave roof, etc."
		""
		"Burns fuel, has one upgrade slot, one weapon slot, and some storage space."
	]
	quest.217C772DBDB25B01.quest_desc: [
		"The red chalk is made from the very essence of Afrit, making its glyphs directly connected to these spirits. Additionally, it elevates the pentacles capacity to the most demonic levels."
		""
		"These properties allow for an incredible achievement that has been sought for ages before being attained: the summoning of an Afrit bound to the occultist."
		""
		"To obtain the essence for red chalk you need to summon and kill an Unbound Afrit."
	]
	quest.217C772DBDB25B01.quest_subtitle: "The Afrit Control Chalk"
	quest.217D00C12D48AE9D.quest_subtitle: "Open 25 containers"
	quest.21823DAA3BA618FB.quest_desc: ["Collect initial Naga Scales from Labyrinth."]
	quest.21823DAA3BA618FB.title: "Naga's First Scale"
	quest.21CF85C6230F38E1.quest_desc: [
		"The lime chalk attracts greater spirits than Foliots. Anyone wishing to elevate the level of their rituals will need this chalk."
		""
		"Made with valuable gems infused with experiences, lime glyphs become especially interesting to demonstrate that yours skills have surpassed the basic level."
	]
	quest.21CF85C6230F38E1.quest_subtitle: "The Knowledge Chalk"
	quest.21FF14E8B61F515F.quest_desc: [
		"Reaching the pinnacle of geometric design allows you to permanently solve the inventory clutter of your scribing toolkit. Activating the ultimate matrix of &dRonaza's Contact&r allows you to combine your entire chemical arsenal into a singular, mastery-tier instrument: the Rainbow Chalk."
		""
		"Once forged from the center of the circle, this tool completely eliminates the need to haul sixteen separate colored chalk sticks across your base. When drawn into the world, the chalk creates a fluctuating, color-changing rune that dynamically morphs its frequency to satisfy the requirements of any colored glyph modifier within a multi-block layout. Furthermore, this advanced apparatus possesses infinite durability, removing all future tool restoration or material re-smelting cycles from your automation routine."
		""
		"Note that the rainbow matrix is strictly tuned to handle color parameters. It cannot mirror the dense material foundations required by monochrome paths (White, Light Gray, Gray, and Black Chalk). To achieve complete multi-block consolidation for your foundational lines, you must advance a step further and manufacture its sister component, the Void Chalk, to handle your base structural geometry."
	]
	quest.21FF14E8B61F515F.quest_subtitle: "Consolidating the colored runic spectrum into a single, infinite modifier tool."
	quest.21FF14E8B61F515F.title: "The Ultimate Medium: Rainbow Chalk"
	quest.2212968595CFA436.quest_desc: ["The Ender Drawer provides cross-dimensional storage. Any Ender Drawer with the same configuration shares its contents, allowing instant access to stored items from anywhere in the world—or beyond."]
	quest.226176A1C73431B5.quest_desc: ["Assign 5 fields to a single worker."]
	quest.226176A1C73431B5.quest_subtitle: "Get To Work!"
	quest.227DBA8836021B0B.quest_desc: [
		"The fundamental energy matrix that powers all arcane machinery within this discipline is known as &9Source&r."
		""
		"To begin harvesting and accumulating this fluid power, you must first construct a specialized Source Jar storage vessel."
		""
		"This volatile essence is highly mobile; you can safely transport it across your facility utilizing standard iron buckets, or relocate entire networks by simply fracturing and picking up full Source Jars into your inventory."
	]
	quest.227DBA8836021B0B.quest_subtitle: "Storing Source"
	quest.228C9567BB43034A.quest_desc: ["The &aPneumatic Dynamo&r converts excess &bAir Pressure into &cFE&r."]
	quest.228C9567BB43034A.title: "Pressurizing Energy!"
	quest.22F4C38E79DEFF1E.quest_desc: ["When placing any building, including your supply camp or ship. You will have the option to change your colony style. Click the “Switch Pack” button to open a menu with many styles to choose from. If you want to get an idea of the styles before you build, go to youtube and search \"&eMineColonies Build Styles&r\". Note: This pack includes a number of additional styles not shown in the video."]
	quest.22F4C38E79DEFF1E.title: "Colony Styles"
	quest.23012F6C4C522CEB.quest_desc: ["The Forester is an essential worker in your colony. They will chop down trees and replant a sapling in the tree’s place. Foresters will chop any tree in the immediate area. However, this area can be restricted using a &ezoning tool&r available in the hut block. "]
	quest.23012F6C4C522CEB.quest_subtitle: "Build the Forester's Hut"
	quest.230EEE4671B46D0C.quest_desc: [
		"The dense &9Darkstone&r deposits form deep within the lowest roots of the world, generating near molten lava lakes around Y-level -54."
		""
		"This mineral stands as the absolute most heavily utilized block within &6&lForbidden \\& Arcanus&r, acting as the mandatory foundation for all advanced multiblock structures."
		""
		"Ensure your inventories are completely stocked with this material before attempting any greater rituals."
	]
	quest.230EEE4671B46D0C.title: "&9Darkstone"
	quest.237D5EDE454F371F.quest_desc: ["A Controller Access Point acts as a remote extension of a linked Storage Controller. When connected, it behaves like the controller itself, allowing easy access to the entire drawer network from multiple locations."]
	quest.2381C47AEBC57007.quest_desc: ["Stack Downgrades divide the max stack size by 8."]
	quest.238567E4FDC2CAEA.quest_desc: ["Conquer the Snow Queen in Glacier."]
	quest.238567E4FDC2CAEA.title: "Snow Queen's Demise"
	quest.23B52E0E36C36D80.quest_desc: [
		"Allows a backpack to store other backpacks—one level deep."
		""
		"Nesting is limited to a single level: backpacks placed inside cannot contain additional backpacks."
		""
		"Upgrades in nested backpacks remain functional—for example, a Pickup Upgrade inside a sub-backpack can collect items directly into it."
		""
		"Upgrades in the main backpack can access inventories of nested backpacks, with a configurable option to prioritize either the main backpack or sub-backpacks first."
		""
		"Filter Upgrades in nested backpacks can be used to control what items are inserted into or extracted from them."
		""
		"Sub-backpacks can be opened using the open backpack key while hovering the cursor over them."
	]
	quest.23DB36F62D07026B.quest_desc: [
		"Constructing the complex geometric matrix for &dOsorin's Unbound Calling&r marks your entry into the second operational tier of &dDemon-less rituals&r. Because the foundational tier of this discipline focuses strictly on niche auxiliary operations—such as resurrecting fallen Familiars or cleansing hostile Vexes into friendly Allays—you can completely bypass it to focus your logistical resources here."
		""
		"This advanced, autonomous ritual circuit serves as a critical alternative manufacturing forge. By drawing upon raw energy directly from your chalk geometry rather than a bound entity, the matrix allows you to cleanly synthesize an immense array of exotic blocks, rare items, and dense materials that are otherwise locked behind complex inter-dimensional exploration loops or highly gated crafting recipes."
	]
	quest.23DB36F62D07026B.quest_subtitle: "Bypassing production bottlenecks through advanced demon-less transmutations."
	quest.23DB36F62D07026B.title: "Material Synthesis: &dOsorin's Unbound Calling&r"
	quest.2444EAF58C073E51.quest_desc: [
		"The basic &aAir Compressor&r is one of the first and easiest methods of generating &bPressure&r."
		""
		"This device will consume burnable materials like coal or charcoal to generate &bAir Pressure&r for the network. Be careful not to over-pressurize your systems or they will blow up!"
		""
		"We've gifted you a &aSafety Tube Module&r to help with your first &bPressure&r system."
		""
		"These modules will help vent excess &bPressure&r when connected to your system, but aren't a great solution for the long term!"
	]
	quest.2444EAF58C073E51.title: "Generating &bAir Pressure"
	quest.249E5C6893387E15.quest_desc: [
		"These &cTracks&r are made for stopping the &1Locomotives&r and &7Carts&r. "
		""
		"The &cLocking Kit&r stops &7Carts&r and only starts them when given a redstone pulse. "
		""
		"The &cBuffer Kit&r is for the end of your &6tracks&r, will stop them and not start. "
		""
		"The &cGated Kit&r just deploys a Fence Gate connected with the &6track&r."
	]
	quest.249E5C6893387E15.title: "Track Kits"
	quest.24BEB50721FCB1B8.quest_desc: ["The Storage Controller lets you link multiple drawers together into a single storage network—even if they aren’t directly touching. Its linking range can be expanded further using upgrades, allowing for cleaner and more flexible storage layouts."]
	quest.250CFC5583149BAD.quest_desc: ["Obtain every ultimate item!"]
	quest.250CFC5583149BAD.title: "Ultimate Everything"
	quest.2559201BCF5D497C.quest_subtitle: "Makes various Overworld Materials"
	quest.2589FD5F6345FE54.quest_desc: ["Craft Iron Ender Chest by surrounding a vanilla Ender Chest with 8 Iron Blocks for reinforced void storage."]
	quest.2589FD5F6345FE54.title: "Iron Vault Upgrade"
	quest.2598273041353196.quest_desc: [
		"When building the &aReprocessor&r, you will need at least one &eCollector&r and &9Waste Injector&r."
		""
		"The &eReprocessor Collector&r must be placed in the center of the bottom face of the structure."
		""
		"The &9Waste Injector&r must go in the center of the top face, which is where you'll pipe in or insert waste like &9Cyanite Ingots&r."
	]
	quest.2598273041353196.title: "Importing Waste"
	quest.25D4406CB86C8CBB.quest_desc: [
		"Now that we are collecting some &9waste&r from our reactor, part of the progression requires you to \"Fluidize\" some of the ingots you get. "
		""
		"You know what that means?\\n\\nWe need to make a &aFluidizer&r! "
		""
		"The main component is the &aFluidizer Controller&r. Once built, you can right-click on this to open up the interface. "
		""
		"Here, you can turn it on or off, see what's inside, and the current power level."
	]
	quest.2608E085D544C48D.quest_desc: ["Throws items forward with force. Items are launched several blocks away, making this module useful for long-distance or vertical item transport without pipes"]
	quest.2673AD681C56141F.quest_desc: [
		"Pulls items into the Router from inventories at a distance."
		""
		"Mk1: Adjacent inventory extraction."
		""
		"Mk2: Longer range and improved control."
	]
	quest.26ACAAF08905AF85.quest_desc: [
		"Utilizing the structural alignment of &aIhagan's Enthrallment&r, you can execute a low-tier flying organism—such as an Allay, Bat, Bee, or Parrot—to anchor an otherworldly spirit to the physical plane. This sacrificial reaction forces the entity to manifest in the world as a highly hostile &6Possessed Bee&r."
		""
		"Upon terminating this corrupted entity, the matrix will collapse and yield Cursed Honey. This volatile byproduct cannot be consumed normally, serving instead as the core chemical ingredient strictly required to refine and manufacture your next tier of Orange Chalk."
	]
	quest.26ACAAF08905AF85.quest_subtitle: "Extracting localized biological drops for mid-tier chalk modifiers."
	quest.26ACAAF08905AF85.title: "Alchemical Metamorphosis: &aIhagan's Enthrallment&r"
	quest.26AF4FB29C97EA51.quest_desc: [
		"The advanced upgrade offers 16 slots and supports filtering by item, mod, tag, NBT data, and damage values."
		""
		"Additionally, it can be configured to only pick up items that already exist in the backpack, using its current contents as an additional filter."
	]
	quest.26B6680DCE14A228.quest_desc: [
		"The &aCharging Station&r allows you to fill items up with &bCompressed Air&r. "
		""
		"It will only fill items to have equal &bPressure&r that the &aCharging Station&r itself has."
		""
		"If the item has higher pressure than the &aCharging Station&r, it will empty itself back into the network."
	]
	quest.26B7DA23766E4599.quest_desc: ["Copper Construction Sticks allow you to place 9 blocks at once."]
	quest.26D57243EFEE3D30.quest_desc: [
		"The Demagnetization Coil prevents items from being attracted by magnets"
		""
		"Effective area can be adjusted up to 3 blocks away"
	]
	quest.26FDEE21CE8BBD6C.quest_desc: [
		"The denizens of the Otherworld demand a proper atmosphere, and almost every ritual requires the soft glow of candlelight to anchor the entities to our realm.To harvest the raw materials, craft a &aButcher Knife&r and slay livestock—such as pigs, cows, sheep, horses, or wandering trader llamas—to extract their &aTallow&r for candle crafting. "
		""
		"Alternatively, standard vanilla candles can serve as an acceptable substitute if you prefer to bypass the slaughter. &mJust don't ask what the wandering trader thinks about your resource gathering.&r"
		""
		"In addition to lighting, the ambient energy must be focused. "
		""
		"&9Spirit Attuned Crystals&r act as vital focal points for several upcoming advanced rituals, making it wise to secure a steady supply of them immediately."
	]
	quest.26FDEE21CE8BBD6C.title: "Preparing for a Ritual: &aCandles"
	quest.27740D07F0171A15.title: "Engineer gaming"
	quest.27D6FC212DDB2780.quest_desc: ["Transports items (like blocks, resources, etc.) between inventories or machines. You use a pipe wrench to set extraction points. "]
	quest.27D6FC212DDB2780.quest_subtitle: "Slow and steady"
	quest.27EECB88BB0C0785.quest_desc: [
		"Blank Upgrades are the base crafting component used to create all Modular Routers upgrades."
		""
		"Upgrades are installed directly into a Router, which can hold up to 5 upgrades at once."
		""
		"Installed upgrades apply globally to the Router, affecting all compatible modules, and most upgrades stack for increased effect."
	]
	quest.280CE3501C284433.quest_desc: [
		"This is the first chalk in the journey of any occultist. Due to its simplicity, it serves as a weak foundation. Pentacles drawn only with this chalk attract only the weakest spirits, known as Folit."
		""
		"In almost any pentacle where you see a white glyph, it can be replaced with another \"colorless\" chalk (light gray, gray, or black)."
	]
	quest.280CE3501C284433.title: "Basic Chalk"
	quest.283AB56F81EF03A5.quest_desc: ["In order to power your &6Electric Rails&r and your &eElectric Locomotive&r you'll need &eFrames. Frames&r need to be powered and will move power to each connected to &eFrame&r."]
	quest.2869AB982799CF0C.quest_desc: ["The &cOne Way Track Kit&r is quite simple. &7Carts&r can only go where the arrow is facing."]
	quest.288F955FF1F2965B.quest_desc: ["Increases how often the Router and its modules operate. Multiple Speed Upgrades stack, allowing modules to run significantly faster."]
	quest.291AF252E3415CC1.quest_desc: [
		"Utilizing the stabilization field of &eEziveus' Spectral Compulsion&r, you can expose a myriad of mundane, organic overworld blocks to the essence of the Otherworld. This process breaks down their botanical matrices, refining the plant matter into a highly concentrated &2Nature Paste&r."
		""
		"Once harvested from the center of the infusion circle, combine this viscous paste with your standard Impure White Chalk in a crafting grid. The organic concentrate will permanently dye and reprogram the medium, allowing you to finalize the manufacture of your first sticks of Green Chalk."
	]
	quest.291AF252E3415CC1.quest_subtitle: "Imbuing baseline flora into concentrated alchemical pastes."
	quest.291AF252E3415CC1.title: "Organic Extraction: &2Green Chalk&r"
	quest.29434DB0CC2E30E6.quest_desc: [
		"By combining a measure of volatile &cMundabitur Dust&r, refined &bArcane Crystal Dust&r, common &8Charcoal&r, and a pure &eGold Ingot&r, you will forge your very first magical alloy: the &6Deorum Ingot&r."
		""
		"This radiant metal stands as the foundational material for all advanced research in &6&lForbidden \\& Arcanus&r, meaning an artisan must accumulate dozens of bars to progress."
		""
		"Its primary application involves smithing the high-tier structural elements and component tiles required to assemble your multiblock machinery."
	]
	quest.29434DB0CC2E30E6.title: "&6Deorum"
	quest.295C77EEC89000FC.quest_desc: [
		"Setting up a Vitalic Sourcelink is the ultimate shortcut to power if you already have a working mob grinder or animal farm."
		""
		"This clever machine generates massive streams of Source energy by detecting creature deaths and animal breeding events within 15 blocks."
		""
		"It fits perfectly on top of a standard mob farm, turning enemy drops into pure magical fuel."
		""
		"As an awesome bonus, any baby animals standing close to the link will absorb its energy and grow up much faster, trickling even more power back into your storage jars while they age!"
	]
	quest.295C77EEC89000FC.quest_subtitle: "Source from Mobs and Animals"
	quest.29953CDAA8A3B0B6.quest_desc: [
		"This operation marks the final entry in the Abras ritual sequence, engineered to breach the deep layers of the Otherworld and pull a top-tier, highly volatile &9Marid&r fire spirit across the planar barrier."
		""
		"This matrix functions as a direct combat challenge. Because the ritual lacks any compliance overrides, the entity cannot be &9bind&r-shackled to an inventory; you must terminate it manually the moment it manifests."
		""
		"To initiate the circle, dress your peripheral bowls with the required reagents, stand back, and throw a Trident directly into your central Golden Sacrificial Bowl. The weapon will be consumed upon impact, instantly starting the ritual and spawning the hostile target into your arena."
	]
	quest.29953CDAA8A3B0B6.quest_subtitle: "Sacrificing forged weaponry to ignite a volatile, high-density elemental rift."
	quest.29953CDAA8A3B0B6.title: "Planar Concussion: The &9Marid&r Breach"
	quest.299CD86325D3D74B.quest_desc: [
		"&aHeat Sinks&r can be placed on a block or machine to help dissipate &cHeat&r faster!"
		""
		"Their effectiveness can be greatly increased by using an &aAir Grate&r to vent air over the fins. Combining that with the use of &aVortex Tubes&r can effectively handle all of your temperature problems!"
		""
		"&eNote&r: Once a &aHeat Sink&r reaches over 60C or under -60C, it will &cdeal damage when touched&r."
	]
	quest.2A20000FAEC2E16A.quest_desc: [
		"To extract power or items from your reactor, or even input fuel, you'll need these &crequired&r blocks."
		""
		"The &cPower Tap&r provides a way for you to \"tap\" into the power that a &9passive&r reactor makes. You can attach pipes and cables to extract the power from it."
		""
		"The &aAccess Ports&r are required for every reactor, and allows you to both input fuel from the reactor, or extract waste. It's usually a good idea to have 2 per reactor, one for each job."
	]
	quest.2A20000FAEC2E16A.title: "Interacting with the Reactor"
	quest.2A30595DC6DDBFF7.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Electric Tracks&r are used for the &eElectric Locomotives&r. "
		""
		"They'll need to be powered by &eFrames&r and yes it will hurt you if you touch it."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/rail_electric_rail.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.2A4B50335E293ECA.quest_desc: [
		"Pulls items into the Router from inventories at a distance."
		""
		"Mk1: Adjacent inventory extraction."
		""
		"Mk2: Longer range and improved control."
	]
	quest.2A8B07F1F97A97A0.quest_desc: ["Hunt Drowned (rivers/oceans; 11% Copper Ingot drop for more lanterns)."]
	quest.2AB0FA084739827A.quest_desc: [
		"To actually use a &9Tunnel Bore&r you'll need a &9Tunnel Bore Head&r."
		""
		"They come in 4 different styles and it mines dependent on the &9Bore Head&r."
		""
		"It can be enchanted and has durability so you'll want to enchant it!"
	]
	quest.2AB0FA084739827A.title: "Tunnel Bore Heads"
	quest.2ADA491A2485061C.quest_desc: [
		"Pure &aExperience&r serves as the fourth and final component required to satiate the internal chambers of your &6&lHephaestus Forge&r."
		""
		"To store your mystical wisdom inside the forge's repository, you must insert one of three distinct vessels into the dedicated Experience Slot."
		""
		"Your first and most potent option is the dense &aXpetrified Orb&r, which floods the forge with massive reserves of raw energy."
		""
		"Alternatively, you may sacrifice common &aBottles 'O Enchanting&r, which offer smaller allocations of power but remain effortless to stockpile."
		""
		"Finally, you can surrender unwanted &5Enchanted Items&r to the core; the furnace will systematically strip away and destroy the active &5Enchantments&r, distilling the magical residue down into pure forge fuel."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/forbidden_experience.png width:135 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.2ADA491A2485061C.title: "&aExperience"
	quest.2AF31F1769085641.quest_desc: [
		"The &aReprocessor&r is a 3x3x7 multiblock structure that has specific rules to complete the construction of the multiblock."
		""
		"The heart of this multiblock is the &aController&r, and can be placed on any vertical face as long as it isn't on the frame."
	]
	quest.2B02110EEC3DA550.quest_desc: ["Craft Label (JEI/REI recipe). Place on storage blocks. Shift+RMB with item to set icon. Click to open chest behind. Dye/Glow/Feather for extras."]
	quest.2BA63583A45DDB4C.quest_desc: [
		"The Divination Rod is a tool used to sense the presence of hidden Otherworldly materials. When held, it responds to energies beneath the surface, guiding you toward resources that cannot be easily found by mundane means."
		""
		"To use the Divination Rod, hold it in your hand and focus its power. It will reveal signs and disturbances that point toward nearby Occultism-related materials, such as Otherstone or spirit-touched resources. The rod does not extract these materials—it merely reveals their location."
		""
		"The Divination Rod is most commonly crafted using Spirit Attuned Gems, making it one of the earliest tools forged through true interaction with the Otherworld."
	]
	quest.2C6C51B40A7C8F4A.quest_desc: ["Defeat Alpha Yeti for fur."]
	quest.2C6C51B40A7C8F4A.title: "Alpha Yeti"
	quest.2D00F85379A4D591.quest_desc: [
		"The Item Loader is the most basic dispenser from RailCraft. "
		""
		"It has to be above the &6Track&r and can be configured to what you'll want loaded onto your &7Carts&r below."
	]
	quest.2D02A193448879DF.quest_desc: ["Destroys items routed into it. Ideal for trashing excess items and preventing inventory backups."]
	quest.2D0CF18C8B2ABB7D.quest_desc: [
		"Placing this generator down next to growing crops or tree saplings will start trickling Source energy right into your jars."
		""
		"If you want to maximize your power output, plant native Archwood trees around it instead, as they produce way more energy than regular plants."
		""
		"Just keep in mind that using bone meal to cheat the growth timers won't generate any extra power...."
	]
	quest.2D0CF18C8B2ABB7D.quest_subtitle: "Source from Plants"
	quest.2D16F4D3D45F4B74.quest_desc: ["Unlocks filtering modes (blacklist, whitelist, NBT matching, destination targeting) and improves transfer speeds."]
	quest.2D171E6A87DAD0C5.quest_desc: ["Hunt the Knight Phantom in Dark Tower."]
	quest.2D171E6A87DAD0C5.title: "Phantom Veil"
	quest.2D215A9C93448AAC.quest_desc: ["Hunt Sheep for wool/dyes to color skins (shear or drop)."]
	quest.2D3C8905B783A212.quest_desc: [
		"Mixing together a few basic mob drops and a handful of crushed &bArcane Crystal Dust&r at your workbench creates &cMundabitur Dust&r."
		""
		"This item is an absolutely vital ingredient for your progression, as you'll need it to spark and create almost all your multiblock machines."
		""
		"If you don't feel like crafting it yourself, you can actually skip the recipe entirely by raiding the loot chests out in distant &dEnd Cities&r—which is exactly what most adventurers end up doing anyway!"
	]
	quest.2D3C8905B783A212.title: "&cMundabitur Dust"
	quest.2D592669F4D41793.quest_desc: ["Just like the Reactor, the frame must be built out of &dCasings&r, but the walls can be &9Turbine Glass&r instead!"]
	quest.2D592669F4D41793.title: "Glass Case"
	quest.2D63956F36A19897.quest_desc: ["Claim Lich Trophy from Hollow Hill"]
	quest.2D63956F36A19897.title: "Lich Essence"
	quest.2D7161D9084B377B.quest_desc: [
		"Executing &6Abras' Open Commanding Conjure&r programs your ritual field to forcefully tether a volatile &cAfrit&r fire spirit directly into the physical mass of an overworld pig. Because your facility performs this ceremony without the structural stabilization field of Red Chalk, the grid's containment parameters are severely compromised—meaning the matrix is only strong enough to manifest a highly aggressive, &9unbound&r entity."
		""
		"Upon triggering the circle, the host organism will rapidly mutate into an &cAfrit&r-possessed Zombified Piglin. You must engage and terminate this creature in close-quarters combat to harvest its corrupted tissue samples. Collecting its dropped Demonic Meat is critical, as this organic byproduct acts as the primary chemical binding agent required to forge your Pink Chalk runic modifiers."
		""
		"&4WARNING: THE EXTRADIMENSIONAL HARVEST YIELDS ARE VARIABLE; YOU WILL LIKELY NEED TO CYCLE THIS RITUAL MATRIX MULTIPLE TIMES TO SECURE AN ADEQUATE QUANTITY OF DEMONIC MEAT FOR YOUR OPERATIONS.&r"
	]
	quest.2D7161D9084B377B.quest_subtitle: "Bypassing stabilization thresholds to force hostile biological drops."
	quest.2D7161D9084B377B.title: "Uncontrolled Mutation: &6Abras' Open Commanding Conjure&r"
	quest.2E70888BC80EB896.quest_desc: ["Drops items from the Router into the world as item entities. Direction and drop behavior can be controlled for simple world-based item output."]
	quest.2E73FF0E211D59CA.quest_desc: ["Take your New Terracotta blocks and convert them into glass for use with windows and epic builds!"]
	quest.2E73FF0E211D59CA.title: "Advanced Patterned Glass"
	quest.2E992FB8259EAEB3.quest_desc: [
		"Teleports nearby items directly into the backpack if they fall within range based on a configurable filter. When worn, items around the player are automatically collected into the backpack. When placed in the world, the backpack collects items from its surroundings in the same range."
		""
		"The regular upgrade filters by item and provides 9 filter slots."
	]
	quest.2EBA483444582212.quest_desc: ["Omega upgrade raises the limit to the maximum possible value (2,147,483,647)"]
	quest.2EBA483444582212.quest_subtitle: "Practically Infinate"
	quest.2ED55B61E5F32D74.quest_desc: [
		"Automatically feeds the player using food stored in the backpack when they become hungry."
		""
		"Includes filters to control which food items can be used—useful for avoiding items with negative effects like rotten flesh."
	]
	quest.2F91C4B265C670BE.quest_desc: [
		"When pressurized, the &bAerial Interface&r exposes your inventory as if it were in a chest. Any items inserted into the interface enter your inventory instead."
		""
		"Your main inventory is accessed from any horizontal side while your armor is the top face. This can be changed in the UI."
		""
		"Having this set up also provides water breathing, at an additional &bAir Pressure&r cost. If you provide it with FE, it will also wirelessly charge all your items! A dispenser upgrade will automatically eat for you, as well as allowing you to pipe experience in and out."
		""
		"This can be used to keep your chestplate charged, and your chestplate can be upgraded to charge all other PNC armors and items."
	]
	quest.2FD5037D4E720043.quest_subtitle: "It makes all the things"
	quest.2FD5037D4E720043.title: "All The Utility"
	quest.2FE6737D0DF28142.quest_desc: [
		"If you prefer to delay the dangerous construction parameters required to bind a high-tier &9Marid Crusher&r for your &bLight Blue Chalk&r components, you can deploy an intermediate &aDjinni Crusher&r as an efficient stopgap."
		""
		"To manifest this tier of entity, you must construct the pentacle for &aOphyx' Calling&r. This multi-block matrix acts as your primary anchor for binding &aDjinnis&r to physical vessel frameworks. From a manufacturing standpoint, these spirits operate at a significantly higher throughput than lower-tier Foliots, though they still lag behind the extreme operational speeds of advanced &cAfrits&r or &9Marids&r."
		""
		"Beyond baseline speed upgrades, Djinni-class thralls possess unique thermal dampening properties: they are fully capable of crushing dense ice blocks into packed materials without generating the ambient friction heat that would otherwise melt the resources into waste fluid."
	]
	quest.2FE6737D0DF28142.quest_subtitle: "Scaling processing speed and temperature-controlled crushing lines. "
	quest.2FE6737D0DF28142.title: "Mid-tier Automation: &aOphyx' Calling&r"
	quest.31094CC16E710040.quest_desc: [
		"The &4Crowbar&r is the main tool of RailCraft. "
		""
		"When used on a &1Locomotive&r it will change the direction it's facing. "
		""
		"When shift clicked you can connect &1Locomotives&r and &7Carts&r. "
		""
		"When just used on &7Carts&r they give them a slight push. "
		""
		"And when used on special tracks they change their mode. "
		""
		"The different &4Crowbars&r just give different looks and damage."
	]
	quest.31094CC16E710040.title: "Crowbars"
	quest.31318B1D7806B7C2.quest_desc: [
		"Automatically collects items into the backpack based on a configurable filter. When worn, items the player would normally pick up are sent directly into the backpack. When placed in the world, the backpack collects nearby items that come into contact with it."
		""
		"The regular upgrade filters by item and provides 9 filter slots."
	]
	quest.313E80051D941AEC.quest_desc: ["Craft basic Shelf (JEI recipe; store/display items). Available in all vanilla woods."]
	quest.3142A40E1EAEBAA3.quest_desc: [
		"Deploying the mystical &6Dowsing Rod&r grants a sorcerer active bursts of Magic Find and Scrying attributes upon use."
		""
		"Channeling this artifact reveals the hidden silhouettes of nearby magical creatures through solid terrain, while simultaneously tuning your awareness to help you locate buried veins of amethyst gems."
	]
	quest.3142A40E1EAEBAA3.quest_subtitle: "Magic Finder"
	quest.3182E8AF755104E4.quest_desc: [
		"The protective &9Enchanter's Shield&r functions as a vital defensive arm, granting a brief surge of Mana Regeneration and Spell Damage statistics whenever you successfully block incoming physical trauma."
		""
		"Furthermore, this master-crafted bulwark features an autonomous restoration matrix, drawing steadily upon your personal mana pool to automatically repair its own broken durability over time."
	]
	quest.31AD9826FB036C98.quest_desc: [
		"The ancient &7Runes&r form within the deepest roots of the world, generating from the bedrock layers up to Y-level 2."
		""
		"They are frequently discovered nestled directly alongside veins of &9Darkstone&r."
		""
		"In terms of your ongoing progression, these artifacts prove more broadly useful than unstable &2Stellarite&r, though you will not require them in the massive quantities demanded by &bArcane Crystals&r."
	]
	quest.31AD9826FB036C98.title: "Runes"
	quest.31B06C6ACEF764E0.quest_desc: [
		"Before we can start crafting advanced technology, we'll need to find some &0Crude Oil&r first."
		""
		"Using a &aSeismic Sensor&r can help you locate these &bOil Deposits&r underground."
	]
	quest.31B06C6ACEF764E0.title: "Thar Be Oil in Them Hills...."
	quest.31B5D8AEF1823C4B.quest_desc: [
		"Restricts which items can be inserted into or extracted from the backpack via automation."
		""
		"The regular upgrade filters by item and provides 9 filter slots."
	]
	quest.31E1B965099E6121.quest_desc: [
		"Forging the rainbow chalk is a service provided by an Eldritch Spirit. This chalk can replace any chalk, with extra features."
		""
		"1. Use an attuned gem to toggle the random color changes or use any dye to set the color of glyph, items will not be consumed."
		""
		"2. Use this chalk in a glyph while crouched will erase the glyph, acting as a brush."
		""
		"3. Hold a dye in your other hand to define the color when placing the glyph."
	]
	quest.31E1B965099E6121.quest_subtitle: "Mastery Chalks"
	quest.31FBC1D41A31A10A.quest_desc: [
		"The automated version automatically pulls in fuel and items to smelt, and pushes finished items back into the backpack."
		""
		"Includes filters for both fuel and smeltable items."
		""
		"Smoking and Blasting upgrades behave similarly but operate at double the base speed and only accept items valid for vanilla smokers or blast furnaces."
	]
	quest.32B172E03841BB23.quest_desc: ["Modify how many items can fit in a single slot of the backpack’s inventory by 2x"]
	quest.33058894ACD9CB06.quest_desc: ["The Graveyard is where the Undertaker will bury your deceased citizens. When a citizen dies, a grave will spawn at the location of death. The Undertaker will attempt to recover the grave before it despawns. If successful, the Undertaker will return to the graveyard and attempt to revive the citizen. If the citizen cannot be revived, the Undertaker will bury them in the Graveyard. Another grave will be placed with the citizen’s name on it."]
	quest.33058894ACD9CB06.quest_subtitle: "Build a Graveyard"
	quest.333238348CBA8AB5.quest_desc: ["Craft Chisel (shaped: Iron top, Stick center). Hold base blocks (e.g., Stone Bricks) → Right-Click → GUI select variant (600+ patterns, connected textures)."]
	quest.334126CF176610FC.quest_desc: ["The Diamond Upgrade greatly increases a drawer’s storage capacity by &624x&r, allowing it to hold massive quantities of items. Ideal for late-game automation and high-throughput systems."]
	quest.33682F4B44950123.quest_desc: [
		"If you want to start learning more advanced spells, your next big step is hunting down a unique type of magical wood."
		""
		"You can find Archwood trees growing out in the wild across the Overworld."
		""
		"Keep an eye out for their bright, glowing canopies, and make sure to chop down plenty of logs to bring back to your crafting table!"
	]
	quest.33682F4B44950123.title: "Archwood Logs"
	quest.34169D76520A5D85.quest_desc: [
		"The &bCharging Module&r can be placed on a pressure tube and it will charge all items in the inventory it's facing."
		""
		"It can also discharge them if their &bPressure&r exceeds the Tube's."
	]
	quest.342A1EF584823D2C.quest_desc: ["Okay this achievement is kind of a lie. It might be more analogous to “teach a man to fish”.  Regardless, the point is that if you teach your builder to make simple items that fit in a 2x2 crafting grid (like torches) they can craft the item themselves instead of asking for help."]
	quest.344E3F1F52741C49.quest_desc: [
		"Allows the Router to visually mimic another block. This is a cosmetic upgrade only, useful for hiding routers inside builds or blending them seamlessly into structures."
		""
		"Sneak and right-click the Router with a block to disguise it as that block."
	]
	quest.349AD79E8E5CFDC0.quest_desc: [
		"The green chalk uses herbal concentrate to bring the energies of flora into the pentacles."
		""
		"This connection with nature makes the green chalk ideal for attracting wild spirits."
	]
	quest.349AD79E8E5CFDC0.quest_subtitle: "The Plant Chalk"
	quest.34CD54347E9821B5.quest_desc: [
		"Once you make your first Data Model, you'll need to level it up to be useful."
		""
		"Data Models start out at the first tier: &7Faulty&r. You'll need to at least level it to &aBasic&r if you'd like to run some simulations on it!"
		""
		"Once placed inside of the Deep Learner, the HUD will tell you how many kills are required to level it up. You can also see this info in the tooltip of the Model itself."
	]
	quest.34CD54347E9821B5.title: "Leveling Up Data Models"
	quest.34D15631537C26AE.quest_desc: [
		"Consuming &cDemon's Dream Fruit&r is completely safe for mortal consumption, though you must prepare for its distinct metaphysical side effects."
		""
		"Ingesting the crop temporarily grants you the &3Third Eye&r status effect, piercing the veil of reality to reveal hidden geometry within &9The Otherworld&r. While active, your heightened vision will expose secret resources disguised as standard blocks—such as uncovering hidden groves and mineral deposits necessary for your early progression."
		""
		"Alternatively, you can bypass this manual foraging process entirely. Igniting the fruit inside a dedicated brazier or casting it into a fire source will trigger an immediate alchemical reaction, allowing you to bypass the need for direct sensory sight to gather these materials. The choice of methodology is entirely yours."
	]
	quest.34D15631537C26AE.title: "&cDemons Tasty Fruit"
	quest.34E8AE9BB4D37DA7.quest_desc: ["It has been seen many warriors drown into the depths of the sea."]
	quest.34E8AE9BB4D37DA7.quest_subtitle: "Dropped by Elder Guardians"
	quest.34F8C8E7FE94B23F.quest_desc: ["Craft the Pipe Connector (JEI/REI). Hold in main hand + pipe in off-hand. Shift+RMB blocks to set route/depth (wheel). Shift+RMB air: place/reset."]
	quest.354086C858E10154.quest_desc: [
		"Now that we have some Cyanite from our baby reactor, we'll want a way to reprocess that waste into something useful."
		""
		"To do this, we'll need to build another multiblock: the &aReprocessor&r."
		""
		"This takes a lot of Cyanite, so start stocking up! You might want to upgrade to a bigger reactor as well. "
	]
	quest.354086C858E10154.title: "Reprocessing Waste"
	quest.356102D5B5F3CA1E.quest_desc: [
		"The durable &5Obsidiansteel&r stands as a powerful alloy introduced by &6&lForbidden \\& Arcanus&r."
		""
		"Forging this dark metal requires you to stoke the flames of a &l&bClibano&r forge, combining raw iron directly with crushed &5Obsidian&r."
		""
		"To successfully trigger the molecular bonding sequence, a smith must also slot an Artisan Relic into the machine."
		""
		"Curiously, the intense refinement process extracts pure &6Copper&r as an environmental residue, a strange byproduct that defies normal chemical expectations."
	]
	quest.356102D5B5F3CA1E.title: "&5Obsidiansteel"
	quest.35629CB10DBDE340.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Ancient Temple&r is a pyramid found in the &9Deeplands&r dimension. "
		""
		"Built from dark &8Deepslate&r blocks and blue &3Sculk&r, it is guarded by noise-activated &3Sculk Sensors&r and screaming &3Shriekers&r. "
		""
		"Loot the chests and vases on the top floors, then dig into the center of the &6Pyramid&r to find rare &eBlocks of Gold&r."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/dnd_temple.png width:200 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.35629CB10DBDE340.title: "&6Ancient Temples"
	quest.356C2BA829284CB8.quest_desc: [
		"Provides built-in smithing table functionality directly from the backpack’s upgrade tab."
		""
		"Allows upgrading gear using templates, just like a vanilla smithing table."
		""
		"Conveniently accessible without needing to place a smithing table."
	]
	quest.35FFAC447F36F05C.quest_desc: [
		"After we've exposed &aEmpty PCBs&r to &bUV Light&r, we can take the next step in the process by making an &2Etching Tank&r."
		""
		"Once the machine has some &bEtching Acid&r inside, insert an &aEmpty PCB&r that has been exposed in a &bUV Light Box.&r"
		""
		"This process has a chance to &cfail&r if not fully exposed inside the &bUV Light Box&r. This &cfailed PCB&r can be recycled in a blast furnace."
		""
		"If you want the tank to work faster, you can heat it above 50°C, but the &2Etching Acid&r will slowly be used up due to the &cHeat&r."
		""
		"If the etching was successful, you will get an &dUnassembled PCB&r as a result. If the process fails, you'll get a &cFailed PCB&r instead."
		""
		"If you want to automate this, you can extract &dUnassembled PCBs&r from the sides, and &cFailed PCBs&r from the top or bottom."
	]
	quest.35FFAC447F36F05C.title: "Etch That PCB!"
	quest.360E9E02A494217C.quest_subtitle: "Build Barracks Tower Inside the Barracks"
	quest.36149E69A8C264E4.quest_desc: [
		"You can spot unique &bIce Lilies&r growing on top of the rare &9Water Ponds&r scattered inside the lush &bBlooming Caverns&r."
		""
		"The plant is made of two distinct pieces: the floating pad and the &bIce Flower&r itself."
		""
		"The bottom pad floats on the &9Water&r and is sturdy enough for you to step on and use as a bridge, while the pretty flower sits directly on top of it."
		""
		"If you want to collect them and take them back to your base camp, make sure to bring a pair of Shears to harvest them cleanly."
	]
	quest.36149E69A8C264E4.title: "&bIce Lilies"
	quest.364408AECE83B5E8.quest_desc: [
		"Constantly generating and shifting multi-block runic layouts places an extreme operational strain on the physical durability of your chalk inventory. To prevent your factory lines from grinding to a halt due to broken tools, you must implement a sustainable maintenance cycle."
		""
		"By channeling the essence of a bound &aDijinni&r through a specialized restoration matrix, you can instantly cleanse, repair, and restore any colored chalk variant back to 100% operational durability. Utilizing this ritual loop entirely bypasses the need to repeat the multi-step raw material smelting and Spiritfire purification processes required to manufacture brand-new sticks from scratch."
		""
		"Alternatively, if you prefer to eliminate tool degradation from your logistics network entirely, you can apply a cross-mod optimization. Bonding an &aEternal Stella&r from the Forbidden \\& Arcanus mod to your chalk items will permanently lock their durability meters, rendering your primary scribing tools completely indestructible."
	]
	quest.364408AECE83B5E8.quest_subtitle: "Deploying mid-tier entities to negate tool durability degradation."
	quest.364408AECE83B5E8.title: "Resource Sustainability: Chalk Restoration"
	quest.365D4B1DC953D406.quest_desc: [
		"The &7Cart&r Dispenser will do as the name suggests. "
		""
		"It can dispense any &7Carts&r onto the &6Tracks&r in front of it. "
		""
		"Needs a Redstone signal to dispense."
	]
	quest.366C768D3EC05ADF.quest_desc: ["Functional Storage expands your storage options by adding a variety of practical blocks designed to hold large quantities of a single item. It’s perfect for managing bulk resources like Cobblestone, Dirt, and other commonly collected materials, helping keep your base organized and clutter-free."]
	quest.36ED3AE12A48BD4D.quest_desc: [
		"Constructing the final geometric multi-block for &9Xeovrenth Adjure&r grants your facility access to the absolute zenith of &5Possession Rituals&r. While this highly advanced containment circle operates with immense energetic requirements and possesses a highly restricted recipe catalog, its activation unlocks the final tier of automated security and material modification."
		""
		"The matrix operates with two distinct operational profiles:"
		""
		"&o&nCruelty Essence Extraction&r: This high-pressure spiritual binding cycle completely fragments the target organism's vital life energy, distilling it into concentrated Cruelty Essence. This dense, volatile byproduct serves as the primary chemical catalyst strictly required to forge your final Brown Chalk modifiers."
		""
		"&o&nAutonomous Heavy Defense&r: The circle can be utilized to permanently shackle an entity into a high-density metallic chassis, constructing an elite Iesnium Golem. This mechanical sentinel functions as an upgraded, autonomous iron golem framework that possesses complete immunity to traditional durability damage while delivering a significantly amplified kinetic damage output to hostile threats."
	]
	quest.36ED3AE12A48BD4D.quest_subtitle: "Triggering pinnacle organic extraction and indestructible construct assembly."
	quest.36ED3AE12A48BD4D.title: "Absolute Subjugation: &9Xeovrenth Adjure&r "
	quest.3713C105C47D2CE9.quest_desc: ["Stack Downgrades divide the max stack size by 16."]
	quest.37204CA0F0A97B2B.quest_desc: ["Silence the skeleton band—claim their gear!"]
	quest.37204CA0F0A97B2B.title: "Skeleton Symphony"
	quest.37BE190EE466D697.quest_subtitle: "Upgrade the Town Hall to Level 5"
	quest.37E43341FA234E84.quest_desc: [
		"The Flower Shop is where your Florist will grow flowers for your colony, if given compost and an axe. "
		""
		"One important factor to know is that the flower shop has a daily flower limit based on the hut level. Level 1 has a daily max of 4, level 2 has 8. At level 5 it’s daily max is 20. "
	]
	quest.37E43341FA234E84.quest_subtitle: "Build a Flower Shop"
	quest.37EBB8E0D6E5F821.quest_desc: [
		"&6Hostile Neural Networks&r (HNN for short) is a mod based around simulating mob kills for loot!"
		""
		"To do this, you will be collecting \"data\" on mobs, then running simulations from the data to create their drops!\\n"
	]
	quest.37EBB8E0D6E5F821.title: "Welcome to &9 Hostile Neural Networks"
	quest.382AA19697486A69.quest_desc: ["Emits a redstone signal when the router contains a specific item. You can configure what item to detect and how strong the signal strength should be. "]
	quest.38451B61E3FC075B.quest_desc: [
		"To get (Coal) Coke you'll need a Coke Oven. "
		""
		"To make one you'll need 26 Coke Oven Bricks and place them 3x3x3 with 1 block hollow in the center. "
		""
		"You'll know it's done when you can access the GUI and it's all one texture."
		""
		"Place Coal or Coal Blocks to get (Coal) Coke and Liquid Creosote!"
		""
		"You can always put any log in to get Charcoal and Creasote."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/rail_coke.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.386E9648A77832B0.quest_desc: ["Slay Hydra for chops."]
	quest.386E9648A77832B0.title: "Hydra's Edge"
	quest.39100B3867E9C01E.quest_desc: [
		"Keep a sharp eye on the ground for &cGloomy Geysers&r while exploring the boiling hot &cOvercast Columns&r."
		""
		"Stepping onto one of these volatile blocks will instantly blast you sky-high into the air."
		""
		"Make sure you have a glider, a water bucket, or slow-falling potions ready, because the explosion won't save you from taking brutal fall damage when you hit the ground. "
		""
		"If you want to safely pick them up and carry them home to use as a makeshift elevator, make sure to pop them with a Silk Touch pickaxe."
	]
	quest.39100B3867E9C01E.title: "&cGloomy Geyser"
	quest.394C24C83DA2ECFE.quest_desc: ["The eye is believed to have given our ancestors the knowledge of Redstone."]
	quest.394C24C83DA2ECFE.quest_subtitle: "Found in Jungle Pyramid chests"
	quest.3999AE0921641E60.quest_desc: [
		"The volatile &8Dark Matter&r is refined by smelting down blocks of Edelwood inside a hot furnace."
		""
		"Combining this essence with &5Corrupti Dust&r—a dark powder manufactured from &5Obsidiansteel&r and common monster remains—unlocks dangerous cosmic magic."
		""
		"Tossing both substances onto the ground at the exact same location collapses space, spawning a miniature &8Black Hole&r."
		""
		"This stellar anomaly instantly consumes and voids every nearby item or loose projectile."
		""
		"However, feeding the vortex large amounts of your own &aExperience&r will stabilize it, eventually causing the anomaly to collapse and leave behind a valuable &aXpetrified Orb&r."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/forbidden_blackhole.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.3999AE0921641E60.title: "&8Black Hole"
	quest.39BED5DD9D24F98E.quest_desc: [
		"When exploring the depths, think of &3Sculk Grime&r as the mod's custom version of regular clay."
		""
		"You can stumble upon these patches across a few different biomes, and digging them up with a shovel will reward you with a handful of &3Grime Balls&r."
		""
		"You can easily roll these messy clumps back into solid blocks of &3Sculk Grime&r, or refine them into clean &3Grime Bricks&r to give your home base a cool new look."
	]
	quest.39BED5DD9D24F98E.title: "&3Sculk Grime"
	quest.39E1A88165C34AF0.quest_desc: ["Breaks the block in front of the module and inserts the drops into the Router’s inventory. Can harvest blocks automatically and respects tool behavior when applicable."]
	quest.3A5A665B1F76BE26.quest_desc: [
		"&6Pneumatic Armor&r can be extensively upgraded at the cost of having a fairly low base defense."
		""
		"These upgrades can give it more Armor, Armor Toughness, Speed, Flight, Night vision, and more!"
		""
		"The &aChestplate&r can also be upgraded to charge all of your pneumatic devices."
		""
		"This armor does not have infinite durability like some other tech armors, but can be upgraded to automatically repair with pressure."
	]
	quest.3A5A665B1F76BE26.title: "I am Compression Man!"
	quest.3A5EB2005731B8A1.quest_desc: ["Forge the trumpet—echo your band's call!"]
	quest.3A5EB2005731B8A1.title: "Brass Echoes"
	quest.3A9AE6B95EAF9693.quest_desc: [
		"The orange chalk is a perfect bait for spirits of the Afrit class, who, although impressed by the lime chalk, can resist its call."
		""
		"Being a sweet and slightly warm chalk, it does not guarantee control over the invoked Afrit. Commanding an Afrit requires power directly related to its class of spirits and extreme stability in the pentacle."
	]
	quest.3A9AE6B95EAF9693.quest_subtitle: "The Tangy Chalk"
	quest.3AE1C3290500638F.quest_subtitle: "Reach 10 Citizens"
	quest.3B40A769EDB26EA2.quest_desc: [
		"Got your eye on a new recruit and need some hay bales? If you place a postbox outside your tavern you can request items from the warehouse and a courier will deliver them to the postbox."
		""
		"Similarly, if you have items you want taken to the warehouse, place them in a Stash and a courier will be along shortly to pick them up."
	]
	quest.3B91163DE3DA885C.quest_desc: [
		"Possibly one of the most dangerous jobs, especially early on. The Nether Miner travels to the Nether to mine resources. When the miner travels through the portal, there is a chance they may die. So choose your worker carefully."
		""
		"The portal in the Nether Mine will transport players to the Nether. However, the Nether Miner does not actually travel into the Nether, nor do they actually mine any blocks in the Nether."
	]
	quest.3B91163DE3DA885C.quest_subtitle: "Build a Nether Mine"
	quest.3B9A81863A9F3AF0.quest_desc: ["Smelt Copper Ore into ingots. 4 Ingots + 1 Torch to craft."]
	quest.3BCA33834716DA39.quest_desc: ["Pirates say it gave sight to the legendary Black Pearl."]
	quest.3BCA33834716DA39.quest_subtitle: "Found in Buried Treasure chests"
	quest.3C3FE45CEF5E242B.quest_desc: [
		"While the other &aReprocessor Parts&r have a mandatory spot when building, these three parts can be placed on any vertical face as long as they aren't on the frame!"
		""
		"The &cPower Port&r is used to give power to the multiblock machine to process waste."
		""
		"The &9Fluid Injector Port&r is used to inject the liquid needed, which will depend on the type of waste injected. "
		""
		"For Cyanite, that means water!\\n\\nThe &aOutput Port&r is used to output the reprocessed material. "
		""
		"You can right click it to grab the material out by hand, or pipe it out for automation."
	]
	quest.3C83AB91FDAB1066.quest_desc: [
		"The advanced upgrade offers 16 filter slots and supports filtering by item, mod, tag, NBT data, and damage values."
		""
		"Additionally, it can be configured to only deposit items that already exist in the target inventory, using its contents as an additional filter."
	]
	quest.3CAA89E621ED5B6E.quest_desc: [
		"The &aCamouflage Applicator&r can make camouflageable blocks such as tubes and heat pipes look like other blocks!"
		""
		"Sneak + Right-Click the applicator on a block (like grass or diamond) then click on any camouflageable block to set its appearance."
	]
	quest.3CF2DFB7F0CE065B.quest_desc: [
		"The &cOvercast Columns&r is a fiery, &6Orange&r biome that is much hotter than any other area in this dimension. "
		""
		"In this volcanic zone, regular blue sculk is replaced by &cGloomy Sculk&r, and the typical stone is replaced by dark &cGloomslate&r."
		""
		"The ground contains soul sand, soul soil, and hazardous &cMagma&r blocks floating over massive pools of &cLava&r. "
		""
		"Because the extreme heat stops normal monsters from spawning, your only company here will be a few rare types of native plant life."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/dnd_column.png width:200 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.3CF2DFB7F0CE065B.title: "&cOvercast Columns"
	quest.3CFEA6879492C291.quest_desc: ["Silences the Router. Any sounds produced by operating the Router are muted."]
	quest.3D382D6E27049E36.quest_desc: ["Nuggets from Gold Ore/Zombified Piglin. Surround Torch with 8 Gold Nuggets."]
	quest.3D4D88B8BE881351.quest_desc: [
		"To manipulate advanced magic, an arcanist must construct a &6Scribe's Table&r to discover new glyphs for their spellbook. "
		""
		"Glyphs are divided into three escalating tiers, each requiring specific material offerings and player experience to research."
		""
		"Beyond inscription, the station binds active spells onto disposable Spell Parchments; place a parchment onto the surface, highlight the chosen spell inside your spellbook, and sneak-right-click the volume onto the table to infuse it. "
		""
		"To craft a fresh glyph, right-click the table with an open spellbook, find your target formula, and press the Select button."
		""
		"Hand-deliver the remaining components by right-clicking the block, or allow the table to automatically siphon materials from neighboring chests. "
		""
		"Once created, consume the finished glyph to permanently master its power.\""
	]
	quest.3D4D88B8BE881351.quest_subtitle: "Upgrading Spells"
	quest.3D579A1F7EFEDD5C.quest_desc: [
		"The &9&lWarden&r stands as the most difficult boss monster inside &2&lMinecraft&r, residing deep within the game's most dangerous structural complexes."
		""
		"This apex predator emerges once an acoustic &3Sculk Shrieker&r is triggered three total times, or instantly upon any disturbance following the primary spawn event. "
		""
		"The beast commands a massive health pool of 500 &4Hearts&r and inflicts lethal physical trauma through heavy melee strikes or long-range &bSonic Blast&r attacks. "
		""
		"However, the monster suffers from a critical developmental weakness: it is completely blind. It detects prey exclusively through sound vibrations or olfactory (smell) tracking if a traveler enters close proximity, making a defensive distance of 23 blocks highly effective for evasion."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/warden_roar.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.3D579A1F7EFEDD5C.title: "Kill the &9&lWarden"
	quest.3D82C6639A6371CB.quest_desc: [
		"By aligning four complex &7Quantum Cores&r alongside a single pinch of volatile &cMundabitur Dust&r, an artisan can forge the specialized &7Quantum Injector&r."
		""
		"While these advanced mechanics are not heavily utilized at this early stage of your craftsmanship, the device stands as a vital technical milestone that will be absolutely mandatory for your downstream works later."
	]
	quest.3D862A3D3F83CA26.quest_desc: [
		"You'll use the &9Enchanting Apparatus&r to manufacture most of your high-tier gear and magical items as you progress."
		""
		"Keep in mind that this machine won't do a thing without a steady supply of Source power nearby."
		""
		"Setting up this multiblock station is easy: first, dig a hole and place an Arcane Core flat in the ground."
		""
		"Next, slap the Enchanting Apparatus right on top of that core block, and then surround the whole setup with a ring of Arcane Pedestals to hold your extra crafting ingredients."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/enchanting_app.png width:200 height:175 align:1}"
	]
	quest.3D91D754E66F9811.quest_desc: ["Without this eye, the Evoker has no power."]
	quest.3D91D754E66F9811.quest_subtitle: "Found in Woodland Mansion chests"
	quest.3DB9701B81B83988.quest_desc: ["Craft Fiery Sword."]
	quest.3DB9701B81B83988.title: "Fiery Sword Tempered"
	quest.3E1FE88AB6FBCC90.quest_desc: [
		"Provides built-in anvil functionality directly from the backpack’s upgrade tab."
		""
		"Allows repairing, renaming, and combining items without needing a placed anvil."
		""
		"Functions just like a vanilla anvil, but accessible on the go."
	]
	quest.3E3CBDCEAB0FF28F.quest_desc: [
		"The &9Deep Learner&r is one of the core components of HNN."
		""
		"With this item, you can right click to open up a HUD and store &6Data Models&r to gather data while killing mobs."
		""
		"Each Learner can hold 4 Data Models, and as long as you have the Learner anywhere in your inventory, it will collect data for the models placed inside!"
		""
		"Note: You can have multiple Deep Learners in your inventory, and it will count the kills for all Data Models inside all of the Learners."
	]
	quest.3E3CBDCEAB0FF28F.quest_subtitle: "The Learning HUD"
	quest.3E3CBDCEAB0FF28F.title: "&aLearning Mobs"
	quest.3E48F78F7315CB96.quest_desc: ["Netherite Construction Sticks allow you to place up to 1024 blocks at once."]
	quest.3E75AFE3482834C5.quest_desc: [
		"&lRailCraft Reborn&r lets you automate base logistics with heavy &1Trains&r. "
		""
		"You can scale up from simple &7Minecarts&r to high-speed &3Electric Locomotives&r. "
		""
		"Just build Traffic Lights to stop crashes, Steam Boilers for engine fuel, and a &1Tunnel Bores&r to dig paths automatically."
	]
	quest.3E75AFE3482834C5.title: "Railcraft Reborn"
	quest.3E8C2E7769DFBF35.quest_desc: [
		"Unlike the &3Steam Locomotive&r you won't need to put anything into the &eElectric Locomotive&r. "
		""
		"It runs off the power from the &eFrames&r beneath the &6Electric Tracks&r."
		""
		"Yes, it can only be ran off &6Electric Tracks&r."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/rail_electric.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.3F00B20626CF1A77.quest_desc: ["Restricts who can interact with the Router. When installed, only the Router’s owner (and possibly trusted players, depending on configuration) can access or modify it."]
	quest.3F00B20626CF1A77.quest_subtitle: "Get off my lawn!"
	quest.3F77375A5E0F0FFA.quest_desc: ["I do not know how this is obtained, but you got it. "]
	quest.3F80A7C5DABD9C8C.quest_desc: ["Feed hatched dragon raw chicken/rabbit to tame (multiple pieces). Grants Fire Resistance; fights with fire blasts."]
	quest.3F80A7C5DABD9C8C.title: "Tame Your Ally"
	quest.3F8AA2C0D37D376F.quest_desc: [
		"Protects the backpack from all kinds of destruction."
		""
		"Completely immune to explosions, both as an item and when placed in the world."
		""
		"Cannot be destroyed by cactus, lava, or fire."
		""
		"Will never despawn when dropped as an item."
		""
		"Floats safely above lava instead of being destroyed."
		""
		"If dropped into the void, it floats just above the lowest build limit rather than falling out of the world."
	]
	quest.3F9D553C9FA64F2A.quest_desc: [
		"Reactors are multi-block structures, meaning you can create your own custom size!\\n\\nIf you're using &aBasic Reactor Parts&r, the largest size reactor you can build is 5x5x5."
		""
		"The &lBiggest&r Reactor that you can make using &eReinforced Reactor Parts&r is 32x32x48. There are a lot of variables that contribute to the overall output of a reactor, so make sure to experiment!"
		""
		"Some overall tips:\\n\\nThe taller the reactor, the more fuel it can hold and burn because there are more fuel rods, meaning more overall power. This also means a higher &cburn rate&r."
		""
		"The wider the reactor, the more efficient it is, as long as you don't add more fuel rods to the design. This means less consumption overall."
	]
	quest.3F9D553C9FA64F2A.title: "Expanding the Reactor"
	quest.3FB51F0568B0896C.quest_desc: [
		"With our newly created &bCompressed Iron&r, we can get started crafting the basic items in &6PneumaticCraft&r!"
		""
		"To start, we'll need to make some &aPressure Tubes&r, which are used to carry &bCompressed Air&r. These are similar to \"cables\" from other mods!"
		""
		"Fun Fact: Pressure beyond 5 BAR is the danger zone. If the pressure inside of the tubes reaches 7.0 BAR, it will explode!"
		""
		""
		"&bAir Pressure&r also takes time to build up! It relies on a completely &bclosed system&r, meaning it will try to escape if there is a hole somewhere in the pipe network."
		""
		"You'll know when there is a hole somewhere, as you'll hear the air rushing out. Right-clicking with a &aPneumatic Wrench&r will close the open section!"
	]
	quest.3FB51F0568B0896C.title: "Give it More Pressure"
	quest.3FD702B5AB006402.quest_desc: [
		"The weightless Levitation Belt allows an arcanist to effortlessly hover above the ground rather than walking."
		""
		"To initialize its floating enchantment, you must simply jump or fall into the air and press your sneak command key."
		""
		"This halts your descent immediately, letting you glide smoothly across treacherous chasms and gaps."
	]
	quest.400EFC233FBC8CBA.quest_desc: ["The &aFlux Compressor&r converts &cFE&r into &bAir Pressure&r!"]
	quest.403271A8740E9141.quest_desc: [
		"The volatile oils within &cDemon's Dream Fruit&r possess highly exotic, flammable properties."
		""
		"Casting the crop onto the ground and igniting it with a flint and steel will manifest a localized patch of &dSpiritfire&r. This stable, ethereal flame acts as your primary alchemical catalyst, stripping away earthly illusions to transform mundane overworld items into true &9Otherworld&r components."
		""
		"The resulting purple fire emits no heat to the surrounding environment, serving as a visually striking, permanent focal point for your automation room."
	]
	quest.403271A8740E9141.title: "&9The Otherworldly&r Flames"
	quest.403A4FCD9ECB1282.quest_desc: [
		"Scaling the resource capacity of your sub-spatial storage network requires anchoring specialized &dStorage Stabilizers&r to your central matrix."
		""
		"To initialize the connection, these stabilizing pylons must face and point directly at the floating Dimensional Matrix core hovering above your Storage Actuator, rather than the mechanical base block itself. The stabilizers can be positioned up to a maximum distance of 5 blocks away, but they require a completely unobstructed, clear line of sight to the matrix core to sustain the field."
		""
		"When upgrading your network to a higher-tier stabilizer, breaking an active pylon will not destroy or drop your stored commodities. However, removing a stabilizer instantly downscales your total slot allowance; you will be completely locked out from depositing any new materials into the system until a valid stabilizing field is restored or upgraded."
		""
		"Refer to the visual schematic below for an example of a validated spatial configuration."
	]
	quest.403A4FCD9ECB1282.title: "Matrix Expansion: &dStorage Stabilizers"
	quest.40527D5F3866D762.quest_desc: ["Modify how many items can fit in a single slot of the backpack’s inventory by 16x"]
	quest.4071BBBE12CACD2D.quest_desc: [
		"The &1Train&r Dispenser is a better version of the &7Cart&r Dispenser. "
		""
		"It can Dispense the whole &1Locomotive&r and more! "
		""
		"Set a pattern for what you want to be deployed then give it a redstone signal."
	]
	quest.40B00524384110B9.quest_desc: [
		"The &aVortex Tube&r uses compressed air to make one side &bCold&r and the other side &cHot&r."
		""
		"The higher the airflow, the more extreme the temperature difference will be."
	]
	quest.40B757772D0FBAC9.quest_desc: [
		"The vital life-force of &4Blood&r occupies the third essential fluid reservoir that must be continuously replenished inside your &6&lHephaestus Forge&r."
		""
		"To feed the forge's dark hunger, you can execute a brutal slaughter of hostile monsters or passive animals directly on top of or immediately adjacent to the structure."
		""
		"Alternatively, a more refined artisan can manually deposit pre-filled Test Tubes into the forge's central interface to instantly siphon the liquid inside."
		""
		"To successfully harvest this essence on your hunts, you must equip an empty Test Tube directly into your offhand slot while striking down your enemies."
		""
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/forbidden_blood.png width:135 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.40B757772D0FBAC9.title: "&4Blood"
	quest.40BC67BDEE15D1DE.quest_desc: [
		"To manufacture foundational Source Gems, an arcanist must deposit either standard Lapis Lazuli or raw Amethyst Shards into the central repository of the Imbuement Chamber."
		""
		"Once sealed within the vessel, the items will gradually absorb the surrounding energy fields, systematically converting into refined Source Gems over time."
	]
	quest.40BC67BDEE15D1DE.title: "&5Source Gems"
	quest.40D67819EB7A0202.quest_desc: [
		"The advanced upgrade includes 12 disc slots and full playback controls: play, stop, next, and previous."
		"It also features shuffle mode and repeat options: repeat all, repeat one, or repeat disabled (play once and stop)."
	]
	quest.41477C57B7CF686D.quest_desc: ["Beat the tiny drum—restore full harmony!"]
	quest.414A35A72AFB5FF5.quest_desc: [
		"Constructing the mystical &3Sea Prism&r stands as one of the most frustrating and tedious undertakings an artisan can attempt."
		""
		"Gathering the rare components to feed the forge demands a heavy sacrifice of ocean-born &bPrismarine&r, durable &2Turtle Scutes&r, pure &9Lapis&r gems, and a pristine &3Heart of the Sea&r."
		""
		"As with its elemental counterparts, you must guarantee that the ancient &3Elementarium&r Relic is properly slotted into the core to anchor the transmutation."
		""
		"When successfully fused onto your primary casting tools, this prism enhances your magical focus to steadily generate passive bursts of &bAureal&r essence directly into your inventory as you work."
	]
	quest.414A35A72AFB5FF5.title: "&9Sea Prism"
	quest.415B9BA6270028A4.quest_desc: ["Pulls nearby item entities into the Router. Range and speed can be enhanced with upgrades, making it ideal for farms and mob drops."]
	quest.416C6BAF7255A000.quest_desc: ["Craft Fancy Armor Stand (JEI; display/pose armor)."]
	quest.417DBE0851B75DD0.quest_desc: ["Explore world for Dragon Skeletons (randomly placed). Right-click empty hand to harvest (20% skull drop + bones)."]
	quest.417DBE0851B75DD0.title: "Skull Harvest"
	quest.41A0BE357C8A74E1.quest_desc: [
		"Setting up an &9Alchemical Sourcelink&r lets you siphon raw Source power right out of your nearby potion jars. "
		""
		"Keep in mind that not all brews are created equal; the amount of energy you get back changes completely depending on which potion you use and how complex its brewing recipe was."
	]
	quest.41A0BE357C8A74E1.quest_subtitle: "Potion Power"
	quest.41B4C7B9D3AE6317.quest_desc: [
		"This pupil is believed to have seen the ancient brewing recipes that were lost in time."
		""
		"Crafted with 1 &bEye of Ender&r and 1 &bWitch Pupil&r"
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/er_witch_eye.png width:160 height:82 align:center}"
	]
	quest.41E82D02D07F24ED.quest_desc: [
		"Templates add special upgrades to your Construction Sticks. To apply a template, combine the stick, template, and an additional item in a Smithing Table."
		""
		"Unbreakable: Removes durability consumption, allowing infinite block placement."
	]
	quest.41EDEF510157A6F8.quest_desc: [
		"This operation marks the culmination of the Abras sequence. The ceremony is engineered to pull a top-tier, highly volatile &9Marid&r fire spirit across the planar barrier. Even though your geometric foundation now integrates the containment field of Red Chalk, the raw energetic output of this entity still surpasses the grid's suppression limits. Because the matrix cannot fully &9bind&r the entity into immediate submission, you must prepare for a high-intensity combat encounter to terminate it manually."
		""
		"This ceremony features a distinct departure from standard possession logic by utilizing a forged Trident as the focal sacrifice rather than a living creature. Because there is no biological organism to execute over the runes, the ignition criteria must be triggered kinetically."
		""
		"Once your peripheral bowls are properly dressed with their material reagents, you must manually throw the Trident directly at the central Golden Sacrificial Bowl. Impacting the core anchor will instantly shatter the weapon, consuming its structural integrity to spark the summoning matrix and manifest the hostile entity."
	]
	quest.41EDEF510157A6F8.quest_subtitle: "Bypassing biological anchors through focal metallic sacrifices."
	quest.41EDEF510157A6F8.title: "Kinetic Ignition: The &9Marid&r Breakthrough"
	quest.41F423BEB982D832.quest_desc: [
		"The Advanced Demagnetization Coil prevents items from being attracted by magnets"
		""
		"Effective area can be adjusted up to 5 blocks away"
		""
		"Items can be filtered"
	]
	quest.425E375A9EC127EB.quest_desc: [
		"&6Reinforced Tracks&r are the upgraded version of normal &6rails&r! They're slightly faster and don't blow up."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/rail_reinforced1.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/rail_reinforced2.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/rail_reinforced3.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/rail_reinforced4.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.425FCDD7A53D3B1B.quest_desc: ["Craft Magic Map to unveil the Forest's forges."]
	quest.425FCDD7A53D3B1B.title: "Twilight Portal"
	quest.42F5D47FB7860701.quest_desc: ["Use Putty and Quartz to refine Terracotta into seamless 32x32 Mosaic Terracotta."]
	quest.42F5D47FB7860701.title: "Craft  Mosaic Terracotta"
	quest.430475E11D259B74.quest_desc: [
		"The Stone Smeltery is where the Stone Smelter will smelt cobblestone into stone, stone bricks into cracked stone bricks, clay balls into bricks, clay blocks into terracotta, terracotta into glazed terracotta, all types of stone into all types of smooth stone, and logs into charcoal. They can also pop chorus fruits! "
		""
		"Be sure to teach the Stone Smelter recipes needed by your colony. Also, be sure to set a fuel type. "
	]
	quest.430475E11D259B74.quest_subtitle: "Build a Stone Smelter"
	quest.43E68DE2E5A53162.quest_desc: [
		"Although there's a pre-programmed &5Harvesting Drone&r, this questline is going to teach you how to make one yourself. This should give you a good head start on how programming works!"
		""
		"To get started, open up your &aProgramming Table&r and import the code:"
		""
		"Look for the \"Import Button\" at the top left of the GUI, then click the \"paste from clipboard\" option in the bottom."
		""
		"{\"text\": \"Click Here For The Code\", \"underlined\": true, \"color\": \"#FFFFFF\", \"clickEvent\": {\"action\": \"open_url\", \"value\": \"https://gist.github.com/ArtpokeBr/e8c83e912c92e28b9d428a07b5fe7fbc\"}}"
		""
		"With this you can notice that &bDrone Code&r is done via &3Code Blocks/Steps&r you can start by placing the &a\"Start Block\"&r and then add a block for each respective step of the process."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/quest_drone_1.png width:240 height:200 align:center}"
		""
		"You might also notice that when you add commands to harvest and/or import something from a chest, an &aArea Block&r is needed. To easily add the correct coordinates, simply left-click with your GPS Tool to paste them in."
		""
		"You can also add &aFilter Blocks&r to certain commands, in this given code, you may want to set one for the Hoe you wish to use."
		""
		"&eBonus tip:&r It's good practice to add a &9Standby&r command at the end so your drone can shut itself off when no work is needed, saving some &bPressure&r"
	]
	quest.43E68DE2E5A53162.title: "&dHarvesting Drone"
	quest.4415C9F8DA2D7E68.quest_desc: [
		"With Cyanite, we can create the heart of the Turbine, the &9Turbine Controller&r."
		""
		"Turbines are multi-block structures, just like Reactors! "
		""
		"They input vapors like &7Steam&r made by &dActively Cooled&r Reactors to create TONS of power! "
		""
		"We'll need a few other pieces to be able to build our first one."
		""
		"Note: Basic Turbine parts can only be used to build a max size Turbine of 5x5x10. "
		""
		"To build a bigger Turbine, you must use &aReinforced Turbine Parts&r."
	]
	quest.4415C9F8DA2D7E68.title: "Creating Turbines"
	quest.441C0659ED28D935.title: "Novie Glyphs"
	quest.44D03FA6D1310E51.quest_desc: ["Craft basic wood Base (JEI recipe). First part of Grandfather Clock."]
	quest.44F9B8F285546B2C.quest_desc: [
		"You can pick up plenty of &bBlooming Moss&r by scouting out the floors of the lush &bBlooming Caverns&r."
		""
		"It sits right on the ground waiting for you to walk up and break it for your collection."
		""
		"Keep in mind that this plant acts a bit differently than regular &2Moss&r back home; it won't spread across neighboring blocks when fed bone meal, and it doesn't have any crafting recipes."
	]
	quest.44F9B8F285546B2C.title: "&bBlooming Moss"
	quest.451A5EAA8659B806.quest_desc: [
		"A combined pipe that can transport items, fluids, energy, and gas all in a single block."
		""
		"it's throughput is the same as individual pipes but one pipe does all jobs. So you only need one connection for multiple resource types."
	]
	quest.457DE8C154641437.quest_desc: [
		"The handy &9Ritual Brazier&r is your main station for casting high-level magical rituals, though it also makes for a fantastic decorative fire pit around camp."
		""
		"If you want to light the flames, don't reach for a flint and steel—you'll need to blast the block with a custom Light spell."
		""
		"To actually perform any rituals here, you'll need to set up a few surrounding Arcane Pedestals to feed in the secondary ingredients."
		""
		"Since there is a massive library of different rituals to experiment with, make sure to read up on each layout using your &6Worn Notebook&r."
		""
		"You can open the book's direct guide menu by keeping the notebook in your pack and holding down the Ctrl key while looking at your Ritual Table."
	]
	quest.45C9D975E3731DFE.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting a powerful &9Reinforced Echo Shard&r requires tracking down three key ingredients across your world."
		""
		"Your first and easiest target is a stack of &7Phantom Membranes&r, which drop from flying Phantoms that start spawning after you skip sleep for a few consecutive nights."
		""
		"Next, you'll need rare &9Echo Shards&r, easily stockpiled by raiding the loot chests scattered around dark &6Ancient Cities&r."
		""
		"Your final challenge is collecting &9Warden Carapaces&r, a reliable drop rewarded for taking down the terrifying &9&lWarden&r boss in combat."
	]
	quest.45C9D975E3731DFE.title: "&9Reinforced Echo Shard"
	quest.45CEDDB7FDD0276F.quest_desc: [
		"Your next logistical evolution requires a transition into &6Infusion Rituals&r. Unlike traditional summoning circles that manifest entities into physical space, these hybrid matrices are engineered to permanently siphon and imbue the essence of otherworldly spirits straight into physical components."
		""
		"The foundational matrix for this discipline is &eEziveus' Spectral Compulsion&r. This entry-tier configuration acts as your primary alchemical forge, allowing you to manufacture several core components and advanced alloys that are strictly mandatory throughout your upcoming progression."
		""
		"Because each distinct ritual discipline scales backward-compatibly with its own independent upgrade path, it is critical to construct this layout inside a separate, dedicated zone away from your primary summoning perimeters to avoid overlapping geometric errors."
	]
	quest.45CEDDB7FDD0276F.quest_subtitle: "Permanently binding spirit properties into material components."
	quest.45CEDDB7FDD0276F.title: "Ethereal Synthesis: &6 Infusion Rituals&r"
	quest.4649F676C3F2BE2B.quest_desc: [
		"The Filter Destination Tool lets you tell a filter exactly which inventory items, fluids, gases, or energy should go to. (Requires \"Advanced filter\" upgrade or higher)"
		""
		"To use it:"
		""
		"1. Click a destination inventory"
		"2. Open the source inventory and click \"Add\" button"
		"3. Place the pipe filter into the pipe filter slot. "
		"4. You will know it's successful when the text chnaged from destination \"Any\" to the x,y,z coordinates of your destination inventory."
	]
	quest.46567ED894E9883C.quest_desc: [
		"This is where your architectural works truly begin to shine, stepping into the highest echelons of the art."
		""
		"Arrange four pure &6Deorum&r Ingots, four radiant &bArcane Crystals&r, and a single &9Chiseled Polished Darkstone&r core within the forge's matrix to elevate your foundry from &3&lTier 2&r up to a glorious &e&lTier 3&r."
		""
		"Striking the anvil at this rank shatters your previous limitations, heavily expanding your internal essence reservoirs, unlocking a third concurrent Relic slot, and granting complete access to your most advanced recipe blueprints."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/forbidden_tier3.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.46567ED894E9883C.title: "&e&lTier 3 &6Forge"
	quest.46FD66811FCB1AAA.quest_desc: [
		"Andesite, when surrendered to the Spirit Fire, sheds its mundane form and is reborn as Otherstone, touched by the essence of the Otherworld."
		""
		"When this Otherstone is refined in a furnace, it becomes Burnt Otherstone, an essential substance used in the creation of White Chalk, the first mark of true ritual work."
	]
	quest.46FD66811FCB1AAA.title: "Otherstone"
	quest.4707FB01F15F6E1F.quest_desc: [
		"The &b&lClibano&r is a new Multiblock which acts sort of like a Jumbo Furnace! To make it follow these steps!"
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/forbidden_clibano1.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"First layer is a 3x3 Area, with the corners made of &9Polished Darkstone&r and the rest filled with &9Polished Darkstone Bricks&r."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/forbidden_clibano2.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"The second layer uses only &9Polished Darkstone Bricks&r and the &bClibano Core&r. Remember to keep the middle Block empty!"
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/forbidden_clibano3.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"The final layer is just like the first... just above the other two layers!"
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/forbidden_clibano4.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
		""
		"Finally Right Click the Multiblock with &cMundabitur Dust&r to finish it!"
	]
	quest.4707FB01F15F6E1F.title: "&b&lClibano"
	quest.4710379C44BA78C9.quest_desc: [
		"Deploying your newly bound &9Marid Crusher&r opens the gateway to fracturing hyper-dense, sound-attuned materials that lower-tier processing thralls would simply shatter into useless fragments."
		""
		"Your immediate logistical objective requires feeding a raw Echo Shard into your master spirit's crushing matrix. The entity will rapidly pulverize the shard into a highly specialized resonance powder."
		""
		"Once harvested, take this acoustic catalyst to any standard crafting grid and combine it directly with a refined Iesnium Ingot and a luminous Glow Ink Sac. The glow properties will permanently bind the energetic vibrations of the echo particles to the dense metallic substrate, completing the intricate chemical synthesis required to forge your Cyan Chalk modifiers."
	]
	quest.4710379C44BA78C9.quest_subtitle: "Fragmenting deep-slate vibrations to bind late-game colored modifiers."
	quest.4710379C44BA78C9.title: "Resonance Coupling: Cyan Chalk"
	quest.4745152F6FF242B3.quest_desc: ["When the reactor burns up fuel, it creates &9waste&r or a &dReactant&r that you'll also want to extract. That is what the other Solid Access Port is for! Make sure to set it to output, then pipe it into some type of storage."]
	quest.4745152F6FF242B3.title: "Waste Not"
	quest.475E307844E3AF7F.quest_desc: [
		"The Water Boilers are some of the most helpful machines from &l&7RailCraft&r. "
		""
		"They need a Fuel Firebox and some sort of boiler on top. "
		""
		"The Fueled Firebox can be 1x1 2x2 or 3x3. "
		""
		"The size of the Firebox changes how big the Boiler on top can be. "
		""
		"For 1x1 Firebox it can only have 1x1 Boiler. "
		""
		"For 2x2 Firebox it can be a 2x2x3 Boiler. "
		""
		"For 3x3 Firebox it can be 3x3x4. "
		""
		"The Liquid Fuel will take Creosote to heat up. "
		""
		"For Solid Firebox it'll use anything a furnace can use."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/rail_big_boiler.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.475E307844E3AF7F.title: "Steam Boiler Tanks"
	quest.476755275B948A5F.quest_desc: [
		"Reactors can also be used to heat up &bcoolants&r like water to create &bvapor&r, like &bSteam&r."
		""
		"To do this, you'll need to build a reinforced reactor. "
		""
		"This is built in the same way that you built your 3x3x3 reactor, but all of the parts will need to be &aReinforced Reactor Parts&r instead. "
		""
		"I'd also suggest on it being bigger than a 3x3x3."
		""
		"To input a coolant, you'll need a &9Forge Fluid Port&r. "
		""
		"This will port in any fluids like Water into the reactor. This will also be used to export the vapor created in the reactor."
	]
	quest.476755275B948A5F.title: "Actively Cooled Reactor"
	quest.47732892296BD6FE.quest_desc: [
		"Reaching the absolute pinnacle of occult geometry requires you to forge a foundation medium capable of anchoring the most volatile entities in the cosmos. Utilizing the dense containment field of &cSevira's Permanent Confinement&r, you can force highly unstable skeletal catalysts to fuse with terrestrial alloys."
		""
		"By compressing a complex arrangement of Wither-derived materials alongside pure Netherite plates inside the infusion circle, the matrix will yield three units of Witherite Dust. This synthetic metamaterial possesses unmatched particle density; combine it directly with your existing chalk inventory in a crafting grid to complete the manufacture of your first sticks of Black Chalk."
		""
		"Securing this midnight-black foundation completes your alchemical toolkit, permanently unlocking the structural parameters required to layout the highest tiers of Marid-class summoning grids."
	]
	quest.47732892296BD6FE.quest_subtitle: "Stabilizing cataclysmic compounds into the highest form of foundation geometry."
	quest.47732892296BD6FE.title: "The Ultimate Medium: Black Chalk"
	quest.47E6C1E1E6465D9D.quest_desc: ["Forging the void chalk is a service provided by an Eldritch Spirit. This chalk has the same abilities as the rainbow chalk but the color flickering is white to black."]
	quest.47E6C1E1E6465D9D.quest_subtitle: "Mastery Chalks"
	quest.486F56DD7FD711AE.quest_desc: [
		"This pack has no set end game or goals, you are free to make your own and play how you want. However, if you're looking for a challenge here are a few."
		""
		"You can still be considered to have \"beaten the pack\" without doing any of these, they are entirely optional."
	]
	quest.487C70679535DDDB.quest_desc: [
		"Should the restrictive containment fields of your standard Quantum Catcher frustrate your efforts to unleash a raging Warden within a rival artisan's sanctuary, a grand solution awaits."
		""
		"By reinforcing your basic tool with three unstable &2Stellarite Pieces&r and a pure Nether Star, you can forge the legendary Boss Catcher."
		""
		"This supreme apparatus shatters all biological boundaries, allowing you to cleanly imprison, transport, and release absolute boss-tier entities wherever you choose across the realm."
	]
	quest.48AC8545D66B71B7.quest_desc: ["Congratulations! Getting the builder upgraded is an important step. The Builder can only build or upgrade any other hut up to the level of their own hut. So, in order for the Builder to upgrade any building, the Builder’s Hut must be upgraded first. Then the Builder will be able to upgrade any other building(s)."]
	quest.48AC8545D66B71B7.quest_subtitle: "Level Up a Builders Hut"
	quest.490628CE108A833A.quest_desc: [
		"The Courier runs back and forth from the Warehouse to all the worker huts in your colony, delivering materials to workers and putting finished products in the Warehouse. The level of the Courier’s Hut will dictate how many items the Courier can carry and the amount of requests they can keep track of at a time."
		""
		"Courier’s don’t just work on their own. You must build a warehouse, and assign the courier to work at a warehouse. "
		""
		"Note: If you have multiple Warehouses, Couriers will only see the items in the Warehouse they are assigned to. This is helpful in the late game when troubleshooting requests."
	]
	quest.490628CE108A833A.quest_subtitle: "Build a Courier Hut"
	quest.493B9FC17C3CF3CA.quest_desc: [
		"The Rabbit Hutch is where the Rabbit Herder will raise and butcher rabbits. You will have to capture and bring in two rabbits to the Rabbit Hutch, as the Rabbit Herder will not catch and bring in any rabbits."
		""
		"The Rabbit Herder will only keep two rabbits alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten rabbits in their holding pens."
		""
		"A rabbit may approach you if you hold a carrot or dandilion, but they won't follow you. Bring them back with a lead.  "
	]
	quest.493B9FC17C3CF3CA.quest_subtitle: "Build a Rabbit Hutch"
	quest.49793060345FB28C.quest_desc: [
		"The Cowhand’s Hut is where the Cowhand will milk, breed, and butcher cows for leather. The Cowhand will only keep two cows alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten cows in their holding pens to breed and butcher."
		""
		"Note: &eYou must bring your own cows to the pen.&r"
	]
	quest.49793060345FB28C.quest_subtitle: "Build a Cowhand's Hut"
	quest.4983FDCDA8EB48AF.quest_desc: [
		"Made from the flesh of a pig possessed by an Afrit, this chalk possesses both animalistic properties and part of an Afrit's power."
		""
		"Some occultists have reported that the demonic flesh keeps the chalk alive, resulting in strange movements. However, this has never been officially documented or proven, remaining merely rumors that may or may not be true."
		""
		"To obtain the demonic meat for pink chalk you need to summon and kill a Possessed Zombified Piglin."
	]
	quest.4983FDCDA8EB48AF.quest_subtitle: "The Meat Chalk"
	quest.4994A766ACAEED80.quest_desc: ["\"Forge the trumpet—echo your band's call!\""]
	quest.49D0B6D3ED3DCCCD.quest_desc: [
		"Cooking up some &bArcane Crystal Dust&r is incredibly easy: just throw your raw &bArcane Crystals&r into a standard furnace and boom, you're done!"
		""
		"If you want to get smart with your resources, run the process through your Clibano Multiblock forge instead."
		""
		"This heavy machine gives you a fantastic recycling bonus, letting you salvage and get a few whole &bArcane Crystals&r back during the refinement cycle."
	]
	quest.49D0B6D3ED3DCCCD.title: "&bArcane Crystal Dust"
	quest.49E9EBFC7B717D8E.quest_desc: [
		"&0Crude Oil&r is extremely valuable because it can be refined into some very useful liquids, most importantly &dGasoline&r and eventually &bPlastic&r!"
		""
		"To do this, you'll need to set up a &aRefinery&r. This is a small multiblock structure made up of the &aRefinery Controller&r and multiple &2Refinery Outputs&r."
		""
		"The &aRefinery Controller&r will need to be heated up, and the outputs determine how many different byproducts you can create when refining. "
		""
		"This can easily be done by placing the &aRefinery Controller&r directly over a lava source block, and then stacking the 4 outputs on top of it."
		""
		"You'll need to prevent &cHeat&r from dissipating, which can be done by covering each face with &bThermal Lagging&r."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/oil_refinery.png width:350 height:200 align:center}"
	]
	quest.49E9EBFC7B717D8E.title: "Refining Oil"
	quest.4A01C5F5DCF32C19.quest_desc: [
		"The legendary &3Soul Elytra&r provides the exact same aerial glide mechanics as a standard &8Elytra&r, heavily upgraded with superior durability and bonus armor protection."
		""
		"This advanced flight frame cannot be repaired using traditional &7Phantom Membranes&r, meaning you must rely on tool enchantments like Mending to restore its integrity."
		""
		"Constructing this artifact requires combining a base &8Elytra&r with four &3Sculk Bones&r dropped by the Shattered, two pinch allocations of &3Soul Dust&r harvested from Sculk Snappers or Leeches, and a single radiant &3Soul Crystal&r plundered from the &3&lStalker&r boss."
	]
	quest.4A01C5F5DCF32C19.title: "&3Soul Elytra"
	quest.4A11729731A3ED72.quest_desc: [
		"Utilizing the advanced synthesis field of &aStrigeor's Higher Binding&r, you can successfully manufacture a batch of Gray Paste. This dense, chemically altered substance contains highly focused extra-dimensional energy."
		""
		"Once extracted from your infusion array, combine this paste with a standard stick of Impure White Chalk in any crafting grid. The compound will thoroughly saturate the material, permanently altering its chemical signature to complete the manufacture of your Gray Chalk modifiers."
	]
	quest.4A11729731A3ED72.quest_subtitle: "Infusing high-density pastes into baseline ritual mediums"
	quest.4A11729731A3ED72.title: "Chemical Doping: Gray Chalk"
	quest.4A44623D8A307473.quest_desc: [
		"The &6High Speed Electric Tracks&r are like the &6Electric Tracks&r but faster! "
		""
		"They also require what the normal &6High Speed Tracks&r require and what the &6Electric Tracks&r require. &cSpeed Boosts&r and &eFrames&r to power them. "
		""
		"Now you have to be careful around corners and with touching them!"
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/rail_electric_speed.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.4A564E8FE587C7E4.quest_desc: [
		"The absolute finest methodology for harvesting captive spirits is through the deployment of a specialized Soul Extractor."
		""
		"Forging this tool requires combining an assortment of Nether materials and blocks with a custom Utrem Jar, a vessel which demands processed Edelwood timber to craft."
		""
		"To harvest fuel for your foundry, you must hold down your right-click command while channeling the tool directly into blocks of standard Soul Sand."
		""
		"The extraction process systematically bleeds the spirits out of the substrate, leaving behind a completely dry, modified block known as Soulless Sand."
	]
	quest.4AAC5609667F29AD.quest_desc: [
		"The advanced upgrade adds support for interacting with fluid containers in the player’s hand, as well as placing or removing fluid blocks directly in the world."
		""
		"Useful for automated fluid handling, on-the-go refills, or interacting with tanks and machines from other mods."
	]
	quest.4AD8363D7359A072.quest_desc: [
		"We're going to build the smallest passive reactor possible, the &93x3x3&r. The requirements for the quest are the exact amounts for what you'll need to build one.\\n\\nTo build this, you start by building a 3x3x3 frame made out of Casings. In the middle of the bottom face, you can just use another Reactor Casing. You'll want each outer wall to have a &9reactor component&r, like an Active Power Tap or Solid Access Port."
		""
		"Every reactor you build will require exactly 1 &6Reactor Controller&r, which is usually put in the middle of the front wall. Next, we'll place 1 &aFuel Rod&r in the center of the multiblock, and 1 &eControl Rod&r above it on the top face.\\n\\nYou will need a way to input and output waste, which is done by using &9Reactor Solid Access Ports&r. For this build, place one on the left side and one on the right.\\n\\nTo extract power, we'll place the &cActive Power Tap&r on the middle of the back wall. Once placed, the reactor should complete! You can now right click the Controller to open up the interface and turn it on!\\n\\nNote: The biggest reactor you can make using &aBasic Reactor Parts&r is 5x5x5. To build a larger reactor, you will need &eReinforced Reactor Parts&r."
		""
		"This is what a 3x3x3 reactor will look like:\\n"
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/3x3.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.4AD8363D7359A072.quest_subtitle: "Learning the Basics"
	quest.4AD8363D7359A072.title: "&dOur First Reactor"
	quest.4B0873D3B7295335.quest_desc: ["Feed hatched dragon raw chicken/rabbit to tame (multiple pieces). Grants Fire Resistance; fights with fire blasts."]
	quest.4B535B3689DF24DF.quest_desc: [
		"The entities waiting in the next tier of progression belong to a volatile class of fire elementals known as &cAfrit Demons&r. These highly advanced spirits possess immense processing power, but their physical compliance scales entirely with the geometric strength of your binding pentacle."
		""
		"Because your current chemical labs lack access to specialized Red Chalk formulas, you cannot construct the high-tier stabilization grids necessary to suppress their willpower. Consequently, any summoning attempt at this stage will manifest an &9Unbound&r Demon."
		""
		"Without a closed command circuit to shackle its instincts, the entity will immediately turn violent upon materialization, forcing you to terminate it manually in close-quarters combat to harvest its latent core components."
	]
	quest.4B535B3689DF24DF.quest_subtitle: "Evaluating containment thresholds and hostile manifestation risks."
	quest.4B535B3689DF24DF.title: "Thermal Instability: &cAfrit Demons&r"
	quest.4B7870B5DBF67428.quest_desc: ["One of the last artifacts left behind by the Iceologers before they all suddenly vanished from the world."]
	quest.4B7870B5DBF67428.quest_subtitle: "Found in Igloo chests"
	quest.4B9C8C7BAB6C36AF.quest_desc: [
		"Remembrance of the past lives of those who live in death."
		""
		"Crafted with 1 &bPhantom Membrane&r, 1 &bBone,&r 1 &bRotten Flesh&r, 1 &bGhast Tear&r, and 1 &bUndead Soul&r"
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/er_undead_eye.png width:160 height:80 align:center}"
	]
	quest.4B9E9497E44D0096.quest_desc: [
		"To build a reactor, you'll need to start by making &6Reactor Casings&r."
		""
		"These make up the frame and walls of your reactor, although the walls can be replaced by &9Reactor Glass&r if you'd like to see inside of your reactor."
		""
		"For future reference, when a part says \"Basic\", this means that it can only be used with other basic parts. "
		""
		"The Basic parts can also only be used to build smaller reactors, as it has a certain size limit. Keep this in mind!"
	]
	quest.4B9E9497E44D0096.title: "Reactor Building Components"
	quest.4BD97F45798CD89C.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to the arcane arts of &dOccultism&r."
		""
		"This branch of progression relies on breaching the planar veil to harness the labor of otherworldly &c&mDemons&r &bSpirits&r. These extra-dimensional entities will serve as the backbone of your automated processing networks, performing tireless labor for your factory line. Do not fear their origins; they are perfectly compliant under contractual binding. &oUsually&r."
		""
		"To open your gateway into this discipline, you must harvest raw &aDemon's Dream Seeds&r. Scour the landscape and clear away standard wild grass patches until you uncover a cache of these exotic seeds."
	]
	quest.4BD97F45798CD89C.quest_subtitle: "Step of Beginnings"
	quest.4BD97F45798CD89C.title: "&cDemons&r are &dDreaming"
	quest.4BE209D5DAF1F321.quest_desc: [
		"The celestial energy of &bAureal&r claims the primary and most vital slot within the internal mechanisms of the &6&lHephaestus Forge&r."
		""
		"To satisfy this requirement, an artisan can establish a permanent automation network by building and anchoring &bArcane Crystal Obelisks&r onto the perimeter foundations."
		""
		"Alternatively, you may manually sacrifice pre-filled &bAureal Bottles&r or highly volatile splash potions directly into the forge's interface."
		""
		"These concentrated liquid vessels can be uncovered by plundering dusty treasure chests throughout most ancient overworld structures."
		""
		"If you prefer the safety of the laboratory, you can instead brew them by infusing refined &bArcane Crystal Dust&r directly into a potent Potion of Regeneration II at your alchemy station."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/forbidden_aureal.png width:135 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.4BE209D5DAF1F321.title: "&bAureal"
	quest.4C011E4049CA4F5E.quest_desc: [
		"Adds furnace-like functionality to the backpack, with an optional automated variant."
		""
		"The regular upgrade functions like a standard furnace, requiring manual input and output."
	]
	quest.4C1CEC391186D5A1.quest_desc: ["Destroy Ur-Ghast in Sky Castle."]
	quest.4C1CEC391186D5A1.title: "Ur-Ghast Tears"
	quest.4C46E19656F412E3.quest_desc: ["Create lots of fancy food, get a chef's hat and open a restaurant!"]
	quest.4C46E19656F412E3.title: "Where is the lamb sauce?"
	quest.4C46EF35796A9833.quest_desc: [
		"This codex serves as your primary intelligence briefing on &dRituals&r. Understanding the core classifications is vital before constructing your first containment zones."
		""
		"&lTiers of Rituals&r"
		""
		"Ceremonies are categorized into four primary tiers, dictated by the raw power and instability of the entity you are invoking. Progression scales upward from lesser &eFoliot&r spirits, advancing through &aDjini&r, &cAfrit&r, and culminating in the highly volatile &9Marid&r tier. Highly specialized intermediate tiers—such as the &6Unbound Afrit&r tier—exist for anomalous entities."
		""
		"&lTypes of Rituals&r"
		""
		"While five distinct disciplines exist, your factory progression strictly relies on four. The core methodologies consist of &9Summoning Rituals&r, &5Possession Rituals&r, and &6Infusion Rituals&r, each detailed extensively upon their introduction. The fourth variant comprises &dDemon-less Rituals&r—hybrid matrices that draw upon elements of all three core paths to trigger localized alchemical reactions without binding a physical entity."
		""
		"The final discipline, &eFamiliar Rituals&r, is entirely optional for logistical progression but remains highly valuable if you wish to manifest specialized utility entities to secure unique passive buffs."
		""
		"&lChalks&r"
		""
		"Arcane chalks are divided into two operational classes: Foundation Chalks and Colored Chalks."
		""
		"Foundation variants act as the structural anchors required for every single geometric pentacle. Their tier correlates directly to their density and color, darkening sequentially as you advance from basic &l&f&lWhite&r&r&r Chalk up to midnight &0&lBlack&r&r Chalk."
		""
		"Conversely, &cC&r&6o&r&el&r&ao&r&9r&r&5e&r&dd&r Chalks act as the secondary modifiers that program the ritual's exact parameters. Unlike foundations, a colored chalk's pigment indicates its specific alchemical function rather than a strict power tier."
	]
	quest.4C46EF35796A9833.title: "Ritual Basics"
	quest.4CFE097D0A8683C8.quest_desc: [
		"The protective &5Obsidian Skull&r functions as a specialized helmet that shields its wearer from severe fire and burning lava damage."
		""
		"Over time, absorbing intense heat will wear down its integrity, requiring you to restore its durability at an anvil using refined &5Obsidiansteel&r."
		""
		"Forging this dark armature follows a direct blueprint, combining a standard Skeleton Skull centerpiece with eight surrounding ingots of &5Obsidiansteel&r."
	]
	quest.4CFE097D0A8683C8.title: "&5Obsidian Skull"
	quest.4D34FB6A4C0B0324.quest_desc: [
		"Adds fluid storage to the backpack, with capacity based on backpack tier."
		""
		"Uses part of the backpack’s inventory space to hold fluid."
		""
		"Can store any fluid, including modded ones."
		" "
		"Fluids can be inserted or extracted using pipes, or manually using fluid containers like buckets when the backpack is placed in the world."
		""
		"Includes GUI support for draining or filling the tank using fluid containers."
		""
		"Stack Upgrades also increase the tank’s capacity, just like they do for item slots."
	]
	quest.4D55BB6D531760B8.quest_desc: [
		"For your first ritual, you will summon a Foliot Crusher using the Aviar’s Circle Pentacle."
		""
		"To begin, open your guidebook and navigate to the Pentacles section. Select Aviar’s Circle and use the projection to guide you as you draw the pentacle with chalk."
		""
		"Once the pentacle is complete, place four Sacrificial Bowls within range of the Golden Sacrificial Bowl, then add the required offerings. Place the Book of Binding: Foliot (Bound) into the Golden Sacrificial Bowl at the center."
		""
		"When all items are prepared, activate the ritual by right-clicking the Golden Sacrificial Bowl. The offerings will be consumed, and the Foliot Crusher will emerge nearby."
		""
		"The Foliot Crusher grinds items into dust, yielding double output, and is required to craft the next tier of chalk."
	]
	quest.4D55BB6D531760B8.title: "First Ritual"
	quest.4D57A07592AED307.quest_desc: [
		"Be careful when smashing ancient vases, because breaking the wrong one will summon a deadly boss known as the &3&lStalker&r."
		""
		"He stands as a major threat with a giant health pool of 200 &4Hearts&r and a dedicated boss bar to track his life."
		""
		"Defeating this monster is a mandatory milestone if you want to harvest valuable &3Soul Crystals&r."
		""
		"He is lightning fast and deals devastating damage if he catches you, but thankfully he shares the &9&lWarden&r's main weakness of being completely blind."
		""
		"However, his hearing is incredible, meaning he will sprint straight toward any noise you make."
		""
		"Watch out for his special moves: he will try to smash you with basic hits, trigger a large area-of-effect blast, or spawn annoying &3Sculk Leeches&r to chew on your health. "
		""
		"He hates outsiders and will instantly attack any animal or monster that isn't a native &3Sculk&r creature."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/dnd_stalker.png width:100 height:200 align:center}"
	]
	quest.4D57A07592AED307.title: "&3Stalker"
	quest.4D61009737D94BDA.quest_subtitle: "Reach 25 Citizens"
	quest.4D9DC4973FD340E5.quest_desc: [
		"The Combat Academy is where your Knights in Training will train to become Knight. This also allows them to level up without a risk of dying to mobs."
		"The Knights in Training require a sword and shield to practice. They will attack the practice dummies, a pumpkin on top of a bale of hay."
		""
		"Tip: Consider setting the hiring mode to automatic so new recruits or kids growing up will automatically start training if not already attending school"
	]
	quest.4D9DC4973FD340E5.quest_subtitle: "Build a Combat Academy"
	quest.4DA806338AF7E2B0.quest_desc: [
		"The gray chalk is made with one of the magical pastes, making it an intermediate-level foundation chalk. Its magical properties can react in curious ways with the world around it."
		""
		"As an enhanced foundation chalk, it further strengthens the core of the pentacle and (almost always) can replace white glyphs or light gray glyphs."
	]
	quest.4DA806338AF7E2B0.title: "Improved Foundation"
	quest.4DD685A3F0F1329F.quest_desc: [
		"Although there is a pre-programmed &5Collector Drone&r, this quest will show you how to make one for yourself!"
		""
		"First, make sure to open your &aProgramming Table&r and import this basic code:"
		""
		"{\"text\": \"Click Here For The Code\", \"underlined\": true, \"clickEvent\": {\"action\": \"open_url\", \"value\": \"https://gist.github.com/ArtpokeBr/df8f8e046f85e0e97daf16f2976891e2\"}}"
		""
		"As previously mentioned, with this code you should only need to tweak the values to your specific needs."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/quest_drone_2.png width:240 height:200 align:center}"
		""
		"It's also good to note that some &bCode Blocks&r like the &2Export to Chest&r one may have some additional config options that can be accessed via Right-clicking."
		""
		"In this case, you can select from which side the &dDrone&r will access the &2Chest&r."
	]
	quest.4DD685A3F0F1329F.title: "&dCollector Drone"
	quest.4DD7E2BD8508A117.quest_subtitle: "Build one of every herder hut."
	quest.4E062B9B4960632D.quest_desc: [
		"Proper, fuel-burning transport... and seats two!"
		""
		"Has decent storage space, three upgrade slots, one weapon slot, one banner slot, and a dye slot too—for coloring the front nose and rear tail."
	]
	quest.4ED36AA3766E842B.quest_desc: [
		"Instead of building the smallest Turbine at this point, it's better to build a Turbine based off of the design of your &9Reactor&r."
		""
		"For starters, you want to build a Turbine that can handle the &9Vapor Production Rate&r of your reactor. "
		""
		"To get the most power out of it, it'll need to maintain either 900RPM or 1800RPM as well. "
		""
		"This takes a lot of experimenting with different coils, # of blades, and overall size of the Turbine!"
		""
		"Note: To complete this quest, you'll need to create a &dTask Screen&r of any size. "
		""
		"Once placed, you can right-click the screen and select this quest as the requirement, then output power into the task screen block to fill it up and complete the quest."
	]
	quest.4ED36AA3766E842B.title: "&dThe Turbine"
	quest.4EEF0962CC249F30.quest_desc: [
		"Starving colonists will eat just about anything, including raw food and rotten flesh. Yuck! "
		""
		"When citizens are hungry, they will come to the Restaurant and the Cook will give them food. (assuming you have food to give them) Consider building a Fisher’s Hut, or a Cowhand’s Hut. "
		""
		"Note: Make sure to choose a fuel for your cook to use. Some popular options are charcoal, sticks, and planks, although anything with a burn time will work. "
	]
	quest.4EEF0962CC249F30.quest_subtitle: "Build a Restaurant"
	quest.4EF0D3BC2C1461F3.quest_desc: ["Fill empty bucket on water source. Required for all colored variants."]
	quest.4FA6BEA4E646B742.quest_desc: [
		"Before we can start building our reactor, we'll need to smelt some Coal or Charcoal to create &9Graphite Ingots&r."
		""
		"Graphite, coupled with Iron, is one of the main materials when making a Reactor."
	]
	quest.4FA6BEA4E646B742.title: "Graphite for Casings"
	quest.4FF09E65BB96266F.quest_desc: ["Hunt 3 Endermen in the Overworld or End to gather Ender Pearls for future Eyes of Ender and upgrades."]
	quest.4FF09E65BB96266F.title: "Enderman Resource Hunt"
	quest.4FFFED2428429206.quest_desc: [
		"Sends items from the Router to target inventories."
		""
		"Mk1: Sends items to a single face."
		""
		"Mk2: Improved targeting and range."
		""
		"Mk3: Advanced sending with extended range and greater configurability."
	]
	quest.50020C8EDF78D696.quest_desc: [
		"Automatically compacts items using 2×2 and 3×3 crafting recipes - commonly used for resources like coal, redstone, and similar materials."
		""
		"The regular upgrade has 9 filter slots and supports only 2×2 recipes."
	]
	quest.501C6B7580453410.quest_desc: [
		"The &aFluidizer&r is a customizable multiblock that has a minimum size of 3x3x3. "
		""
		"Just like the other multiblocks, the frame will need to be made out of Casings, while the faces can be made out of Glass."
	]
	quest.503C5A0CE113962C.quest_desc: ["Is the builder going too slow? With this hammer equiped and the right resources in your inventory, you can help the builder out. Simply click anywhere in the hut being built to place blocks for the builder. "]
	quest.503C5A0CE113962C.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Hammer"
	quest.505E193E3466871A.quest_desc: [
		"Your next metallurgical milestone requires the acquisition of &cIesnium&r, an exotic ore crucial for forging top-tier ritual components."
		""
		"While conventional processing manuals instruct acolytes to go foraging deep within the subterranean veins of the Nether, this automated workspace allows you to bypass manual mining entirely."
		""
		"To manufacture this mineral, route a line of Ancient Debris directly into the beam path of an Atomic Reconstructor from the Actually Additions mod. The intense, high-energy particle stream will destabilize the debris, reorganizing its molecular density to yield a pure, unrefined sample of &cIesnium&r for your production lines."
	]
	quest.505E193E3466871A.quest_subtitle: "Bypassing Nether mining through high-energy atomic reorganization. "
	quest.505E193E3466871A.title: "Transmuting Metamaterials: &cIesnium&r"
	quest.5069CFB0B7060B2E.quest_desc: ["Shapeless craft (check JEI). Most advanced: opaque + glowing. Place in cauldrons/world."]
	quest.50B22AC218F32901.quest_desc: ["Craft Dial (JEI) + Iron Pocket Watch. Place Dial on Trunk/Base; insert Pocket Watch."]
	quest.51162B9185A45BB1.quest_desc: [
		"The powerful &9Enchanter's Bow&r can be permanently engraved with a custom magical formula by processing it at the Scribe's Table."
		""
		"When drawn, it draws upon your internal mana reserves to convert standard ammunition into specialized Spell Arrows that unleash the bound magic directly upon target impact."
		""
		"If your quiver runs completely empty, the bow will automatically manifest a phantom spell arrow that deals zero physical damage but still delivers the raw magic."
		""
		"Conversely, if your internal mana pool drains completely, the weapon simply fires normal arrows instead."
		""
		"Furthermore, this master-crafted bow is fully compatible with rare Augment Arrows, which instantly amplify and empower the effects of your inscribed spell."
	]
	quest.5128B119DFFF0C4C.quest_desc: [
		"The &3Steam Locomotive&r is the most basic &1Locomotive&r. It can be powered by giving it water, furnance fuel, and waiting. "
		""
		"It'll need constant water to keep working. "
		""
		"Don't worry that just means the smoke coming out of the top of it is Water Vapor, which is safe for the Environment."
		""
		"Well the Coal part isn't the best for the Environment... eh its &2Minecraft&r what do we care!"
	]
	quest.517977BB9C67C6FC.quest_desc: ["A powerful yet destructive artifact; the Piglins swore to protect it at the cost of their lives."]
	quest.517977BB9C67C6FC.quest_subtitle: "Found in Bastion Remnant chests"
	quest.5180CDD196518F64.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Strap Iron Tracks&r, like the &6Abandoned Tracks&r, are perfect for the cheapskates. "
		""
		"They go much slower than the other &6tracks&r but no risk of derailment!"
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/rail_strap.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.51C4F5A56CD6F613.quest_desc: [
		"Allows music discs to be played directly from the backpack’s upgrade tab."
		""
		"The basic upgrade provides 1 slot for a disc and simple play/stop controls."
	]
	quest.52453550206EC770.quest_desc: ["The Dyer's Hut is where the Dyer will craft dyes and dye other items, including red nether bricks and dark prismarine. They won't dye concrete or concrete powder, though."]
	quest.52453550206EC770.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Dyer's Hut"
	quest.52472667678E10D1.quest_desc: [
		"The volatile &2Stellarite&r forms deep within the subterranean rock, generating anywhere between Y-level 42 and -44."
		""
		"Do not let its wide vertical range deceive you, as these sparkling veins are incredibly rare and difficult to uncover."
		""
		"Exercise extreme caution during extraction operations: the raw mineral is highly unstable and will immediately trigger a dangerous explosion when fractured by a pickaxe."
	]
	quest.52472667678E10D1.title: "&2Stellarite Pieces"
	quest.5250B8827FAB1F83.quest_desc: ["Obtain every survival obtainable eye"]
	quest.5250B8827FAB1F83.title: "Why do I feel like sombody's watching me?"
	quest.525DDBC34EB0BE89.quest_desc: ["Unlocks distribution modes (round robin/nearest first/furthest first/random)"]
	quest.52D4FCE72B15BC46.quest_desc: [
		"The master-crafted Edelwood Bucket serves as a highly advanced upgrade over traditional iron fluid containers."
		""
		"Assembling this vessel from a few basic Edelwood Planks expands your logistical capacity, allowing you to carry up to four standard buckets of water or milk simultaneously inside a single inventory slot."
		""
		"Furthermore, the specialized timber is robust enough to contain volatile lava, though the extreme weight limits your maximum payload to three buckets instead of four."
	]
	quest.53024D3B186DE64B.quest_desc: [
		"Sends items from the Router to target inventories."
		""
		"Mk1: Sends items to a single face."
		""
		"Mk2: Improved targeting and range."
		""
		"Mk3: Advanced sending with extended range and greater configurability."
	]
	quest.53594EBA9F7BA840.quest_desc: [
		"The Advanced Item Unloader is just like the normal part but can be used from any direction. "
		""
		"Nothing different besides direction."
	]
	quest.537A8F99CC3F525D.quest_subtitle: "Hire 8 Guards"
	quest.538E32AFD25FD337.quest_desc: [
		"Transfers fluids between the backpack’s tank and fluid containers or fluid blocks in the world."
		""
		"The regular upgrade allows pumping to and from fluid containers in the world, and only functions when the backpack is placed."
		""
		"A configurable option controls whether the pump inputs fluid into the tank or outputs from it."
	]
	quest.539266A1C03C2EBA.quest_desc: [
		"Captive Souls fill the second dedicated reservoir of your &6&lHephaestus Forge&r, standing as the most conservative gauge to satisfy with a maximum capacity of only ten units."
		""
		"Every standard phantom soul or dark corrupt soul you offer will contribute exactly one point to the total count."
		""
		"However, if you sacrifice a rare, highly potent Enchanted Soul into the furnace core, its intense magical residue will immediately fill the entire ten-point reservoir all at once."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/forbidden_souls.png width:135 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.539266A1C03C2EBA.title: "Souls"
	quest.53C460B13560066F.quest_desc: [
		"Constructing the pentacle layout for Strigeor's Higher Binding marks your entry into the second tier of &6Infusion Rituals&r. While this advanced atmospheric matrix is capable of driving a diverse array of transmutation loops, your immediate production targets require it to synthesize two critical assets: the Infused Pickaxe and Gray Paste."
		""
		"The Infused Pickaxe serves as a highly specialized harvesting tool capable of shattering dense worldly blocks that normal steel and diamond cannot scratch. Meanwhile, Gray Paste functions as a dense chemical catalyst that you will directly combine with your raw chalk stocks to engineer the next tier of colored modifiers for your expanding ritual facilities."
	]
	quest.53C460B13560066F.quest_subtitle: "Harnessing mid-tier essence for stabilized alloys and enchanted instrumentation"
	quest.53C460B13560066F.title: "Advanced Metamaterial: Strigeor's Higher Binding"
	quest.53E2BEA626B35BFC.quest_desc: [
		"While constructing the mystical &6Spectral &4Eye&r demands a highly expensive sacrifice of rare materials, its tactical utility is unmatched."
		""
		"Channeling the artifact immediately infuses a sorcerer with the potent &4Spectral Vision Effect&r."
		""
		"This advanced aura projects an intense, radiant &eGlowing&r silhouette around every living monster and creature within a massive 100-block radius in all spatial vectors."
		""
		"This sight is flawless for mapping out hidden underground strongholds, locating fortresses in the fiery &c&lNether&r, or pinpointing a rival artisan's secret animal vaults deep beneath the earth."
	]
	quest.53E2BEA626B35BFC.title: "&6Spectral &4Eye &7Amulet"
	quest.53F8923B85A8A9CC.quest_subtitle: "Hire 80 Guards"
	quest.5407B3A9D7544F43.quest_desc: [
		"The &dPressure Chamber&r is one of the main crafting machines for &6PNCR&r."
		""
		"This multiblock machine can be built in multiple sizes: 3x3x3, 4x4x4, or 5x5x5."
		""
		"Bigger chambers will allow for more bulk crafting of recipes with less downtime for repressurizing."
		""
		"To build the &dPressure Chamber&r, start by building the frame using &bPressure Chamber Walls&r."
		""
		"The faces of the walls can be built out of &bPressure Chamber Glass&r instead of walls if you'd like!"
		""
		"To interact with the &dPressure Chamber&r, we'll need to use at least 2 &aPressure Chamber Interfaces&r."
		""
		"How you place them will determine whether they can pull or push items. The square is the input side, and the circle is the output!"
		""
		"For the &dChamber&r to compress items, we'll need to pump in compressed air into a &aPressure Chamber Valve&r."
	]
	quest.5407B3A9D7544F43.title: "My Precious...."
	quest.5415CCF3CA40E641.quest_desc: [
		"Automatically consumes potions, splash potions, and food with effects based on configurable conditions."
		""
		"Can be set to activate under specific situations—such as when sprinting, underwater, or affected by negative effects."
		""
		"Supports milk buckets to clear effects, and food items with potion-like benefits."
	]
	quest.54289F246E1D41A6.quest_desc: [
		"Adds energy storage to the backpack, allowing it to charge or discharge energy-based items."
		""
		"Uses part of the backpack’s inventory space to store energy."
		""
		"Can interact with energy containers via the upgrade tab GUI—items can be charged or discharged directly from the backpack."
		""
		"When the backpack is placed in the world, modded energy cables can connect to it and push or pull energy."
		""
		"Stack Upgrades increase the battery’s capacity, just like they do for item slots."
	]
	quest.542C6D76B579886C.quest_desc: [
		"Once you harvest your grown crops, you will collect a handful of &5Magebloom Fibers&r."
		""
		"These magical threads are exactly what you need to spin into enchanted cloth."
		""
		"Take them to your workbench to craft the custom fabric required for sewing your very first sets of wizard robes and magical gear!"
	]
	quest.543FB60840C3CA00.quest_desc: [
		"The advanced upgrade supports both 2×2 and 3×3 recipes and has 16 filter slots."
		""
		"A configurable option controls whether compacting occurs only for items inserted through automation, or also when added manually via the backpack’s GUI."
		""
		"Another option allows compacting of items that cannot be uncrafted, which is disabled by default to prevent irreversible conversions."
	]
	quest.54468ED84F34EEFE.quest_desc: [
		"Manufacturing your next tier of runic modifiers requires you to harvest high-density organic compounds from extra-dimensional shock troops. You must initiate &6Abras' Open Commanding Conjure&r to force a wave of Demon Possessed Zombified Piglins to cross into the material plane."
		""
		"Prepare your weaponry for a high-intensity combat engagement. Upon terminating these corrupted nether-born entities, you can collect their dropped Demonic Meat. This highly unstable, tissue-based byproduct acts as a potent binding agent; combine it directly with your base chalk stocks in a crafting grid to complete the synthesis of your Pink Chalk modifiers."
	]
	quest.54468ED84F34EEFE.quest_subtitle: "Extracting corrupted tissue samples via spatial command matrices."
	quest.54468ED84F34EEFE.title: "Abyssal Tissues: Pink Chalk"
	quest.5482EFE6DC5284CD.quest_desc: ["With the Collecting Upgrade, nearby dropped items are automatically picked up and stored. This is especially useful for farms, mob drops, or any setup where items would otherwise accumulate on the ground."]
	quest.54F2CB52D3A7BA87.quest_desc: [
		"The Item Unloader is the opposite of the Item Loader. "
		""
		"It will take items from the &7Carts&r. This one must also be above the &6Track&r."
	]
	quest.55851524FDDB6959.quest_desc: ["The Cookery is where the Chef prepares meals for your citizens. When other buildings request food, the Chef will cook it. Pair the Cookery with your Restaurants to automatically keep them stocked with fresh meals."]
	quest.559E3E654C4B585A.quest_desc: ["The advanced upgrade supports up to 12 items and allows targeting specific slots: any slot, main hand, offhand, or a specific hotbar slot number."]
	quest.55A5432706A67147.quest_desc: ["Hunt Zombies to gather iron scraps for further upgrades."]
	quest.55B7E3EE706E8D6F.quest_desc: [
		"&bReinforced Stone&r is the basis for most &6PNCR&r machinery."
		""
		"Its hardened and thermally resistant nature makes it a perfect material to contain the high pressure of pneumatic devices."
		""
		"You'll need a good bit of these to craft a lot of the machines in the mod!"
	]
	quest.55D3579D6F1C5791.quest_desc: [
		"Spirit Attuned Gems are infused with resonant Otherworldly power and are used in a wide range of crafting recipes and Rituals. Most commonly, they serve as the foundation for creating the Divination Rod and Spirit Attuned Crystals."
		""
		"To obtain a Spirit Attuned Gem, offer a diamond to the Spirit Fire. As the flame consumes it, the gem is awakened—its essence aligned with the spirits beyond the veil."
	]
	quest.55D6BE54A2859713.quest_desc: [
		"Almost lost to time, the cyan chalk brings ancient knowledge, often even forbidden. But who cares? After all, knowledge is knowledge, and the more, the better, right?"
		""
		"Despite the complexity of its manufacture, this chalk is dated as one of the oldest, perhaps even the oldest chalk ever recorded. And even after all this time, its uses are little known, but you can see just how stable it is."
		""
		"Pulverizing an Echo Shard while retaining its properties is a job that only the best crushers can do."
	]
	quest.55D6BE54A2859713.quest_subtitle: "The Chalk From Ancients"
	quest.55D7CD0FA8F1AE48.quest_desc: [
		"The reason we're all here, &5Trains&r. "
		""
		"The mod is called &l&7RailCraft Reborn&r don't act surprised."
		""
		"There's 2 different main &5Trains&r and 1 special mining &5Train&r."
		""
		"These &5Trains&r all by themselves can get a little boring, so why not attach &7Carts&r to them! "
		""
		"Connecting &7Carts&r with &7Carts&r and with &5Trains&r is called Coupling, and to unconnect them is to Decouple. "
		""
		"To Couple &5Trains&r and &7Carts&r use a &4Crowbar&r or a &6Track&r with the Coupling &cTrack Kit&r."
	]
	quest.55DCA040C84DCEF3.quest_desc: [
		"If you want to get your hands on the product the &aFluidizer&r makes, you'll need an &aOutput Port&r on one of the faces."
		""
		"The &aFluidizer&r will need power to operate, so a &cPower Port&r is required to complete the structure."
	]
	quest.5617E925EA668ADF.quest_desc: [
		"The Linking Tool is used to connect drawers to a Storage Controller. This allows drawers to become part of a shared storage network without needing direct physical contact."
		""
		"To begin linking, right-click the Storage Controller to start configuration mode. While in this mode, right-click drawers to add them to the controller’s network."
		""
		"When holding the tool, it will also display which drawers are currently connected to the controller, making it easy to verify and manage your storage setup."
	]
	quest.56208AC5F5672FC3.quest_desc: [
		"While the baseline satchel significantly reduces field inventory clutter, its mechanical placement cycle introduces noticeable construction downtime as your production lines expand. Achieving complete spatial efficiency requires channeling the stabilization field of the &cSevira's Permanent Confinement&r matrix to manufacture an upgraded Artisanal Ritual Satchel."
		""
		"This advanced apparatus functions nearly identically to its lower-tier counterpart, but features an overhauled deployment engine. Upon right-clicking a holographic guidebook blueprint, the satchel instantly manifests and snaps every required rune, candle, and structural anchor into the world simultaneously, eliminating all construction lag."
		""
		"Furthermore, the artisanal model integrates a specialized reclamation sequence. Right-clicking your central Golden Sacrificial Bowl with the satchel will instantly wipe all active chalk runes from the floor grid while simultaneously vacuuming all peripheral decorations—such as skulls, candles, and crystals—directly back into the bag's internal storage matrix."
		""
		"&o(Note: While this rapid teardown mechanism perfectly automates your room cleanup, it operates strictly as a logistical retrieval tool; the breakdown process does not restore or recharge the physical durability of the chalk items spent during deployment.)&r"
	]
	quest.56208AC5F5672FC3.quest_subtitle: "Maximizing geometric deployment speeds and automated breakdown routines."
	quest.56208AC5F5672FC3.title: "Instant Logistics: Artisanal Satchels"
	quest.565F6775D6C225CA.quest_desc: [
		"Adds furnace-like functionality to the backpack, with an optional automated variant."
		""
		"The regular upgrade functions like a standard furnace, requiring manual input and output."
	]
	quest.568AFDE4EF26D14B.quest_desc: [
		"Templates add special upgrades to your Construction Sticks. To apply a template, combine the stick, template, and an additional item in a Smithing Table."
		""
		"Destruction: Remove blocks quickly and efficiently."
	]
	quest.56D41A4605C42EB5.quest_desc: [
		"Keep your eyes peeled for glowing orange pockets of &6Crystallized Amber&r while navigating the hot &cOvercast Columns&r."
		""
		"If you want to mine these blocks and add them to your collection, you'll absolutely need a pickaxe loaded with Silk Touch."
		""
		"They don't have any major crafting recipes or survival uses, but they make for absolutely beautiful decoration blocks around your base camp."
	]
	quest.56D41A4605C42EB5.title: "&6Crystallized Amber"
	quest.56EF9762C5A5441B.quest_desc: ["Gather Some Slime"]
	quest.56EF9762C5A5441B.title: "Acquire Slime Ball"
	quest.5737623C55009253.quest_desc: [
		"Synthesized within the maximum-tier field of &9Uphyxes' Inverted Tower&r, the &bIesnium Anvil&r serves as the ultimate pinnacle of equipment maintenance and modification technology. This mechanical powerhouse completely overhauls standard blacksmithing parameters, offering extensive logistical advantages:"
		""
		"&o&nAbsolute Indestructibility&r: The anvil possesses a completely flawless structural integrity matrix. It experiences zero degradation or wear, remaining permanently functional regardless of usage volume."
		""
		"&o&nBypassing Enchantment Thresholds&r: The device forces modification limits upward. Combining identical max-tier items or books will compress the enchantments past standard vanilla boundaries, increasing the cap by an additional tier."
		""
		"&o&nDrastic Experience Compression&r: Total energy expenditure is halved. The workstation cuts your physical experience point requirements precisely in two, rounding down to ensure high-efficiency throughput during complex merges."
		""
		"&o&nDiminished Work Penalties&r: Successive operations on the same item matrix scale much more gracefully, drastically slowing the rapid cost multiplication penalty that plagues lower-tier anvils."
		""
		"&o&nEliminating Budget Blocks&r: The network ceiling is expanded. This mechanics override significantly raises the maximum experience cap, allowing you to finalize heavy, multi-enchanted gear pieces that would normally be rejected as \"Too Expensive!\""
	]
	quest.5737623C55009253.quest_subtitle: "Bypassing standard mechanics to achieve hyper-optimized gear modification."
	quest.5737623C55009253.title: "Unbreaking Synthesis: The &bIesnium Anvil&r"
	quest.5766C8B9E850C186.quest_desc: [
		"To synthesize the &9Source Gem&r, a foundational material required for most high-tier arcane crafting, you must construct an &6Imbuement Chamber&r."
		""
		"This apparatus processes recipes by focusing concentrated Source energy onto a target item."
		""
		"While the chamber generates a minimal amount of internal energy on its own, it can draw power directly from nearby Source Jars to fuel complex tasks."
		""
		"Furthermore, several advanced imbuing formulas require you to arrange auxiliary Arcane Pedestals around the central block to hold secondary material ingredients."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/imbuement.png width:200 height:150 align:1}"
	]
	quest.5766C8B9E850C186.quest_subtitle: "Creating Source Gems"
	quest.577762F8F7FBE6F9.quest_desc: ["Obtain every survival obtainable Insanium item!"]
	quest.577762F8F7FBE6F9.title: "Crazy? I was crazy once"
	quest.57C889EC980D33D9.quest_desc: ["I can finally top playing in the dirt (as much) and hand off my farming duties to someone else. I should probably have the farmer start with carrots since they don't need to be cooked, too..."]
	quest.57C889EC980D33D9.quest_subtitle: "Build a Farm"
	quest.580148D1141446A6.quest_desc: [
		"Should the fiery depths of the &c&lNether&r prove too perilous for your current armor, you may hunt for wandering spirits across the safety of the &2&lOverworld&r."
		""
		"Exploring the dense canopies of local Dark Forests reveals fleeting Lost Souls drifting aimlessly through the timber."
		""
		"Slaying these tragic phantoms allows you to harvest their lingering essence, though this wilderness hunting route proves far less efficient than mining the underworld."
		""
		"If these spirits remain elusive, you would be wise to seek out the elusive Soul Looting enchantment for your blade, which forces standard monsters to occasionally manifest fresh spirits upon their defeat."
	]
	quest.580148D1141446A6.title: "Lost Souls"
	quest.5820EDEF71340A1A.quest_desc: [
		"&6Abandoned Tracks&r are good for the cheapskates and aesthetic. "
		""
		"They can be used to bridge accross a few blocks without support. "
		""
		"They can only be 2 blocks away from blocks going the same direction, or one block from the opposite direction. "
		""
		"They come at the risk of derailment though, basically your &7Cart&r will be thrown off the &6rails&r."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/rail_abandoned.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.5827E9110E4B19F9.quest_desc: ["I hope your citizens apprcaite all that you do for them. Spoiler alert, they don't thay are probably still complaining abount not enough guards, poor housing conditions, or refusing to eat the slop you put in front of them. (only commoners eat steak...)"]
	quest.5827E9110E4B19F9.quest_subtitle: "Build a Level 5 Mystical Site"
	quest.583A7AA84FEC027F.quest_desc: [
		"Before anything can be built, you need a Builder. The Builder must build their own Builder’s Hut before building any other huts, and they cannot build or upgrade a hut to a higher level than their own hut level. "
		""
		"The builder is arguably the hardest working citizen in your colony. (Second only to you). You are not limited to just one builder. As your colony grows, you may need multiple builders to keep up. "
	]
	quest.583A7AA84FEC027F.quest_subtitle: "Say that 10 times real fast! "
	quest.5852927F9A6217D0.quest_desc: ["Evenly distributes items across multiple target inventories. Ideal for splitting resources between machines or storage systems."]
	quest.5866438E5D19AB69.quest_desc: [
		"Keep your guard up when smashing ancient vases, because aggressive &3Sculk Leeches&r will sometimes burst right out of them."
		""
		"It makes for a nasty little surprise when a pair of them spawns at once to ambush you."
		""
		"They are incredibly weak with a tiny health bar of just 2 &4Hearts&r, but they will still lung and attack you without hesitation."
		""
		"Make sure to squish them whenever they appear, because they are an easy source of &3Soul Dust&r on death."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/dnd_leech.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.5866438E5D19AB69.title: "&3Sculk Leech"
	quest.588289B834828DCC.quest_desc: ["Protects the Router from explosions. When installed, the Router will not be destroyed by blast damage (such as TNT or Withers) helping safeguard critical automation setups."]
	quest.58C2ABED43B2EA61.quest_desc: [
		"&9Model Frameworks&r are the starting point for creating Data Models."
		""
		"To start collecting data on a specific mob, you'll want to make one of these then &9right click&r the mob you'd like to gather data on. When done properly, the Model Framework will turn into the Data Model of the mob you clicked on."
		""
		"To gather data for that mob, place the newly created Data Model inside of a &aDeep Learner&r, then start killing that specific mob with the Deep Learner in your inventory."
	]
	quest.58C2ABED43B2EA61.title: "&9Modeling Mobs"
	quest.58EC47584C773B82.quest_desc: [
		"Fire up your Enchanting Apparatus setup, because it is time to craft your very first magical crop: the &5Magebloom Seed&r."
		""
		"Planting and farming these special seeds will yield unique magical fibers, which are the essential material you need to craft your first sets of enchanted clothing!"
	]
	quest.58EC47584C773B82.title: "Magebloom Seed"
	quest.58F2A92518723495.quest_desc: ["Hunt Nether Zombified Piglins (8.5% Gold Ingot drop) for Pocket Watches/Pendulums."]
	quest.5914D015D8543875.quest_desc: [
		"The &aFluidizer&r can operate in one of 3 modes: Solid to Fluid, Combining 2 Solids into a Fluid, or combining 2 Fluids into a new Fluid. "
		""
		"This all depends on the type of &aInjectors&r you use for the multiblock."
		""
		"For example, if you want to convert &dBlutonium&r into a fluid, you can use 1 &aSolid Injector&r."
		""
		"If you want to combine two solids together into something new, you'll build the multiblock with 2 &aSolid Injectors&r."
		""
		"If you want to combine two fluids, you'll use 2 &9Fluid Injectors&r."
		""
		"This might seem confusing, but is important for progression. For example, you'll want to convert Magentite into a fluid in the Fluidizer first, then send it to a &aReprocessor&r with Ludicrite to create Ridiculite."
	]
	quest.5915333699E3D9C1.quest_desc: ["Craft Chisel (shaped: Iron top, Stick center). Hold base blocks (e.g., Stone Bricks) → Right-Click → GUI select variant (600+ patterns, connected textures)"]
	quest.5973D28636E845D2.quest_desc: ["Dive to ocean floors and mine gravel patches for Seabrass Ore (also sold by cartographers)"]
	quest.5973D28636E845D2.title: "Seabrass Dive"
	quest.5993093AC5F07B84.quest_desc: ["Stack Downgrades divide the max stack size by 32."]
	quest.59AF80E8EE17C769.quest_desc: [
		"The &5Echoing Forest&r is a simple biome that grows special &5Echoing Trees&r. "
		""
		"You can chop down these trees to harvest &aLogs&r for crafting, and their &5Leaves&r drop saplings alongside a glowing material called Sculk Gleam. "
		""
		"The ground is completely covered in &5Echoing Soil&r. These unique blocks are purely decorative and cannot be tilled into farmland or used as normal dirt.\""
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/dnd_forest.png width:200 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.59AF80E8EE17C769.title: "&5Echoing Forest"
	quest.59D9BD317EACB387.quest_desc: ["Craft Equipment Skin Template (JEI recipe; saves skins from Armourer block). Place Armourer block to build voxel skins."]
	quest.59F1094B4457D836.quest_desc: ["Craft Label (JEI; tag chests/shelves)."]
	quest.5A11A2FC20E5CE2A.quest_desc: [
		"The Barracks is the ultimate protection for your colony. The Barracks Towers (unlike the normal Guard tower) will employ and house one Guard for every level built, for a total of 5 Guards per Barracks Tower!"
		""
		"In the later game you will likely want two barracks chock full of &mexpendable&r brave souls."
		""
		"Tip: At level 3, you can hire spies for 5 gold per raid, these spies will go out into the world and if barbarians are spotted, the spies will tell you exactly where the barbarians are."
	]
	quest.5A11A2FC20E5CE2A.quest_subtitle: "Build a Barracks"
	quest.5A23107C363A209E.quest_subtitle: "Makes Various End Materials"
	quest.5A5583EA02C78372.quest_desc: [
		"An upgraded airship, with heaps of storage space."
		""
		"Good for hauling loads of loot and ore back home."
		""
		"It's also perfect for those hankering for the nomadic life-style."
	]
	quest.5A615BB74A5CD332.quest_desc: [
		"Using the &aReprocessor&r, we can combine everything we've made so far to make a few new ingots."
		""
		"Note: You might need a &9Fluidizer&r to complete this step!"
	]
	quest.5A6FF0D4BA894306.quest_desc: [
		"The defining masterpiece and true poster child of &6&lForbidden \\& Arcanus&r is the legendary &aEternal Stella&r."
		""
		"Forging this miraculous artifact requires combining a single rare &bDiamond&r, three dense &aXpetrified Orbs&r, and an unstable &2Stellarite Piece&r within your ritual arrays to produce one of the most powerful items in existence."
		""
		"Combining the completed &aEternal Stella&r with a piece of equipment inside a Smithing Table completely removes its vulnerability to wear and tear, stripping away its dependency on durability entirely to render the item permanently indestructible."
		""
		"This powerful enchantment can be safely bound to nearly any tool, weapon, or armor piece that utilizes standard integrity gauges."
		""
		"However, certain boundary limitations apply: it can only modify items with true physical durability pools, completely rejecting tools that operate on strict activation uses—like Infusion Crystals—or equipment powered by electronic energy matrices."
	]
	quest.5A6FF0D4BA894306.title: "&aEternal Stella"
	quest.5A79137D9EA9EFC0.quest_desc: [
		"Managing mass-resource generation lines demands a sophisticated logistical backbone. If you have not yet established a digitized inventory network, anchoring your logistics to a &dDimensional Storage&r network is highly recommended."
		""
		"To initialize this system, you must construct and place a &dDimensional Storage Actuator&r. This device serves as the core master anchor for your pocket dimension. The block retains its internal memory layout when broken, allowing you to relocate the entire physical block without losing any of your stored commodities."
		""
		"By default, the matrix provides 128 unique inventory slots, with each slot capable of compressing and holding up to 16 full stacks of a single item. However, note that items containing unique &5NBT&r data are completely incompatible with this compression logic. Tools, armor, and modified components will not stack and will consume an entire slot by themselves, making it vital to filter these items out of your automated input pipelines."
	]
	quest.5A79137D9EA9EFC0.title: "The Planar Matrix: &dDimensional Storage"
	quest.5A88CF0A287B326A.quest_desc: ["Hunt Cows for leather (used in seats/tool racks via JEI recipes)."]
	quest.5AA88E954F364C99.quest_desc: ["Outputs stored energy from the Router into machines up to 8 blocks away."]
	quest.5ACCF56D41A5CC27.quest_desc: [
		"The &dEnd Remastered&r adds 16 unique Ender Eyes to Minecraft. Like normal Eyes of Ender, they can locate Strongholds and have a chance to break when thrown."
		""
		"&l&6Only 12&r&r different eyes are needed to activate an End Portal, and any combination works as long as each eye is unique."
		""
		"Each eye comes from a specific source, usually found in structure loot chests. Looting, kill method, and player involvement do not affect drop chances."
	]
	quest.5ACCF56D41A5CC27.quest_subtitle: "Visit the end dimension"
	quest.5ACCF56D41A5CC27.title: "End Remastered"
	quest.5AD80D3242DD3F60.quest_desc: ["One of the hardest materials to get in the mod!"]
	quest.5AE0DA6972811771.quest_desc: [
		"Securing the complete spectrum of alchemical chalks demands that you manifest and terminate an unyielding, hostile &cAfrit&r entity."
		""
		"While this ceremony is officially categorized under the summoning tree rather than a true &5Possession Ritual&r, the unique chemical nature of this fire spirit still demands a live biological anchor to bridge the dimensional gap. For this particular circle, you must secure a standard overworld cow to serve as the structural sacrifice."
		""
		"Ensure your combat arena is heavily fortified and free of flammable materials before proceeding. The moment your target animal enters the center of the runic perimeter and the offering is executed, the matrix will ignite, immediately releasing the violent entity into your world."
	]
	quest.5AE0DA6972811771.quest_subtitle: "Constructing the high-risk thermal core extraction matrix."
	quest.5AE0DA6972811771.title: "Unbound Combustion: The &cAfrit&r Manifestation"
	quest.5B992E5F0419B631.quest_desc: ["The advanced upgrade offers more precise control, including a setting that defines how much hunger must be missing relative to the food's hunger value before feeding occurs, and an option to feed immediately when the player is hurt."]
	quest.5B9C2E2369DD8428.quest_desc: ["Craft Emerald Ender Chest by surrounding a vanilla Ender Chest by alternating Emeralds and Block of Emerald for +2 rows (45 slots total)."]
	quest.5BB6B74BA3AE18D7.quest_desc: [
		"The final bottleneck of automated possession loops is the physical requirement of manually gathering and executing livestock over your runic arrays. To achieve complete hands-free automation, Ars Occultas provides a highly specialized logistical component: the Sacrificial Altar."
		""
		"This device must be installed directly beneath your central Golden Sacrificial Bowl. When powered, the altar completely replaces the requirement for live entity execution by converting raw, liquid magic into a viable biological catalyst."
		""
		"To calibrate this automated matrix, you must place an active Ars Nouveau Source Jar within proximity to supply the necessary fluid energy. Additionally, a Containment Jar holding a trapped specimen of your target sacrifice must be positioned adjacent to the setup. The altar will continuously scan the contained entity's biological frequency, consume a portion of your stored Source fluid, and flawlessly simulate the required sacrifice to initiate your automated possession cycles indefinitely."
	]
	quest.5BB6B74BA3AE18D7.quest_subtitle: "Substituting living biological sacrifices with fluid source energy networks."
	quest.5BB6B74BA3AE18D7.title: "Automated Execution: The Sacrificial Altar"
	quest.5BDADF6C889BB9D1.quest_desc: [
		"Manufacturing your next tier of runic modifiers requires you to harness the high-throughput crushing capabilities of your mid-to-high-tier processing thralls. Both the &9Fatma's Incentivized Attraction&r matrix (for the &9Marid Crusher&r) and the &aOphyx' Calling&r matrix (for the &aDjinni Crusher&r) possess the necessary structural dampening fields to run this specialized extraction line."
		""
		"To acquire the required components, route raw quantities of Ice, Packed Ice, or Blue Ice directly into your active spirit’s processing area. These advanced entities will rapidly fracture the frozen compounds into localized, ultra-cold crushed fragments without generating the ambient friction heat that would otherwise liquefy the materials into waste water."
		""
		"Once harvested, take these stabilized sub-zero dusts straight to your crafting grid and combine them with your base chalk stocks to finalize the synthesis of your Light Blue Chalk modifiers."
	]
	quest.5BDADF6C889BB9D1.quest_subtitle: "Processing high-density ice aggregates into advanced colored modifiers."
	quest.5BDADF6C889BB9D1.title: "Thermal Extraction: Light Blue Chalk"
	quest.5C028DF690ABA305.quest_desc: ["Provides the highest transfer speeds."]
	quest.5C1272F7C1D1A098.quest_desc: [
		"The rare Crimson Stones are precious talismans discovered strictly within the hidden storage vaults of distant Pillager Outposts."
		""
		"Locating them can prove incredibly frustrating for an explorer, as these hostile wooden towers only yield two treasure chests per structure to plunder."
		""
		"These crimson gems are not utilized to forge any new weapon or block blueprints."
		""
		"Instead, slotting them into your foundry tunes its spiritual focus to drastically decrease the total number of Souls required to execute your crafting rituals."
	]
	quest.5C1272F7C1D1A098.title: "&cCrimson Stone"
	quest.5C3FF43CF16BCF30.quest_desc: [
		"Once you have a steady supply of Source Gems, you can finally start building advanced magical machinery by crafting baseline blocks of &5Sourcestones&r."
		""
		"Think of this material as your essential construction brick—you'll need it as a core ingredient for almost every machine you create."
	]
	quest.5C3FF43CF16BCF30.quest_subtitle: "Formerly \"Arcana Stones\""
	quest.5C3FF43CF16BCF30.title: "Sourcestone"
	quest.5C776EA056A14C57.quest_desc: [
		"Before you can begin shackling entities to your automated factory lines, you must manufacture the fundamental medium of all occult geometry: &aChalk&r."
		""
		"Advanced blueprints demand multiple colors of chalk to complete their intricate grids. To begin your arcane progression, &bWhite Chalk&r serves as the base layer."
		""
		"Your first step requires smelting Otherstone within a standard furnace to produce burnt variants, alongside throwing raw Otherworld Logs into the cleansing flames of a &dSpiritfire&r matrix. Combining these resulting components allows you to forge Impure White Chalk."
		""
		"To refine the medium, toss the impure chalk directly back into the &dSpiritfire&r to cleanse it of earthly impurities. Left-clicking the ground with your purified tool will transcribe the required &mdemonic&r runic glyphs into the world. Because these etched symbols are notoriously tedious to scrub away by hand, it is highly recommended to craft a specialized &aChalk Brush&r to easily wipe the floor clean when re-configuring your ritual rooms."
	]
	quest.5C776EA056A14C57.title: "Preparing for a Ritual: &eChalk"
	quest.5C809B88AA86579A.quest_subtitle: "Open 50 containers"
	quest.5C983A41886A2B75.quest_desc: [
		"To escape this dark dimension and return safely to the &2&lOverworld&r, you can cross back through the exact same type of gateway you used to enter."
		""
		"Simply apply a &9Heart of the Deep&r artifact to a portal frame constructed from &8Reinforced Deepslate&r."
		""
		"Fortunately, you do not need to slay another Warden to find this key; a backup frame is already constructed and waiting for you at the very bottom of the &6Ancient Temple&r."
	]
	quest.5C983A41886A2B75.title: "Home, Sweet Home!"
	quest.5CCF573B67317591.quest_desc: [
		"You'll run into plenty of &bGlowing Roots&r while exploring the lush &bBlooming Caverns&r."
		""
		"Don't try using them as ladders because they cannot be climbed, and don't bother harvesting them for dinner since they don't drop any food."
		""
		"They seem to be purely decorative blocks meant to add some nice ambience to the caves."
	]
	quest.5CCF573B67317591.title: "&bGlowing Roots"
	quest.5CD0E6F349F2F32D.quest_desc: [
		"The towering Edelwood stands as a mature, mystical timber rather than a hostile apparition."
		""
		"The peak of the tree structures a single Carved Edelwood Log, encircled by fragile branches that drop useful Edelwood Sticks when fractured."
		""
		"The internal core of these logs is entirely hollow, mirroring the capacity parameters of a standard iron cauldron."
		""
		"Remarkably, this botanical trunk operates with full fluid-holding properties, allowing it to contain open Water exactly like an iron cauldron block."
	]
	quest.5CFBA24B3E0CDEDD.quest_desc: [
		"While holding your open spellbook, press the C key to open the central spell creation menu."
		""
		"Every magical formula requires a physical shape, and you begin with three basic forms: Projectile, Self-cast, and Touch."
		""
		"The added Effect dictates exactly what transpires upon casting, and a single spell can handle up to 9 combined effects."
		""
		"Your initial options include Harm and Break."
		""
		"Simply select one form and one effect, give your custom spell a unique name, and press create to finalize the pattern."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/spellbook.png width:200 height:150 align:1}"
	]
	quest.5CFBA24B3E0CDEDD.title: "Creating the First Spell"
	quest.5D25320263050D50.quest_desc: [
		"The advanced upgrade offers 16 filter slots and supports filtering by item, mod, tag, NBT data, and damage values."
		""
		"Additionally, it can be configured to only allow transfer of items that already exist in the backpack, using its current contents as an additional filter."
	]
	quest.5D2C1AC617606541.quest_desc: [
		"The automated version automatically pulls in fuel and items to smelt, and pushes finished items back into the backpack."
		""
		"Includes filters for both fuel and smeltable items."
		""
		"Smoking and Blasting upgrades behave similarly but operate at double the base speed and only accept items valid for vanilla smokers or blast furnaces."
	]
	quest.5D32EE9D036721E2.quest_desc: ["A basic tier upgrade unlocks redstone control and improves the speed at which items are transfered."]
	quest.5D4BC85483CE28B4.quest_desc: ["Obtain 1000 Nether Stars (you will probably need a farm for this)"]
	quest.5D4BC85483CE28B4.title: "Celestial Farmer"
	quest.5D5C73EE97599674.quest_desc: [
		"To dictate exactly which extra-dimensional entity you pull across the veil, you must craft a designated &bBook of Binding&r tailored to that tier of spirit."
		""
		"The process requires casting standard black dye into the cleansing flames of a &dSpiritfire&r matrix to yield Purified Ink. Using this specialized pigment, you can construct your first Book of Binding to securely shackle a lesser &aFoliot&r class entity to your bidding."
		""
		"Alternatively, you may craft an Empty Book of Binding. This blank ledger serves as a generic template that can be dyed at a later date to match whatever ritual tier your factory demands."
		""
		"To finalize the attunement, ensure you have your target entity's specific page material ready. Fulfilling the ritual without a properly matching ledger will cause the summoning matrix to destabilize, wasting your hard-earned chalk charges and sacrificial materials."
	]
	quest.5D5C73EE97599674.title: "&bBooks of &dBinding"
	quest.5DDF74E99C83CE60.quest_desc: [
		"Weaponizing your access to &cIesnium&r unlocks the pinnacle of automated resource generation. By establishing a direct link to the spatial pockets of the Otherworld, you can legally shackle a dedicated workforce to a lifetime of subterranean labor on your behalf."
		""
		"To initialize this extraction line, you must construct a &dDimensional Mineshaft&r terminal. This apparatus acts as a doorway to raw mineral deposits. To power the system, you must trap a specialized Mining Demon inside a soul lamp and insert the vessel directly into the terminal's input matrix. While any tier of mining spirit will validate this quest, scaling up to advanced, higher-tier entities will drastically increase mining speeds and heavily multiply the drop rates of rare ores like Iesnium."
		""
		"Note that the mineshaft terminal features a primitive logistical interface and lacks any internal auto-export capabilities. You must manually extract the incoming ore yields using baseline hoppers, specialized logistics piping, or dedicated Transporting Demons. Ensure your extraction pipelines possess high throughput; if the internal buffer storage fills to capacity, the terminal will instantly void any incoming materials over the limit."
	]
	quest.5DDF74E99C83CE60.quest_subtitle: "Constructing automated resource mining nodes across the spatial veil."
	quest.5DDF74E99C83CE60.title: "Sub-Planar Extraction: &dDimensional Mineshafts&r"
	quest.5E287410EE969244.quest_desc: [
		"You'll run into the dangerous &9Shattered&r monsters spawning in several different biomes across the &3&lOtherside&r."
		""
		"Think of them like mini &9&lWardens&r—they are totally blind and rely on sculk vibrations to track your position in the dark."
		""
		"They absolutely hate outsiders and will instantly attack any animal or monster that isn't a native sculk creature."
		""
		"These beasts are incredibly tough with a health bar of 50 &4Hearts&r and they hit like a truck, so try your best not to pull a whole crowd of them at once."
		""
		"If you manage to take them down, make sure to collect the &9Sculk Bones&r they drop, since you'll need them for important crafting recipes down the road."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/dnd_shattered.png width:100 height:150 align:center}"
	]
	quest.5E287410EE969244.title: "&9Shattered"
	quest.5E750DB2244A67A1.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Turnout track&r is the first from hitting a &6track&r with a Spike Maul. "
		""
		"It can help go two directions, forward and to a side."
		""
		"It can be switched with a Switch next to the &6track&r."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/rail_turnout.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.5E750DB2244A67A1.title: "Turnout Tracks"
	quest.5E7E3946E56B2338.quest_desc: ["Modify how many items can fit in a single slot of the backpack’s inventory by 1.5x"]
	quest.5ED0DA95BAE43D88.quest_desc: [
		"The final jewel of your forge works manifests as the divine &dSoul Crystal&r, an artifact requiring the rarest alchemical components to construct."
		""
		"To begin the ritual, you must retrieve the ancient &eDivine Pact&r Relic hidden away within the ruins of the hazardous &b&lThe Other&r dimension."
		""
		"You must then line the peripheral pedestals with sharp &3Enderpearl Fragments&r, glowing &5Amethyst&r, and crystalline Nether Quartz."
		""
		"The true mastery comes from offering every class of spirit; to secure a rare &dEnchanted Soul&r, you must track down a floating Lost Soul in the overworld and strike it with a custom &bSplash Potion of Aureal&r."
		""
		"This transmutative bath morphs the spirit into a radiant &dLost Enchanted Soul&r, which you must quickly strike down to claim its essence."
		""
		"Fusing the completed crystal onto your custom weapons, tools, or heavy armor imbues them with the permanent Soulbound modifier, guaranteeing you respawn with these artifacts safely in your hands upon facing an untimely demise."
	]
	quest.5ED0DA95BAE43D88.title: "&dSoul Binding Crystal"
	quest.5ED35874D59A7595.quest_desc: [
		"Neutralizing the threat summoned via &4Tibira's Attraction&r allows you to harvest the ultimate tier of colored runic materials. Securing the &9Marid Essence&r dropped from the remains of that entity provides the exact sub-spatial catalyst required for your final chalk upgrades."
		""
		"Take this volatile essence directly to your crafting grid and bond it with your remaining base chalk stocks. The elemental core will permanently realign the medium, allowing you to finalize the manufacture of your Blue Chalk modifiers. This completes the full spectrum of available colored inks, granting your facility the precise programmatic tools needed to layout the most advanced automated factory pentacles in the pack."
	]
	quest.5ED35874D59A7595.quest_subtitle: "Refining premier elemental remnants into top-tier runic modifiers."
	quest.5ED35874D59A7595.title: "High Density Distillation: Blue Chalk"
	quest.5F00A66CC1FE1F9F.quest_desc: [
		"Forging the elusive &dWhirlwind Prism&r presents a highly irregular challenge, as its formula relies heavily upon a rare Bat Wing."
		""
		"Unless an artisan dedicates long hours to tracking these fleeting creatures in the dark caverns, gathering such components proves to be an incredibly tedious task."
		""
		"Unlike its elemental counterparts, this newly discovered crystal cannot be bound to your armor pieces to grant wind-walking properties."
		""
		"Instead, its volatile energy matrix is reserved entirely as a high-tier ingredient required to achieve your absolute end-game fabrications."
	]
	quest.5F00A66CC1FE1F9F.title: "&dWhirlwind Prism"
	quest.5F1A399DAA93D502.quest_desc: ["Craft Redstone Ender Chest by surrounding a vanilla Ender Chest with 4 Redstone Blocks and 4 redstone dust in an alternating pattern for reinforced void storage."]
	quest.5F5DB67F6A470C73.quest_subtitle: "Hire 30 Guards"
	quest.5F94E5FA894D4399.quest_desc: ["Wood Construction Sticks allow you to place up to 3 blocks at once."]
	quest.60721C9B94B36C24.quest_desc: [
		"You'll spot long, creepy &3Sculk Centipedes&r slithering around the biomes of the &3&lOtherside&r."
		""
		"They are completely neutral creatures with a health bar of 10 &4Hearts&r, meaning they won't bother you if you leave them alone."
		""
		"However, if you attack one, the whole pack will instantly swarm and bite you just like angry wolves."
		""
		"Since their only loot drops are basic &aXP&r and a bit of string, your best bet on the trail is to just walk right past them."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/dnd_centipede.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.60721C9B94B36C24.title: "&3Sculk Centipede"
	quest.609CA1ACFA981BD5.quest_desc: ["The &cRouting Kit&r is used with the passing tickets."]
	quest.60B3410462A54524.quest_desc: ["Forge full Traveller's Gear set + Knightmetal Sword."]
	quest.60B3410462A54524.title: "Traveller's Legacy"
	quest.6109E40208626079.quest_desc: ["Collect Moonworm Queen eggs"]
	quest.6109E40208626079.title: "Moonworm Charm"
	quest.61C93ABE07742DCD.quest_desc: [
		"The Steam Turbine uses Steam to make FE and EU energy."
		""
		"It's 3x2x2 building of only Steam Turbine Housing, and it'll need a Turbine Motor in it, and Steam piped in."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/rail_turbine.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.61D5C7113AF6D13E.quest_desc: [
		"Spice of Life: Carrot Edition encourages players to eat many different kinds of food by rewarding them for trying new things. Each time you reach a goal for eating new foods, you gain extra hearts that permanently increase your maximum health."
		""
		"The Food Book shows which foods you have already eaten and helps you track your progress toward earning your next extra heart."
	]
	quest.61D5C7113AF6D13E.quest_subtitle: "Craft the Food Book"
	quest.61EA7922CACC06C8.quest_desc: ["Moves fluids at a faster rate. "]
	quest.6252AF176FC134E9.quest_desc: ["&aSpeed Upgrades&r can be used in most &6PNCR&r machines to make them work faster at the cost of using more pressure."]
	quest.62F5DBBB59E8B336.quest_desc: [
		"Allows routers to move more than one item at a time. Each Stack Upgrade increases the number of items transferred per operation. "
		""
		"1 stack upgrade = 2 items."
		"2 stack upgrades = 4 Items. "
		"6 stack upgrades = 64 Items a second."
	]
	quest.632BC46928CC9A8C.quest_desc: [
		"The mystical &9Enchanter's Mirror&r functions as a specialized utility tool that instantly channels a bound Self Spell directly onto the user."
		""
		"Any magical enchantment cast through this glass requires significantly less mana to execute and receives a flat bonus to its active duration."
		""
		"To permanently etch a magical formula onto its face, you must utilize the Scribe's Table."
		""
		"When compiling this specific mirror enchantment, simply select your target effects inside your book while omitting any delivery forms entirely."
	]
	quest.633FA983B63A65DD.quest_desc: ["By applying an &bExpansion Module&r to a &dGauge Controller&r, you'll expand its functionalities, allowing you to precisely control its &cRedstone&r behavior."]
	quest.633FA983B63A65DD.title: "Expanded Capabilities!?"
	quest.6346B63845C71094.quest_desc: [
		"Storage Racks is the ultimate solution for organizing your Minecraft storage needs! With this powerful and easy-to-use mod, you'll be able to craft a series of racks with variable inventory sizes, allowing you to keep all of your items neatly organized and easily accessible."
		""
		"But that's not all! Storage Racks also comes with a controller that lets you quickly locate and manage items in your racks. No more searching through cluttered chests or struggling to remember where you put your items – Storage Racks makes it easy to find everything you need, exactly when you need it."
		""
		"Plus, &6each rack can be upgraded simply by left-clicking with the next material&r – from stone to diamond"
	]
	quest.634EB57D561D4525.quest_desc: ["Craft the Pipe Connector (JEI/REI). Hold in main hand + pipe in off-hand. Shift+RMB blocks to set route/depth (wheel). Shift+RMB air: place/reset."]
	quest.63C95FDAA447CA47.quest_desc: [
		"The exclusive blueprint requiring the advanced power of your &3&lTier 2&r foundry is the heavy &7Terrastomp Prism&r."
		""
		"Forging this earthen artifact requires you to gather two pieces of pointed &7Dripstone&r, a chunk of common &8Flint&r, and a solid &bDiamond Block&r as the primary offering."
		""
		"As with all lesser prisms, you must ensure the rare &3Elementarium&r Relic is securely slotted into the forge's core to complete the circuit."
		""
		"Mirroring the destructive capabilities of the &cFiery Prism&r, fusing the completed &7Terrastomp Prism&r onto your heavy tools grants them the power to shatter stone in a massive 3x3 area, excavating nine full blocks in the time it takes to break one."
	]
	quest.63DD7F5A4441ACE7.title: "&9Mage&r Glyphs"
	quest.63F4411C8805238E.quest_desc: ["Moves fluids (water, lava, mod liquids) from tanks or sources to other tanks or machines."]
	quest.6428F17B7E4873A6.quest_desc: [
		"&cHeat&r disperses to adjacent blocks, including air, and is a mechanic unique to &6PNCR&r"
		""
		"If certain &cHeat&r sources disperse entirely, they can convert to a different block. An example of this would be using lava to heat a machine and it eventually cooling to obsidian."
		""
		"You can prevent &cHeat&r from dissipating in the air by making sure each side of the block is covered. &bThermal Lagging&r works well for this!"
		""
		""
		"Some operations are &bEndothermic&r (uses &cHeat&r) while others might be &cExothermic&r (produces &cHeat&r). This will depend on the machine and recipe, so be sure to check JEI and plan accordingly!"
		""
		"Certain machines can also share &cHeat&r, meaning it is often useful to put machines that require similar temperatures next to each other."
		""
		"You can install &bDispenser Upgrades&r to pipe between them as well!"
	]
	quest.6428F17B7E4873A6.title: "Thermodynamics"
	quest.64A6C2A397051CFA.quest_desc: [
		"The gateway to this mod begins with the &9Summoning Ritual&r. These dark ceremonies allow you to pull helpful extra-dimensional entities across the veil, securing loyal thralls to automate your resource crushing, smelting, and advanced processing as your power grows."
		""
		"Your initial target is a &aFoliot Crusher&r. This lesser spirit will serve as your automated ore pulverizer, generating the specific crushed dusts required to forge higher-tier ritual chalks."
		""
		"To begin, drop your Unbound Book and your &aDictionary of Spirits&r into any crafting grid. This process binds a native entity to the pages, preparing the vessel required for the upcoming ritual."
		""
		"Next, consult your &aDictionary of Spirits&r directly. Navigate to the &dPentacles&r tab on the left sidebar and select the blueprint for &bAviar's Circle&r. If the schematic is hidden, browse through the introductory lore pages or click \"Mark All As Read\" to instantly unlock the full catalog of blueprints."
		""
		"This specific geometric pattern is the key to summoning your new minion. While viewing the blueprint, click the eye icon in the bottom-left corner of the page to project a holographic overlay directly into the world, guiding your block placement."
		""
		"After constructing the foundation, place at least 4 Sacrificial Bowls anywhere within an 8-block horizontal radius of your central Golden Sacrificial Bowl. Deposit the required catalysts into the standard bowls, then right-click the central Golden Bowl with your Bound Book to ignite the summoning circle."
		""
		"This is what it should look like before you acttually start the ritual."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/aviarcircle.png width:200 height:200 align:center}"
	]
	quest.64A6C2A397051CFA.quest_subtitle: "Aviar's Circle"
	quest.64A6C2A397051CFA.title: "&bFirst &dRitual"
	quest.64C105E1E2F97900.quest_desc: ["The Spike Mauls are used on normal &6Tracks&r to switch their modes. Very helpful for trying to make intersections!"]
	quest.64C105E1E2F97900.title: "Smart Switch"
	quest.64D0E66CB4FBEC82.quest_desc: [
		"To get your foot in the door with magic, you'll need to craft a &6Novice Spellbook&r."
		""
		"This is your personal journal for creating and storing every spell you learn."
		""
		"Hitting the &9C&r key opens up the creation screen, where you'll find three main tabs: Spell Creation, Color Picker, and Familiars."
		""
		"Just remember that this entry-tier book only lets you cast basic Tier 1 Glyphs."
		""
		"If you want to use more powerful magic on the trail, you'll have to upgrade the book itself!\""
	]
	quest.64D0E66CB4FBEC82.quest_subtitle: "First Spellbook"
	quest.65036FC8BB655257.quest_desc: [
		"Automatically swaps the correct tool or weapon into the player’s hand when mining or attacking with the wrong one."
		""
		"The regular upgrade handles swapping when clicking a block or entity, as long as a different tool or weapon is held"
	]
	quest.65D23E7683812E26.quest_desc: [
		"What kind of a leader are you?! Your citizens are so hungry, they are eating rotten flesh! &eAre you eating rotten flesh?&r Can you spare some bread or apples for the colony? "
		""
		"It is strongly suggested that you build a restaurant and any of the 5 herding huts or a fisher’s hut. If you have those buildings already, check that buildings have the resources they need to work."
	]
	quest.65D23E7683812E26.quest_subtitle: "Slum Lord"
	quest.65D8F774F3FA800B.quest_desc: ["Place a gold Ingot in the middle then add 3 diamond above and below with a glass block both to the left and the right side for 4x+ speed \\& max efficiency."]
	quest.66520328281EE299.quest_desc: ["Craft Naga Scale Tunic Leggings – sturdy protection start."]
	quest.66520328281EE299.title: "Scale Leggings Forged"
	quest.66A44DFBF6163B81.quest_desc: ["Modular Routers is a compact, powerful logistics mod focused on precise item control. Using configurable routers and modules, you can push, pull, filter, distribute, craft, and interact with inventories or the world with minimal setup. Highly flexible and scalable, it replaces bulky transport systems with clean, efficient automation."]
	quest.66FE4552E09B5EFF.quest_desc: [
		"Stockpiling various prisms is absolutely vital if you want to master &6&lForbidden \\& Arcanus&r and survive the heavy endgame mods waiting down the road."
		""
		"Before you can cook any of them up at your forge, you need to track down a rare &3Elementarium&r Relic to anchor the magic."
		""
		"Thankfully, this relic isn't locked to just one single zone; you can find it by exploring hidden Jungle Temples, looting sandy Desert Pyramids, or diving deep into sunken Underwater Ruins."
		""
		"Honestly, with so many different dungeons packing it into their treasure chests, it would probably be way easier to list the places where you can't find it!"
	]
	quest.66FE4552E09B5EFF.title: "&3Elementarium"
	quest.670A52F1036507BB.quest_desc: [
		"&bAir pressure&r, measured in &bBar&r, is what powers most &6PCNR&r machines."
		""
		"The higher the &bBar&r, the higher the pressure. It moves from high-pressure areas to low-pressure areas and will try to equalize throughout the system."
		""
		"If air pressure in a machine or tube is higher than it can support, the &cmachine will explode&r!"
		""
		""
		"&6PNCR&r machines and tools all have a specific volume, measured in &bml&r that represents how much air they hold at 0 &bBar&r. This can be increased with volume upgrades."
		""
		"Machines use compressed air to operate, which constantly lowers the pressure in the system as they consume it."
	]
	quest.670A52F1036507BB.title: "School of Pressure"
	quest.677C5D35DADA4A42.quest_desc: [
		"&cThe Coupler&r is for connecting or disconnecting &7Carts&r. Coupling is the phrase for connecting &7Carts&r."
		""
		"It can be configured with a &4Crowbar&r to couple, decouple, or auto couple."
		""
		"Needs Redstone to work."
	]
	quest.679E6FA2A9405716.quest_desc: ["Forge Naga Scale Tunic Chestplate."]
	quest.679E6FA2A9405716.title: "Scale Chestplate"
	quest.67AFCBCE7AAC3089.quest_desc: [
		"To get a Turbine spinning, we'll need these &crequired&r components:"
		""
		"- &9Rotor Bearings&r are placed at one end of the shaft of the turbine. This can be on any face, but dictates where the shaft extrude from. This is typically placed in the center of the bottom face."
		""
		"- &eRotor Shafts&r extend from one Rotor Bearing to the opposite side of the turbine, all the way to a single Turbine Housing block, creating the shaft for the Turbine."
		""
		"- &9Rotor Blades&r make the rotor spin. These are placed onto the Rotor Shafts and can be multiple blocks in length. Each Blade can handle a certain amount of vapor, and determines how many are needed based on your reactor's production rates."
		""
		"Here is an example of a Vertical Shaft setup for a Turbine, with the Turbine Coil of Lead on the top."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/maxbasicturbine.png width:150 height:150 align:center}"
	]
	quest.67AFCBCE7AAC3089.title: "Turbine Shaft"
	quest.67CCEFEBA4D79429.quest_desc: [
		"I won't sugarcoat it—the &eDivine Pact&r is easily the hardest relic you will ever have to hunt down in your entire journey!"
		""
		"If you want to find one, you'll need to gear up for a dangerous expedition into &b&lThe Other&r dimension to raid hostile Piglin Villages and clear out ancient pyramids."
		""
		"Make sure you don't lose it, because this artifact is completely essential for crafting the Soul Binding Crystal and constructing your absolute end-game multiblock machines."
	]
	quest.67CCEFEBA4D79429.title: "&eDivine Pact"
	quest.67D38E8A57949B34.quest_desc: [
		"Watch your footing for &3Sculk Jaws&r while exploring the pitch-black tunnels of the &9Deeplands&r."
		""
		"If you accidentally walk over one of these hidden traps, it will bite your legs, pulling you down into the floor and dealing painful damage while you are stuck."
		""
		"If you want to safely dig them up to bring home and use as a base defense, make sure to pop them with a Silk Touch tool."
	]
	quest.67D38E8A57949B34.title: "&3Sculk Jaw"
	quest.67DECDA4EC04E191.quest_desc: ["Allows the Router to store and use energy. Required for modules that consume power, and increases the Router’s internal energy capacity so it can support more demanding operations."]
	quest.67E8B8DCFC93F832.quest_desc: ["The warehouse is completed. It might not seem like much, but you can't have much of a trade empire without a place to store things. "]
	quest.67E8B8DCFC93F832.quest_subtitle: "Build a warehouse"
	quest.681FB9758B02412D.quest_desc: [
		"Utilizing &dSpiritfire&r allows you to bypass manual exploration by directly transmuting mundane overworld resources into their ethereal counterparts. While you can harvest these items naturally in the wild under the sensory influence of the &bThird Eye&r, utilizing the flame matrix provides a much more direct, automatable path for your early logistics."
		""
		"Tossing standard &bAndesite&r into the flames converts it into &3Otherstone&r, an inorganic material that serves as a permanent, non-consuming hearth block when ignited with &dSpiritfire&r."
		""
		"Casting an &aOak Sapling&r into the matrix yields an Otherworld variant. Once planted and matured, this tree appears identical to standard oak to the untrained eye. However, breaking its bark while under the active status effects of the &bThird Eye&r allows you to harvest its true form."
		""
		"&o(Note: If the harvested wood accidentally reverts to standard oak logs, a known physical limitation requires you to harvest the tree's canopy from the top downward to secure the drop.)&r"
		""
		"Finally, dropping pristine &eDiamonds&r into the pyre converts them into &dSpirit Attuned Gems&r, a vital structural component for almost every advanced mechanism and ritual foundation in your upcoming progression."
	]
	quest.681FB9758B02412D.title: "Holy &dSpiritfire&r Batman!"
	quest.68446510A1B0D9B8.quest_desc: [
		"The &bBlooming Caverns&r function very similarly to Overworld Lush Caves due to an incredible overgrowth of green plant life."
		""
		"You will encounter vegetation stretching across every surface—growing downwards from the ceilings, climbing upwards from the floors, sprouting directly out of the &9Water&r, and some dried varieties that do not grow at all."
		""
		"The subterranean landscape is composed of unique &bBlooming Sculk Stone&r and soft patches of &bBlooming Moss&r."
		""
		"Travelers should note that this biome contains active water ponds, serving as the absolute only source of open &9Water&r anywhere in this entire &3&lDimension&r."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/dnd_cave.png width:200 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.68446510A1B0D9B8.title: "&bBlooming Caverns"
	quest.68500900087F92BC.quest_subtitle: "Teach a Carpenter to Craft a Door"
	quest.686562213BFC07CE.quest_desc: ["Harvest Meef Stroganoff from Minoshroom boss."]
	quest.686562213BFC07CE.title: "Minoshroom Stew"
	quest.6892E93B8F68471B.quest_desc: [
		"Synchronizes Router operation across multiple routers. This helps ensure they all act together in a predictable order, which can be important for precise or timing-sensitive automation setups. "
		""
		"You will need to tune the module in the GUI."
	]
	quest.6898798869C573DD.quest_desc: [
		"Terminating the hostile Goat of Mercy materialized from the containment field of &9Xeovrenth Adjure&r allows your facility to harvest a critical late-game catalyst. Securing the Cruelty Essence dropped from the remains of this entity provides the dense, volatile spiritual profile necessary to stabilize your final chalk upgrades."
		""
		"Take this concentrated essence straight to a standard crafting grid and combine it with raw Cocoa Beans. The organic plant matter will bind and temper the intense energy of the essence, permanently altering the compound to finalize the synthesis of your Brown Chalk modifiers. This locks in one of the final required keys needed to program your absolute highest tiers of automated multi-block factories."
	]
	quest.6898798869C573DD.quest_subtitle: "Processing concentrated vital essences into high-tier runic modifiers."
	quest.6898798869C573DD.title: "Abyssal Refining: Brown Chalk"
	quest.68ADD40682D1C36A.quest_desc: ["The Simple Compacting Drawer is a streamlined version of the standard compacting drawer. It features only two slots, automatically converting between item forms while keeping things simple and space-efficient."]
	quest.68FC81E133443E76.quest_desc: [
		"The Library is a way for you to raise your adult citizens’ Intelligence skill, which influences skill increases once employed. A citizen will randomly level up their Intelligence as long as they’re assigned to the Library. Paper and books help Library Students increase their skills faster."
		""
		"Being a Library Student is a full-time job, and a student cannot be employed simultaneously at any other hut."
		""
		"Tip: Consider setting the hiring mode to automatic so new recruits or kids growing up will start school automatically."
	]
	quest.68FC81E133443E76.quest_subtitle: "Build a Library"
	quest.691DA056FD253A19.quest_desc: [
		"Just as the red chalk is made from the essence of Afrit, the blue chalk is made from the essence of Marid, allowing for control over these powerful spirits."
		""
		"The purpose of the blue chalk is to overcome the willpower of a Marid; its sometimes excessive use serves as a guarantee that any Marid will be controlled. Should the control fail, it would generate extreme fury in the invoked Marid."
		""
		"To obtain the essence for blue chalk you need to summon and kill an Unbound Marid"
	]
	quest.691DA056FD253A19.quest_subtitle: "The Chalk of The Seven Seas"
	quest.692183ACBB2AABF7.quest_desc: [
		"The ancient Relics stand as rare and legendary treasures scattered across the vast expanses of your &2&lMinecraft&r world."
		""
		"When brought back to your workshop, they can be slotted directly into the square inventory spaces surrounding the center core of your &6&lForge&r—focal nodes that systematically open as you elevate the structural tiers of the machine."
		""
		"Alternatively, an artisan can embed these artifacts inside the &l&bClibano&r refinery to unlock specialized metallurgy techniques."
		""
		"While a select few of these artifacts are strictly bound to Creative Mode parameters, rest assured that we recognize your deep desire for overwhelmingly powerful gear and are actively researching alternative methods to introduce them into your survival registries."
	]
	quest.692183ACBB2AABF7.title: "&lRelics"
	quest.695FD90CD9916ABE.quest_desc: [
		"Works with the Tank Upgrade to store player experience as a fluid in the backpack."
		""
		"Can be set to drain experience from the player above a certain level, push experience to the player below a certain level, or keep the player at a specific level by balancing both directions."
		""
		"Supports storing or retrieving all experience, or a specific number of levels (configurable in the GUI)."
		""
		"Includes an option to automatically repair equipped items with the Mending enchantment, including those in Curios slots."
	]
	quest.69642A3618E86DED.quest_desc: [
		"To build the frame for the &aReprocessor&r, you'll need a lot of Casings. This also means a lot of Cyanite."
		""
		"Start by building a hollow 3 block wide, 3 block deep, and 7 block tall structure. This is the frame."
		""
		"If done right, you'll have an empty spot in the middle of the bottom and top face. "
		""
		"For the vertical faces, you can either use &aReprocessor Glass&r or one of the required &aReprocessor&r parts like the Power Port, Controller, etc."
		""
		"If you'd like to see an image of what the frame will look like, check the images below!"
		""
		"The frame of the Reprocessor multiblock:"
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/reprocessorframe.png width:150 height:175 align:center}"
		""
		""
		"A fully built Reprocessor:"
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/reprocessorfull.png width:150 height:150 align:center}"
	]
	quest.69642A3618E86DED.title: "The Frame"
	quest.696BDC29ACCBBE29.quest_desc: ["Just make sure you have unlocked the research \"Raising the Dead\"..."]
	quest.696BDC29ACCBBE29.quest_subtitle: "Give the Undertaker a Totem"
	quest.69EAF1072D492F1A.quest_desc: [
		"The Ancient Tome is a glowing book that’s dropped by raiders during raids. If you have the Ancient Tome in your inventory, it will glow when there is going to be a raid that night. "
		""
		"In the later game, the Enchanter can convert Ancient Tomes into enchanted books. "
	]
	quest.69EAF1072D492F1A.quest_subtitle: "Keep one in your hotbar"
	quest.6A1C0B17B22CE50F.quest_desc: [
		"Equipping the &9Amulet of Mana Boost&r is a fantastic shortcut to instantly expand your maximum mana pool for bigger spell combos."
		""
		"If you find yourself running out of fuel too quickly on the trail, swap over to the &6Amulet of Mana Regen&r to make your energy recharge much faster."
	]
	quest.6A60B76053393288.quest_desc: ["The Smeltery is where the Smelter will smelt ores into ingots. The higher the level of the Smeltery, the more furnaces the Smelter will be able to use. A higher level will also have a higher chance to double and even triple the ingot output per block of ore."]
	quest.6A60B76053393288.quest_subtitle: "Builder a Smelter"
	quest.6ACEE5710A6F27DD.quest_desc: ["Transports energy (FE/RF) between generators, batteries, and machines."]
	quest.6ADDFD55AD0DF7D4.quest_desc: [
		"Combining &9Ridiculite Ingots&r with &cRossinite&r in a &aReprocessor&r will create &dInanite Ingots&r."
		""
		"We can now use these to make a block of &dInanite&r."
	]
	quest.6B0CE8AD86991E28.quest_desc: [
		"The Composter’s Hut is where the Composter will turn organic materials into compost, which can be used by the Farmer or Florist to fertilize crops or flowers. "
		""
		"Note: You must configure the composter’s hut with the items you want composted before the composter will compost. &7&oThis sounds similar to a woodchuck tongue twister.&r"
	]
	quest.6B0CE8AD86991E28.quest_subtitle: "Build a Composter Hut"
	quest.6B26495A9E7D77FC.quest_desc: ["Here's a bed, you will probably need more."]
	quest.6B26495A9E7D77FC.quest_subtitle: "Have a Baby"
	quest.6B511C8B572E8940.quest_desc: [
		"A specialized status bar rests permanently at the bottom left of your screen, representing your active mana pool."
		""
		"As your magical capabilities grow, you can deploy several different methodologies to expand this energy reservoir or optimize the casting efficiency of your custom spells."
		""
		"Furthermore, systematically upgrading the binding tier of your central spellbook provides an immediate flat increase to your maximum mana limits."
	]
	quest.6B511C8B572E8940.quest_subtitle: "Mage Power"
	quest.6B511C8B572E8940.title: "Mana"
	quest.6B80B2314CC47FD6.quest_desc: ["A level 3 smeltery applies Fortune II when smelting ores! "]
	quest.6B80B2314CC47FD6.quest_subtitle: "Fortune II"
	quest.6BA2BC09E23B34A9.quest_desc: [
		"To elevate your foundry past the third tier, you must prepare the heavy &d&lTier 4 &6Forge&r upgrade."
		""
		"This advanced design commands another block of &9Chiseled Polished Darkstone&r centered upon the anvil, reinforced by four ancient &7Runes&r and four unstable &2Stellarite&r Pieces resting upon the surrounding pillars."
		""
		"Striking this arrangement with a ritual gavel transforms the block, granting you access to an expanded library of blueprints."
		""
		"While it unlocks extensive technical capabilities and opens up every single remaining Relic slot within the core interface, remember that a master artisan must eventually push past this tier to reach the true apex of craftsmanship."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/forbidden_tier4.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.6BA2BC09E23B34A9.title: "&l&dTier 4 &6Forge"
	quest.6BB0C51EE8CA5966.quest_desc: [
		"At the Mine, the Miner will mine for ores and materials. Once they are hired, the Miner will first create a shaft downward to a specific depth depending on the level of the Mine. Once the main shaft is completed, the Miner will then branch out. While mining, sometimes the Miner will get lucky and get an ore block instead of a basic stone block. &7&o(magic!)&r&r"
		""
		"Tip: The miner fills holes and gaps with a Fill Block, cobblestone by default. However, the fill block can be changed in the Miner’s Hut settings. If you have a forester and lots of wood, consider using wood planks. Or perhaps now you will have a use for all that deepslate."
	]
	quest.6BB0C51EE8CA5966.quest_subtitle: "Build a Mine"
	quest.6BB948F44B0950E8.quest_desc: [
		"You will find &3Sculk Stone&r making up the walls and floors of almost every single biome here, except for the burning &cOvercast Columns&r."
		""
		"For all your building needs, it behaves exactly like the regular &7Stone&r back in the Overworld."
		""
		"You can easily cook its cobbled version in a furnace to get smooth &3Sculk Stone&r, which unlocks a ton of cool new building blocks."
		""
		"The only real downside is that you can't use it to craft stone tools."
		""
		"But honestly, what do you care? You literally defeated the terrifying &9&lWarden&r just to get here, so you definitely don't need primitive stone gear anymore!"
	]
	quest.6BB948F44B0950E8.title: "&3Sculk Stone"
	quest.6BE7780A1A08FD53.quest_desc: ["Witches drop Glowstone Dust (~5-11%). Spawn in dark/swamps at night."]
	quest.6BF785E259C7B4BF.quest_desc: ["Surround Iron Ingot with 7 Gold Ingots and a Gold Block for 2x vanilla speed."]
	quest.6BF785E259C7B4BF.title: "Gold Furnace Upgrade"
	quest.6C14D1B60124C2B2.quest_desc: [
		"The &9Tunnel Bore&r is perfect for automatically placing &6Rails&r especially under mountains or hills. "
		""
		"It'll need 3 things to start working: &9Bore Head&r, fuel like Coal, and &6Rails&r. "
		""
		"Once it has all 3 just let it go! "
		""
		"Remember to keep track of the items going in it!"
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/rail_tunnel.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.6C163E005351FF6D.quest_desc: ["The &cWhistle Kit&r when active with Redstone will cause the &1Locomotives&r to set off their whistles."]
	quest.6C231DB15B1D5DED.quest_desc: ["Craft Lapis Lazuli Ender Chest by surrounding a vanilla Ender Chest with 4 Lapis Lazuli Blocks and 4 lapis Lazuli in an alternating pattern for reinforced void storage."]
	quest.6C79ACEF648796B5.quest_desc: ["Simulates a right-click on a block or entity in front of the module. Can be used to activate machines, press buttons, use items, or interact with blocks automatically."]
	quest.6CA87B9E66E0FD66.quest_desc: ["Modify how many items can fit in a single slot of the backpack’s inventory by 8x"]
	quest.6CB1CA1FC2919828.quest_desc: [
		"Templates add special upgrades to your Construction Sticks. To apply a template, combine the stick, template, and an additional item in a Smithing Table."
		""
		"Angel: Place blocks behind the ones you're facing or in mid-air."
	]
	quest.6CD6367FB419EA35.quest_desc: [
		"The &aThermopneumatic Processing Plant&r is your next step for processing the liquids you've gathered from the &aRefinery&r."
		""
		"&bHeavy Fuels&r can be cracked into lighter ones, which means &aDiesel&r can be turned into &2Kerosene&r, which can then turn into &3Gasoline&r, and then further into &1LPG&r."
		""
		"This machine can also be used to produce &aLubricant&r!"
		""
		"Running either &1LPG&r or &aBiodiesel&r through one of these machines can make you &bMolten Plastic&r."
	]
	quest.6CD6367FB419EA35.title: "Plastique???"
	quest.6CEC319B90CFD87D.quest_desc: ["Craft Cinnamon Log (check JEI for recipe; craft-only abyssal wood for decor)."]
	quest.6D0CB111259EFE20.quest_desc: [
		"The light gray chalk uses mineral compounds to enhance the foundation of a pentacle."
		""
		"The foundation is an important property, often considered the stabilization of the \"core.\""
		""
		"Due to its relatively low cost and inherent magical properties, it is the most common foundation option among practitioners of occultism, capable of replacing white chalk in almost all pentacles."
	]
	quest.6D0CB111259EFE20.title: "Decent Foundation"
	quest.6D56AD1BEC644A10.quest_desc: [
		"The Archery is where your Archers in Training will train to become Archer. This also allows them to level up without a risk of dying to mobs. "
		""
		"The Archers in Training require a bow to practice. They will shoot at the practice targets, a target block"
		""
		"Tip: Consider setting the hiring mode to automatic so new recruits or kids growing up will automatically start training if not already attending school. "
	]
	quest.6D56AD1BEC644A10.quest_subtitle: "Build an Archery"
	quest.6D688246588CD865.quest_desc: ["\"Silence the skeleton band—claim their gear!\""]
	quest.6DAA82B5F94AF9F8.quest_desc: [
		"Activating the &9Jar of Light&r calls down a friendly, floating light source that follows you everywhere you walk."
		""
		"If your packs are getting full of junk, swap to the &6Jar of Voiding&r, which automatically destroys specified items as you pick them up and turns them into free mana."
		""
		"You can easily filter what it deletes by holding an item in your offhand and right-clicking the jar, or by putting the jar on a Scribe's Table and using the items on it."
		""
		"Just make sure the jar stays on your active hotbar, or it won't work at all!"
	]
	quest.6DB65926EE6D6C2E.quest_desc: [
		"These &cTracks Kits&r are for changing momentum with your &7Carts&r."
		""
		"The &cTransition Kits&r change the speed of the passing &1Locomotive&r, needs redstone power."
		""
		"The &cBooster Kits&r will speed up the &7Cart&r if powered and slow down the &7Cart&r if not powered."
		""
		"The &cControl Kit&r gives the &7Carts&r a little push, when powered it'll change the direction it pushes it in."
		""
		"The &cThrottle Kit&r will change the speed of a passing &1Locomotive&r to whatever speed is configured, needs to be powered with redstone."
		""
		"The &cLauncher Kit&r will quite literally throw your &7Cart&r!"
	]
	quest.6DB65926EE6D6C2E.title: "Moving Cart Track Kits"
	quest.6DB9E297C9248966.quest_desc: [
		"Acquiring &aLime Chalk&r opens the gateway to &5Possession Rituals&r. This discipline introduces a distinct mechanical departure from your previous setups: the matrix cannot draw energy solely from item catalysts and requires a living biological sacrifice to anchor the entity. Early configurations consume minor entities like chickens, bees, or bats, but advanced circles deep in the tech tree will scale up to require massive, high-health organisms."
		""
		"The initiation parameters for these ceremonies are strictly enforced. Even if you have perfectly dressed your peripheral bowls with the required item reagents and deposited your Book of Binding into the central Golden Sacrificial Bowl, the summoning matrix will remain completely inert. To spark the reaction, you must manually execute the captured target directly over the chalk runes."
		""
		"To facilitate this process, it is highly recommended to manufacture a dedicated biological containment unit—such as an Empty Soul Gem, Mob Imprisonment Tool, or Quantum Catcher—to effortlessly transport your sacrificial specimens into the center of your ritual room."
		""
		"The foundational circle for this tree is &eHeidryn's Lure&r, which is utilized primarily to manifest mundane commodities like baseline skeleton skulls and early-game End Stone. Because your factory logistics likely outpaced these low-tier items, you may bypass this initial schematic entirely and advance straight to constructing the second-tier matrix: &aIhagan's Enthrallment&r."
	]
	quest.6DB9E297C9248966.quest_subtitle: "Construction Organic catalysts and manual ignition criteria."
	quest.6DB9E297C9248966.title: "Lethal Anchors: &5Possession Rituals&r"
	quest.6E0E13806F388D7E.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to &aArs Nouveau&f!"
		""
		"Ars Nouveau is a magic mod that allows you to create custom spells with the different Glyphs made within the mod!"
	]
	quest.6E0E13806F388D7E.title: "Welcome to &aArs Nouveau&f!"
	quest.6E1D37CE683082B0.quest_desc: [
		"Transfers filtered items from the backpack into an inventory block in the world (such as chests, barrels, or other modded containers) when the block is shift-right-clicked with the backpack in hand."
		""
		"The regular upgrade filters by item and provides 9 filter slots."
	]
	quest.6E38CF6E7360E9CA.quest_desc: [
		"Slaying the &9&lWarden&r yields several valuable resources, but the &9Heart of the Deep&r remains your main priority."
		""
		"You must use this artifact on a frame of &8Reinforced Deepslate&r to activate the dimensional portal to the &3&lOtherside&r."
		""
		"Ensure that all blocks inside and directly around the portal frame are cleared away, or the gateway will fail to ignite."
		""
		"The beast also drops a sturdy &9Warden Carapace&r and rare &9Echo Shards&r, which are mandatory components for crafting high-tier gear and tools later on."
	]
	quest.6E38CF6E7360E9CA.title: "&9Heart of the Deep"
	quest.6E7C4228CD2B6BB9.quest_desc: [
		"This &4Crowbar&r has a few different modes, each with change the design of a &1Locomotive&r. "
		""
		"From default which is described while hovering over the item in your inventory:"
		""
		"--none which goes to &7grey&r"
		""
		"--&6Halloween&r which makes it spooky"
		""
		"--and &cChristmas&r which makes it festive!"
	]
	quest.6E901EF1CB411088.quest_desc: [
		"The legendary &9Warden Armor&r functions as the direct upgrade tier to &cNetherite&r equipment."
		""
		"Forging a piece requires a &9Warden Upgrade Template&r, a &9Reinforced Echo Shard&r, and your existing &cNetherite Armor&r at a smithing table."
		""
		"Every individual piece gains a bonus armor point and extra armor protection over the old gear."
		""
		"However, the dense alloy completely removes your default knockback resistance statistics. "
		""
		"Visually, this set presents a far more imposing aesthetic than dark steel."
		""
		"The heavy &9Helmet&r sprouts massive horns matching the &9&lWarden&r's crest, while the thick &9Chestplate&r features an illuminated central heart core."
	]
	quest.6E901EF1CB411088.title: "&9Warden&r Armor"
	quest.6E9D60D12235336F.quest_desc: [
		"A simple oak sapling, when offered to the Spirit Fire, is transformed into an Otherworld Oak Sapling, bound to a realm unseen."
		""
		"When planted and allowed to grow, the tree appears ordinary to unawakened eyes. Only those who bear the Third Eye can perceive its true nature, shimmering just beyond the veil."
		""
		"Felling this tree while under the gaze of the Third Eye yields Otherworld Logs, materials infused with Otherworldly essence and used in both crafting and ritual work."
		""
		"When these logs are cast once more into the Spirit Fire, they are reduced to Otherworld Ashes—a vital ingredient in the creation of White Chalk, and a cornerstone of early occult practices."
	]
	quest.6E9D60D12235336F.title: "Otherworld Wood"
	quest.6EDD2B5D733C265F.quest_desc: ["The Compacting Drawer stores an item in multiple forms at once, automatically converting between blocks, ingots, nuggets, or similar variants. This makes it easy to manage compressed resources while saving valuable storage space."]
	quest.6EEA012FA11C7C08.quest_desc: ["Once you have found the location for your colony, you will likely want to build either a supply camp or supply ship. You can choose one but not both. Either will provide you with some basic supplies to help you get started in the early game. &o&7(bed, food, basic tools and armor, starting resources, etc.)&r&r It’s beneficial to place your supply camp or ship near your colony as you will be traveling back and forth to it frequently in the early game. &eClose, but not in the way close.&r"]
	quest.6EEA012FA11C7C08.title: "Get Supplies"
	quest.6F3602F5600A6221.title: "&6Archmage&r Glyphs"
	quest.6F57BE412A7BE84E.quest_desc: [
		"You'll use &9Corrupt Souls&r for two specific jobs on the trail."
		""
		"The first is a high-level crafting recipe inside the advanced &l&dTier 4 &6Forge&r, but you don't need to stress about that setup just yet."
		""
		"The second job is growing your own magical wood."
		""
		"Using these souls on a Growing Edelwood block acts as your custom sapling method, standing as the absolute only way to get fresh Edelwood trees now."
	]
	quest.6F57BE412A7BE84E.title: "&9Corrupt Souls"
	quest.6FB55C9728C10AB4.quest_desc: ["Obtain a vanilla Ender Chest (8 Obsidian + Eye of Ender). Craft Copper Ender Chest by surrounding it with 8 Copper Blocks for +1 row of storage."]
	quest.6FB55C9728C10AB4.title: "Copper Vault Start"
	quest.6FF8291A3D5763F2.quest_desc: [
		"Upon processing your first yields of &aRaw Iesnium Ore&r, prioritizing your refined ingots toward fabricating an &dIesnium Pickaxe&r is highly advantageous."
		""
		"This advanced mining instrument matches the exact dimensional frequency of your previous Infused Pickaxe, allowing it to easily shatter dense otherworldly minerals like Iesnium ore veins. However, this metallic alloy possesses a significantly superior crystalline structure, meaning it offers a massive upgrade to maximum durability."
		""
		"Upgrading your mining gear to this tier drastically lowers your maintenance downtime, ensuring your extraction tools last significantly longer before needing a restoration ritual cycle."
	]
	quest.6FF8291A3D5763F2.quest_subtitle: "Upgrading instrumentation structural limits for high-yield mining lines."
	quest.6FF8291A3D5763F2.title: "Metallurgical Upgrades: The &dIesnium Pickaxe&r"
	quest.708A6EE2B195CBE7.quest_desc: ["The Void Upgrade prevents storage overflow by deleting excess items once the drawer is full. This is useful for automated farms or setups where item buildup would otherwise cause problems."]
	quest.70D56AEE411BBE1B.quest_desc: [
		"To advance further, you must reach beyond the veil into the Otherworld, and Spirit Fire is your gateway."
		""
		"Cast a Demon’s Dream Fruit upon the ground and ignite it to awaken Spirit Fire."
		"This unnatural flame never fades and brings no harm to living beings."
		""
		"When an item is offered to the Spirit Fire, it is purified and reshaped, emerging as its Otherworldly counterpart, revealing what was always hidden from mortal sight."
	]
	quest.70D56AEE411BBE1B.title: "It Burns"
	quest.70FD8C7E6CDE96DF.quest_desc: [
		"This specialized apparatus serves as your primary utility tool for securing mobile entities. It allows you to instantly siphon, store, and transport almost any living creature or hostile monster within a compact, hand-held matrix."
		""
		"Once a target is safely trapped inside, the containment unit retains its internal data footprint. You can easily carry the item across dimensions and right-click the ground elsewhere to flawlessly re-deploy the specimen at a new location. This makes it an invaluable asset for stocking your manual factory pens, populating localized mob farms, or moving specific organic catalysts directly into the center of your active possession circles."
	]
	quest.70FD8C7E6CDE96DF.quest_subtitle: "Capturing and deploying live specimens for logistical or sacrifical transport."
	quest.70FD8C7E6CDE96DF.title: "Biological Containment: &dThe Soul Gem"
	quest.7141C2CA9321B710.quest_desc: [
		"If you want &dDrones&r to harvest your crops and do your work for you, you'll need a few things."
		""
		"First, make yourself a &aProgramming Table&r. This is used to tell your &dDrone&r what you want it to do."
		""
		"Next, you'll want to get your hands on some &bPuzzle Pieces&r, with every step of this process requiring 1 piece each."
		""
		"It's also a good idea to have &bGPS Tools&r handy, as you'll use these to set coordinates for your &dDrone&r instructions."
	]
	quest.7141C2CA9321B710.title: "Do You Wanna Build a Robot?"
	quest.716FF64ACF896D50.quest_desc: [
		"When traveling through the hot &cOvercast Columns&r, you'll notice that the standard grey stone is gone, replaced instead by &cGloomslate&r."
		""
		"This block functions identically to regular &3Sculk Stone&r for all your mining and building needs, but it sports a noticeably darker, muddy brown color."
	]
	quest.716FF64ACF896D50.title: "&cGloomslate"
	quest.71EE6E6BA4C564FE.quest_desc: [
		"As your resource extraction lines scale up, the baseline cycle speeds of standard summoning and infusion matrices quickly become a significant throughput bottleneck in your factory. To eliminate this construction downtime entirely, you can channel the stabilization field of &cSevira's Permanent Confinement&r to manufacture an upgraded &bIesnium Ritual Bowl&r."
		""
		""
		"Deploying this advanced component at the exact geographic center of your pentacle in place of a standard Golden Ritual Bowl radically overhauls the matrix's energetic throughput."
		""
		"The exotic alloys within the bowl sharply accelerate the dimensional tearing process, drastically compressing the operational window of all active ceremonies down to a mere one-fourth of their original execution time. This serves as an essential upgrade for establishing rapid, high-yield automation loops in your late-game processing rooms."
	]
	quest.71EE6E6BA4C564FE.quest_subtitle: "Maximizing ceremony cycle speeds through advanced metallurgical anchors."
	quest.71EE6E6BA4C564FE.title: "Acceleration MAtrix: &bIesnium Ritual Bowls&r"
	quest.71FCF06A98CC66D7.quest_desc: [
		"With so many colonists working for the greater good it can be difficult to know who needs what. The clipboard is an easy way to see all the requests your workers have."
		""
		"&eSneak + right-click&r on your town hall block to register the clipboard."
	]
	quest.726A627BD7654E0C.quest_desc: [
		"Upgrading your equipment from &cNetherite&r to &9Warden&r level brings very little change to the overall functionality of these tools."
		""
		"The pickaxe maintains the exact same mining speed and harvest tier as its predecessor."
		""
		"Shovels retain the capability to carve out pathway paths, and hoes can still transform dirt into regular farmland at identical speeds."
		""
		"The single significant improvement is a flat increase to attack damage values across the entire tool set."
		""
		"This combat enhancement means that &9Warden Hoes&r command a higher default damage output than any basic weapon or hoe found in &2&lVanilla&r."
	]
	quest.726A627BD7654E0C.title: "&9Warden&r Tools"
	quest.72BD673DBEBD98B8.quest_desc: [
		"The foundational synthesis required within the matrix of &eEziveus' Spectral Compulsion&r is the creation of Research Fragment Dust. This refined particle compound acts as a vital magical stabilizer, bridging the gap between basic earthly materials and high-tier otherworldly components."
		""
		"Once synthesized, you must combine this dust with crushed emerald particles in a standard crafting grid to manufacture your first batch of &aLime Chalk&r. This specialized colored modifier is strictly mandatory for sketching out the complex, secondary parameters required by advanced pentacle schematics."
	]
	quest.72BD673DBEBD98B8.quest_subtitle: "Your first industrial synthesis inside the infusion matrix."
	quest.72BD673DBEBD98B8.title: "Alchemical Dusts: &bLime Chalk Components"
	quest.72C749AD9F1C634E.quest_desc: [
		"Citizens will go to the Residence they are assigned to at night to sleep. The Residence is also a way to get more citizens for your colony. Every residence level adds another bed. More beds means more citizen capacity."
		""
		"It’s worth considering residence locations and the citizens they house. Workers get grumpy when they have to travel long distances to work. Try to move citizens into homes close to where they work. "
	]
	quest.72C749AD9F1C634E.quest_subtitle: "Build a Residence"
	quest.72D44434DD3E5DB5.quest_desc: [
		"The advanced upgrade adds filters to control what can be swapped."
		""
		"It also enables a configurable keybind that swaps in the appropriate tool based on the block or entity the player is looking at - especially useful for right-click tools like wrenches from other mods."
	]
	quest.72E3BA59807C4464.quest_desc: [
		"Securing the full spectrum of colored modifiers and foundation inks marks your transition into an elite echelon of arcane engineering. With your logistics labs fully stocked, you are finally cleared to layout the pinnacle formulation of the second &dDemon-less&r discipline: &dRonaza's Contact&r. This ultimate ceremony stands as the definitive capstone matrix of the entire modpack, requiring a flawless, synchronized deployment of every geometric principle you have integrated thus far."
		""
		"By drawing raw, unfiltered energy directly from the cosmic architecture rather than filtering it through a bound spirit, the circle bypasses standard physical limits entirely. While the immense structural strain placed on the local spatial grid restricts this matrix to highly specialized, low-frequency usage, the resulting transmutations yield unparalleled endgame assets and reality-bending machinery that completely eclipse all previous technology lines."
	]
	quest.72E3BA59807C4464.quest_subtitle: "Operationalizing the complete runic spectrum for absolute reality realignment."
	quest.72E3BA59807C4464.title: "The Grand Unified Matrix: &dRonaza's Contract&r"
	quest.72EC845C19645AFC.quest_desc: [
		"&3Sculk Vines&r act exactly like the &4Weeping Vines&r you see in the Nether, just completely mutated by sculk."
		""
		"You can spot them hanging from the ceilings while exploring through the lush &bBlooming Caverns&r or traveling deep into the &9Deeplands&r."
	]
	quest.72EC845C19645AFC.title: "&3Sculk Vines"
	quest.730B24765F5AEAC4.quest_desc: [
		"Automatically destroys items that match its filter criteria, preventing unwanted items from accumulating."
		""
		"The regular upgrade filters by item and provides 9 filter slots."
	]
	quest.7327E90A53630AA8.quest_desc: [
		"Expanding upon the tool-maintenance mechanics introduced by &aStrigeor's Higher Binding&r, the advanced matrix of &cSevira's Permanent Confinement&r can be configured to execute a comprehensive item restoration loop powered by a bound Afrit entity."
		""
		"While lower-tier setups are strictly limited to scribing tools, this advanced stabilization field can handle heavy machinery and elite instrumentation. You can route depleted &eDemon Miners&r, high-tier armor matrices, and advanced harvesting tools directly into the circle to completely restore them to 100% operational durability."
		""
		"The alchemical cleansing process operates with perfect fidelity. All targeted assets retain their complete array of modifications—including custom apotheosis affixes, deep enchantments, and specialized metadata profiles—ensuring zero data loss or property degradation during the restoration cycle."
	]
	quest.7327E90A53630AA8.quest_subtitle: "Deploying High-tier fire elentals to completely reverse tool and machinery degradation."
	quest.7327E90A53630AA8.title: "Total Restoration: &cSevira's Permanent Confinement&r"
	quest.7333E2A32FC534C0.quest_desc: ["Legends say this eye once belonged to one of the great Sandworms."]
	quest.7333E2A32FC534C0.quest_subtitle: "Found in Desert Pyramid chests"
	quest.736F4A43EEBDD7B3.quest_desc: [
		"Don't let their size fool you; &3Sculk Snappers&r are tiny but incredibly angry little monsters."
		""
		"I've spotted them lurking around the dark tunnels of the &9Deeplands&r and hidden inside the lush &cBlooming Caverns&r."
		""
		"They are pretty easy to take out since they only have 6 &4Hearts&r of health, and defeating them rewards you with a handy drop of &3Soul Dust&r."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/dnd_snapper.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.736F4A43EEBDD7B3.title: "&3Sculk Snapper"
	quest.73A75FEFDFB27A5C.quest_desc: [
		"Cheap, ranged transportation."
		""
		"Runs on &oyour&r energy (hunger)."
		""
		"Has three upgrade slots, one weapon slot, a chest's worth of storage."
	]
	quest.73A75FEFDFB27A5C.quest_subtitle: "Da Vinci, is that you?"
	quest.73E91712D4D9A762.quest_desc: [
		"The &aMinigun&r will shoot &bMinigun Ammo&r using compressed air by holding right-click."
		""
		"Sneak click the Minigun to insert up to 4 &bMinigun Ammo&r boxes, which can be combined with a potion to apply its effects on hit."
		""
		"You can install several useful upgrades to the &aMinigun&r in the charging station to improve its functionality!"
	]
	quest.7426E1EAF756D6F1.quest_desc: ["Craft 16 Mosaic Terracotta + 8 Patterned Glass."]
	quest.7426E1EAF756D6F1.title: "Mosaic Master"
	quest.743D7D9204915A13.quest_subtitle: "Bury Your First Citizen"
	quest.74A9EF50A3AF2516.quest_desc: ["The Copper Upgrade increases the storage capacity of a drawer by &68x&r. It serves as an early-game upgrade option for expanding storage without large material costs."]
	quest.74C114D0C0D4D374.quest_desc: ["Remember in the beginning how it seemed that everyone was sick with Influenza and you had to keep feeding everyone carrots and potatoes? With the hospital built, they can go see the doctor and get cured by the Healer. You or the colony still needs to supply the ingredients."]
	quest.74C114D0C0D4D374.quest_subtitle: "Build a Hospital"
	quest.75599A9909C7A8C8.quest_desc: ["Citizens need to eat in order to work. Until you have a restaurant and a steady supply of food, you will need to put a few pieces of food in their inventory. They’ll eat when they are hungry."]
	quest.758C88E21B0B2EC7.quest_desc: [
		"Provides a built-in crafting grid accessible from the backpack’s upgrade tab."
		""
		"Keeps items in the grid even when the backpack is closed."
	]
	quest.75AD0CEBC1335915.quest_desc: [
		"The &dReactor Controller&r is the heart of the reactor. When a reactor is formed, you can right-click the terminal to open up the reactor interface."
		""
		"Depending on if it is a &9Passively Cooled&r or an &eActively Cooled&r reactor, the interface will change. Passively Cooled reactors are used to produce power directly by burning fuel. Actively Cooled Reactors use the heat created to vaporize the coolant, which is then sent into a Turbine to create power."
		""
		"In the interface of a passive reactor, you can see and toggle the status and waste ejection. You'll also see the temps, how much FE/t the reactor is producing, and how much fuel the reactor is burning per tick."
	]
	quest.75C1D01E43C37768.quest_desc: ["Simple Magnets adds Magnets that pickup Items and Experience around the player! Magnets can be configured with a whitelist or blacklist and have up to an 5 blocks range! Magnets can also be used in Baubles or Curios slots! Magnets can also be toggled with a key bind!"]
	quest.75CBFD0F90772359.quest_desc: [
		"Cliches aside, the tavern should be a high priority building in the early game for several reasons. A tavern can house four colonists. Exactly the number that spawned when you created your village. "
		""
		"After completing the tavern, visitors will stop by to hang out in hopes of being recruited into your colony. You can recruit these visitors by giving them the items they request. "
		""
		"You may want to check out their stats before recruiting a visitor because nobody wants to pay too much for a rubbish colonist."
		""
		"&o&8PRO TIP: You can tell a lot about a potential recruit by looking at their boots. Fancy boots, better stats.&r&r"
	]
	quest.75CBFD0F90772359.quest_subtitle: "Build a Tavern"
	quest.75DD345164EE5CD9.quest_desc: [
		"&6High Speed Tracks&r are like &6Reinforced Tracks&r but obviously faster. "
		""
		"They'll need &cTrack Kits&r to help build up speed though! "
		""
		"And careful around corners."
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/rail_speed.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.75DFFE4F17C920DD.quest_desc: ["Craft vanilla Furnace (8 Cobblestone). Surround it with 8 Iron Ingots for 1.25x faster smelting \\& fuel efficiency."]
	quest.75DFFE4F17C920DD.title: "Iron Furnace Start"
	quest.75E8C50DAFC8F952.quest_desc: ["Explore world for Dragon Skeletons (randomly placed). Right-click empty hand to harvest (20% skull drop + bones)."]
	quest.7671AFAA1EFD287F.quest_desc: [
		"To establish a slow, permanent automation loop for the &bAureal&r reserves of your forge, you must acquire two dense &bArcane Crystal Blocks&r, a foundation block of &6Arcane Polished Darkstone&r, and a pinch of volatile &cMundabitur Dust&r."
		""
		"First, anchor the &6Arcane Polished Darkstone&r flat onto the earth, then stack both &bArcane Crystal Blocks&r cleanly upon its top face."
		""
		"Once you have successfully erected this 1x3x1 columnar pillar, strike the blocks directly with your &cMundabitur Dust&r to instantly transmute the frame into a functional &bObelisk&r."
		""
		"You may set these spires directly onto the outer gilded tiles where your pedestals typically rest, allowing the monument to passively siphon power into the &6&lHephaestus Forge&r."
	]
	quest.7671AFAA1EFD287F.title: "&bArcane Crystal Obelisk"
	quest.76CDB88A66B25341.quest_desc: [
		"All the power of a dragon in a single chalk: this is the marvel of the purple chalk. The relationship between spirits and dragons is unclear, but there may definitely be connections."
		""
		"Ah, the energy of the end. But what end? Does an end truly exist? What concludes at the end? Will the end ever come to an end?"
	]
	quest.76CDB88A66B25341.quest_subtitle: "The Dragon Chalk"
	quest.76D579D51AD14D12.quest_desc: [
		"Chalk is the first true instrument of ritual magic, used to inscribe symbols that bind the Otherworld to the physical realm. Without chalk, no ritual circle can be formed, and no summoning may begin."
		""
		"Your journey starts with Impure White Chalk, crafted from Burnt Otherstone and Otherworld Ashes—materials already touched by the Otherworld, but not yet fully awakened."
		""
		"To complete the process, offer the Impure White Chalk to the Spirit Fire. As the flame embraces it, the chalk is purified and reborn as White Chalk, ready to be used in ritual work."
		""
		"With White Chalk in hand, you may finally draw ritual glyphs upon solid ground and take your first deliberate step beyond the veil."
		""
		"{@pagebreak}"
		""
		"Chalks are crafted in multiple tiers, each attuned to increasingly powerful rituals and symbols. Higher-tier chalks are required to draw more complex glyphs, capable of anchoring stronger spirits and energies."
		""
		"A chalk of a higher tier may be used in place of a lower-tier chalk, However, lower-tier chalks cannot substitute for higher ones, as they lack the necessary attunement."
	]
	quest.76D579D51AD14D12.title: "White Chalk"
	quest.76F14C2B866B4EAD.quest_desc: [
		"\"The mysterious &3&lOtherside&r stands as the definitive birthplace of all &3Sculk&r material and &3Sculk creatures&r, including the catastrophic &9&lWarden&r."
		""
		"While exploring means encountering many dangerous, distant cousins of that ancient beast, this dark realm also offers notable advantages."
		""
		"Navigating the terrain provides access to a massive supply of unique building blocks and exotic items, along with an endless abundance of &3Sculk&r patches that can be harvested for massive amounts of &aXP&r."
		""
		"Arm yourself with a high-tier hoe tool and mount your expedition into the heart of the &3&lOtherside&r."
	]
	quest.76F14C2B866B4EAD.title: "The &3Otherside"
	quest.77145113CD5B26FB.quest_desc: [
		"When it comes to powering up your jars, farming Source Berries is a fantastic choice since they produce way more Source energy than most other options."
		""
		"You'll want to watch where you plant them, though: the berries radiate a strange energy that will transform all regular grass or dirt blocks in a 3x3 zone around them into purple Mycelium."
		""
		"If there are any open spaces left empty around the bush, the soil will also start sprouting wild mushrooms out of nowhere."
	]
	quest.77145113CD5B26FB.quest_subtitle: "Source From Food"
	quest.774D61FEFABEFD9A.quest_desc: [
		"Watch out where you step in the &9Deeplands&r, because walking over &3Infested Sculk&r will summon a dangerous mini-boss called a Shriek Worm."
		""
		"These massive underground pests have a giant health pool of 100 &4Hearts&r."
		""
		"If you get too close to one, it will snap out and bite you for a ton of damage."
		""
		"On the bright side, if you run away and put enough distance between you, it will retreat straight back down into the floor."
		""
		"Since they don't drop any rare materials and only reward a tiny bit of &aXP&r, your best bet on the trail is to avoid triggering them entirely."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/dnd_worm.png width:100 height:200 align:center}"
	]
	quest.774D61FEFABEFD9A.title: "Shriek Worm"
	quest.775D176081DD75F5.quest_desc: [
		"Right-clicking on a Turbine Controller when it is fully built will show you the Turbine Interface."
		""
		"Here, you can see all of the stats for the Turbine. "
		""
		"Hovering over each will tell you more info about each one."
		""
		"On the bottom left, you'll have 2 arrows to control the &9Flow Rate&r. "
		""
		"This controls how much heated vapor is pumped into the Turbine. "
		""
		"To know how much you should set this to, check your reactor's &dVapor Production Rate&r as a starting point."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/turbineui.png width:200 height:150 align:center}"
	]
	quest.775D176081DD75F5.title: "Turbine Interface"
	quest.77B5D92A3DB10D86.quest_desc: ["Craft from Poppy flower (found in plains/forests)."]
	quest.78598EB42403C201.quest_desc: ["Craft Trunk (JEI). Place adjacent to Base. Right-click Stained Glass Pane for color."]
	quest.785AC64B477BAC33.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.785AC64B477BAC33.quest_subtitle: "Makes Various Twilight Materials"
	quest.7867436ACD25F7FF.quest_desc: [
		"The black chalk has a composition as rigid as it is supernatural. Mixing the essence of Wither with netherite turns this chalk into an extremely valuable tool."
		""
		"Perfect for the foundation of any pentacle, the power of the black chalk is sufficient to replace any other \"colorless\" chalk."
	]
	quest.7867436ACD25F7FF.title: "Perfect Foundation"
	quest.7870800C28A7E199.quest_desc: [
		"The Chicken Farmer’s Hut is where the Chicken Farmer will raise chickens, collect eggs, and butcher chickens for food. You will have to capture and bring in two chickens to the Chicken Farmer’s Hut, as the Chicken Farmer will not catch and bring in any chickens."
		""
		"The Chicken Farmer will only keep two chickens alive per hut level, so at level 5 they will have ten chickens."
	]
	quest.7870800C28A7E199.quest_subtitle: "Build a Chicken Farmer's Hut"
	quest.788138E50FC2E340.quest_desc: [
		"The &aDictionary Of Spirits&r serves as the foundational codex for &dOccultism&r. Constructing this grimoire is a strict requirement if you intend to advance through any branch of this arcane discipline."
		""
		"While this chapter provides your primary automation roadmap, the physical dictionary contains its own comprehensive, internal reference entries detailing precise geometric schematics, entity behaviors, and advanced lore."
		""
		"Beyond serving as an informative reference guide, the book itself functions as a critical material component in numerous advanced crafting recipes throughout the modpack, making its immediate fabrication mandatory for your logistical progression."
	]
	quest.788138E50FC2E340.title: "Book of &cDeeeemonsssss"
	quest.789BAF2437B1C46B.quest_desc: ["By default, a pipez connection mode is set to input. Sneak + Right Click a pipe to change it's connection mode to extract mode, or again to disconnect an inventory from the system. "]
	quest.78BCED8699ADEDF4.quest_desc: [
		"You can manufacture handy &3Soundproof Glass&r by fusing &3Soul Dust&r straight into normal glass at your crafting table."
		""
		"These custom panes block out noise and vibration exactly like a thick block of wool."
		""
		"If you place a pane of this glass over a noise-detecting &3Sculk Sensor&r or a trap-triggering &3Shrieker&r, they won't be able to hear any sounds you make near them."
		""
		"The best part about using this glass instead of wool is that it's completely see-through, letting you keep an eye on the sensors without accidentally setting them off."
	]
	quest.78BCED8699ADEDF4.title: "&3Soundproof Glass"
	quest.78C10E769AD5BB77.quest_desc: ["Welcome to Immersive Melodies!"]
	quest.78C10E769AD5BB77.title: "The Melody Master's Awakening!"
	quest.78D8F40AA9568511.quest_desc: [
		"The Powered Rolling Machine is much better version of the Manual Rolling Machine."
		""
		"You don't have to keep looking in the machine to craft things and it will automatically craft all of them."
		""
		"The only problem is it needs power!"
	]
	quest.79318ECF8FE19E86.quest_desc: ["Hunt 3 Endermen in the Overworld or End to gather Ender Pearls for future Eyes of Ender and upgrades."]
	quest.79ED7CD1210DFE7B.quest_desc: ["Loot rare Dragon Egg from chests in structures (dungeons, temples, fortresses, bastions, etc.). Hatch on magma blocks, campfires, lava cauldrons, or lava (10 min; shakes/smokes)"]
	quest.79ED7CD1210DFE7B.title: "Dragon Egg Hunt"
	quest.7A3D002083346C50.quest_desc: [
		"Before expanding your operations deeper into &dOccultism&r, you must understand how structural geometric multi-blocks scale. Advanced pentacles are explicitly designed to build directly upon the layout foundations of their predecessors."
		""
		"This backward-compatible blueprint architecture means you do not need to construct separate, individual structures for every single tier of a specific discipline. A single, high-tier summoning circle can seamlessly handle lower-tier actions as well. For example, the advanced &9Fatma's Incentivized Attraction&r layout natively incorporates the footprint of all previous &aFoliot&r and &aDjini&r summoning matrices."
		""
		"To optimize your base layout for future upgrades without needing to constantly tear down walls, it is highly recommended to dedicate four distinct 19x19 floor grids early on. Assign one perimeter block for Summoning, one for Infusion, one for Possession, and a final zone for miscellaneous (Wild and Eldritch) rituals."
	]
	quest.7A3D002083346C50.title: "Geometric Foundations: &dPentacles"
	quest.7A4D535DC0EDFDA8.quest_desc: [
		"Extending your logistical reach beyond your central storage laboratory requires a dedicated sub-spatial data link. You can establish remote access to your active network using either a physical &eStable Wormhole&r terminal or a portable &aStorage Accessor&r remote."
		""
		"To calibrate a &eStable Wormhole&r, shift-right-click your central &dStorage Actuator&r block to lock the terminal's frequency matrix. Once synced, you can deploy the Wormhole block anywhere else in your base to serve as an identical, instantly synchronized physical access terminal."
		""
		"Conversely, the hand-held &aStorage Accessor&r operates as a wireless remote control using the exact same shift-linking mechanic. This mobile interface bypasses traditional physical constraints, allowing you to access, store, and request resources from your network even when exploring entirely separate dimensions."
	]
	quest.7A4D535DC0EDFDA8.title: "Wireless Network Access"
	quest.7A6D9E7DAD77F895.quest_desc: [
		"Those who followed this eye were never seen again; rumors say they found the great city of Atlantis or lost their way trying."
		""
		"Crafted with 1 &bEye of Ender&r, 4 &bCorals&r (bubble, fire, horn, and tube), 2 &bConduits&r, and 2 &bGlow Ink Sacs&r."
		""
		""
		"{image:ftb_quests:textures/gui/ftb_quests/images/er_exotic_eye.png width:160 height:80 align:center}"
	]
	quest.7A9A9ED328B6CE4F.quest_desc: [
		"The yellow chalk, also known as golden chalk, brings a sparkle to the eyes of those who engage in possessions, serving as the main glyph in this type of ritual."
		""
		"Possessions are a variation of summoning, caused by a transformation in geometry and the addition of yellow glyphs, allowing spirits to manifest in bodies (material prisons) different from their usual ones."
	]
	quest.7A9A9ED328B6CE4F.quest_subtitle: "Chalk of Possession"
	quest.7ABCEEC0FCCD145E.quest_desc: [
		"Adds furnace-like functionality to the backpack, with an optional automated variant."
		""
		"The regular upgrade functions like a standard furnace, requiring manual input and output."
	]
	quest.7B0C3AD9F563D069.quest_desc: [
		"A ritual requires more than symbols drawn upon the ground."
		""
		"Each ritual calls for Sacrificial Bowls, used to hold the offerings consumed during the rite. Early rituals require only a small number of these bowls, placed around the ritual space."
		""
		"At the heart of the ritual stands the Golden Sacrificial Bowl. This centerpiece holds the key offering—most often a Bound Book—and anchors the ritual’s power. All other Sacrificial Bowls must be placed within a short distance of it."
		""
		"No ritual is complete without Candles. Any vanilla candle will suffice, though larger candles may be crafted using Tallow, rendered from large animals with a Butcher’s Knife."
		""
		"With the space prepared and offerings placed, the ritual may begin."
	]
	quest.7B0C3AD9F563D069.title: "Ritual Preperations"
	quest.7B30DD6FB76E75A5.quest_desc: [
		"Once you have some &bMolten Plastic&r, you can cool it off by pouring it somewhere into the world and waiting. This will cool into &bPlastic Sheets&r! You can also automate this process using &cHeat Frame Cooling&r."
		""
		"Using the rewards from the previous quest, you should be able to make yourself an &dAmadron Tablet&r. This will allow you to trade on the &bAmadron network&r for all sorts of custom and vanilla villager trades!"
		""
		"Make sure you link it to an inventory by sneak+right-clicking it and enjoy all of the new trades! You'll also want to make sure to keep it charged."
	]
	quest.7B30DD6FB76E75A5.title: "Trading Network"
	quest.7B4AAC741F0A6073.quest_desc: [
		"Every reactor needs &9Reactor Control Rods&r and &9Fuel Rods&r. These control how fuel is inserted into the reactor."
		""
		"The Control Rods are placed on the top face of the reactor. You can also have more than one per reactor, but you must have at least 1. Typically, the more you have, the more fuel the reactor can use and burn. That can mean more overall power, but at the cost of higher burn rates, depending on the setup of your reactor."
		""
		"For every Control Rod, you'll need enough Fuel Rods to extend to the base of the reactor. For example, if your reactor is 5 blocks tall, you'll need 3 Fuel Rods extending from each Control Rod."
		""
		"If you right-click on a Control Rod, you can control how much fuel is burned in the reactor by inserting or retracting the fuel rods. The further that you extend the rods, the less fuel that will be burned."
	]
	quest.7B4AAC741F0A6073.title: "Reactor Control Rods"
	quest.7B5C0D82CF6FAC47.quest_desc: ["The Framed Drawer is a customizable drawer that can be visually styled using different materials. It functions like a normal drawer but allows you to match your storage system to your base design."]
	quest.7B5C6C7360716D32.quest_desc: ["Gather Some Clay"]
	quest.7B5C6C7360716D32.title: "Acquire Clay"
	quest.7B5E2CD676A1A1C4.quest_desc: ["The Baker will craft bread dough, cookie dough, cake dough, and raw pumpkin pie, then bake these in a furnace to create bread, cookies, cakes, and pumpkin pies. They will only do this upon request, whether from the Cook, the postbox, or as a minimum stock in the Warehouse."]
	quest.7B5E2CD676A1A1C4.quest_subtitle: "Build a Bakery"
	quest.7BA97C7B01035978.quest_desc: ["The Pulling Upgrade allows a storage block to automatically extract items from an adjacent inventory. This is ideal for pulling resources directly from machines, chests, or farms into your storage system without manual interaction."]
	quest.7BB9B1E8888BA04F.quest_desc: ["It was lost by a demon in the battle between the Aether and the Nether."]
	quest.7BB9B1E8888BA04F.quest_subtitle: "Found in Nether Fortress chests"
	quest.7C2617969808F086.quest_desc: ["Slapping some &3Transistors&r and &3Capacitors&r on the &dUnassembled PCB&r will make a &bPrinted Circuit Board&r."]
	quest.7C4D8AA107780795.quest_desc: [
		"By using the &aFluidizer&r, we can combine &dBlutonium&r with &eYellorium&r to make &2Verderium."
		""
		"When used as fuel in a reactor, &2Verderium&r produces &cRossinite&r as a reactant. We need this!"
		""
		"To use &2Verderium&r as a fuel, you'll need to make &cFuel Injection Ports&r for your reactor."
		""
		"Note: You might need to empty out the fuel currently in your reactor, or make a new reactor for this purpose. "
	]
	quest.7C4E4793DA887DE4.quest_desc: [
		"Based off of the original mod &eBig Reactors&r, &aExtreme Reactors&r allows you to build customizable multiblock Reactors!"
		""
		"The main element is of course, Uranium. You'll need this and a lot of coal and iron to get building."
		""
		"If you're ever lost along the way, refer to &aThe Extreme Book&r for help! "
	]
	quest.7C4E4793DA887DE4.title: "Welcome to &9Extreme Reactors&r!"
	quest.7CBAA67204CC258C.quest_desc: [
		"While the terrifying &9&lWarden&r relies purely on its physical fists and acoustic blasts, travelers can forge specialized blades and battleaxes from its remains."
		""
		"Both the &9Warden Sword&r and &9Warden Axe&r are constructed by reinforcing their &cNetherite versions&r with a &9Reinforced Echo Shard&r and a &9Warden Upgrade Template&r at a smithing table."
		""
		"Each weapon deals exactly one full &4Heart&r of extra combat damage and boasts a significantly higher durability pool than standard gear."
		""
		"For woodcutting duties, the heavy axe remains completely efficient at chopping down trees."
	]
	quest.7CBAA67204CC258C.title: "&9Warden&r Weapons"
	quest.7CE456D39E602453.quest_desc: [
		"Provides access to a built-in stonecutter through the backpack’s upgrade tab."
		""
		"Remembers the last recipe used."
		""
		"Automatically reselects that recipe when the same input is inserted again."
		""
		"Speeds up stonecutting when processing multiple stacks of the same block."
	]
	quest.7CF04C5CCEE7E612.quest_desc: ["Craft Diamond Ender Chest by surrounding a vanilla Ender Chest with 8 Diamond Blocks for +2 rows (45 slots total)."]
	quest.7D0E2B06547B6F34.quest_desc: ["Craft Label (JEI/REI recipe). Place on storage blocks. Shift+RMB with item to set icon. Click to open chest behind. Dye/Glow/Feather for extras."]
	quest.7D3489901AA47547.quest_desc: [
		"The Town Hall is the central building in your colony. It provides lots of helpful information about your colony such as citizen stats, open work orders, citizen happiness, allies and more. "
		""
		"The settings tab should be a first stop for any new colonist as it contains options for hiring mode, housing assignment mode, and options to allow kids to be born. Also, this is where you can customize your colony flag. Your flag will appear on guard towers and guard shields. "
	]
	quest.7D3489901AA47547.quest_subtitle: "Build the Town Hall"
	quest.7D40B80DBBC4E160.quest_desc: [
		"The Manual Rolling Machine will be your little crafting machine for many things material for railcraft!"
		""
		"When you put the recipe in and it can make more than 1 it will autocraft while you're still looking at it. "
		""
		"When you leave the Rolling Machine while crafting it will abort the crafting and put it in your inventory."
		""
		"You must manually build the last recipe!"
	]
	quest.7D7C4451BEFB77A6.quest_desc: [
		"The Advanced Magnet picks up Items and Experience within a configurable range up to 11 blocks of the player."
		""
		"Items can be filtered with a whitelist or blacklist"
		""
		"Range for both Items and Experience can be individually configured"
	]
	quest.7DD2FC01C4F48E6B.quest_desc: ["The upgrade base is a crafting component used in all basic tier backpack upgrades. "]
	quest.7DF863CC0C2EA7FF.quest_desc: [
		"Templates add special upgrades to your Construction Sticks. To apply a template, combine the stick, template, and an additional item in a Smithing Table."
		""
		"Replacement: Replaces blocks with the block in your off-hand."
	]
	quest.7E07C5A6FA6B6B1F.quest_desc: [
		"Once you've built a fully functional &aReprocessor&r, you can pump in power, water, and &9Cyanite&r to create &dBlutonium&r."
		""
		"This can be used as a fuel for your reactor, and creates its own waste called &9Magentite&r. "
	]
	quest.7E584ACF652D20D6.quest_desc: ["Collect nitro everything!"]
	quest.7E584ACF652D20D6.title: "ALL THE POWER"
	quest.7EA81BFD6BA2439A.quest_desc: ["Craft Gold Ender Chest by surrounding a vanilla Ender Chest with 4 Gold Blocks and 4 gold ingots in an alternating pattern for reinforced void storage."]
	quest.7F4B734CFB0F0306.quest_desc: [
		"These new &7Carts&r are similar to the special &2Vanilla&r &7Carts&r. "
		""
		"The &7Minecart with a Tank&r will hold and move any Liquid held in it. "
		""
		"The &7Minecart with an Energy cell&r will instead hold and move Energy!"
	]
	quest.7F4B734CFB0F0306.title: "Carts"
	quest.7FA4BA8484EEDAFF.quest_desc: [
		"The advanced upgrade offers 16 filter slots and supports filtering by item, mod, tag, NBT data, and damage values."
		""
		"A configurable option controls whether items inserted manually through the backpack’s GUI are voided—allowing a stack to be added and kept, while still voiding any additional items inserted with automation."
		""
		"Another option allows voiding only when a slot overflows, ensuring at least one stack of the filtered item is retained before excess is destroyed."
	]
	quest.7FBD6FCE3ECF0921.quest_desc: [
		"As your production lines scale, relying on the constant manual consumption of volatile &cDemon's Dream Fruit&r to maintain a fleeting &7Third Eye&r status effect quickly becomes a major bottleneck in your operations."
		""
		"To completely automate your spatial awareness, you must manufacture the &dOtherworld Goggles&r. When equipped—either in a standard armor head slot or nestled directly inside your Curios jewelry matrix—this visor emits a constant, passive resonance field. This grants you permanent, uninterrupted vision into the hidden layers of reality, letting you harvest resources seamlessly without any down-time or dietary requirements."
	]
	quest.7FBD6FCE3ECF0921.quest_subtitle: "Bypassing dietary consumption for permanent extra-dimensional vision."
	quest.7FBD6FCE3ECF0921.title: "Permanent Clarity: &d Otherworldly Goggles&r"
	quest.7FC7DC38E9E5741E.quest_desc: [
		"The utility of these extra-dimensional entities extends far beyond mere ore pulverization."
		""
		"The mod features a robust array of specialized spirits capable of managing entire automated logistical networks—including dedicated transportation thralls to transfer items between containers, tireless lumberjacks to clear timber grids, and precise sorting agents."
		""
		""
		"Additionally, you can channel your resources into manifesting &dFamiliars&r. These minor helper entities follow you throughout your journey, providing powerful passive stat buffs, carrying mobile storage inventories, or actively engaging hostile entities in combat. Consult the dedicated &dFamiliar Rituals&r tab inside your guidebook to evaluate the unique mechanical traits of each available companion."
	]
	quest.7FC7DC38E9E5741E.title: "My Familiars"
	quest.7FF3EA602FE7A546.quest_desc: [
		"The specialized &3Sculk Transmitter&r stands as a rare artifact discovered exclusively within the treasure chests of the &6Ancient Temple&r."
		""
		"Once recovered, this mechanical device becomes a vital tool for long-range logistics."
		""
		"To initialize the device, you must shift-right-click any functional block equipped with an internal interface, such as storage chests, crafting workbenches, or furnaces."
		""
		"This action permanently binds the device to that specific block."
		""
		"Once calibrated, the tool allows you to remotely access and manage that storage menu from any distance across the world."
		""
		"To clear the memory matrix and unbind the block, simply shift-right-click into the open air while holding the tool."
	]
	quest.7FF3EA602FE7A546.title: "&3Sculk Transmitter"
